(86678, 3282, 92, '<td valign="top">My kind of subject ! I have such a weakness for this type of thing. I would love to see this done early one morning or really late one afternoon without any shadows or bright sun so that you get a clean photo with deep rich colors:)</td>', 'My kind of subject ! I have such a weakness for this type of thing. I would love to see this done early one morning or really late one afternoon without any shadows or bright sun so that you get a clean photo with deep rich colors:)', '2002-07-15 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86679, 3282, 1759, '<td valign="top">Kind of a postcard view. Nice composition, I''m glad that you got the whole tree in the shot. It would be a little better if the lighting were such that there were no shadow in front. It makes it difficult to see the door and detail in the wood work.</td>', 'Kind of a postcard view. Nice composition, I''m glad that you got the whole tree in the shot. It would be a little better if the lighting were such that there were no shadow in front. It makes it difficult to see the door and detail in the wood work.', '2002-07-15 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
