(87465, 3317, 933, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo. Thats said, one of the first things I noticed was the grain in the sky.  Seems kind of pixelated.  Sure enough, the photo was too highly compressed.  File size is 19k.  You can submit photos up to 150k.  Less compression would probably have fixed the sky and brought out the colors a bit more.  If you have questions about jpg compresssion, please ask in the forums or check out the help section at DPC.</td>', 'This is a very nice photo. Thats said, one of the first things I noticed was the grain in the sky.  Seems kind of pixelated.  Sure enough, the photo was too highly compressed.  File size is 19k.  You can submit photos up to 150k.  Less compression would probably have fixed the sky and brought out the colors a bit more.  If you have questions about jpg compresssion, please ask in the forums or check out the help section at DPC.', '2002-07-15 03:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
