(84495, 3151, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really nice sunset.  Too bad you couldn''t spot touch up, the green sun flare in the upper branches of the bush on the right isn''t a good thing.  8 Swash</td>', 'Really nice sunset.  Too bad you couldn''t spot touch up, the green sun flare in the upper branches of the bush on the right isn''t a good thing.  8 Swash', '2002-07-18 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
