(84497, 3151, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good color.  I like the glare.  I love the silhouette of the trees, and the lamp post is the cherry on top. The only thng I find....um...not really wrong, but inconsistant, is the little bit of green about 2/3rds of the way from the lamp to the edge on the right.  Dosen''t look like foliage since all the other branches are bare.  I must deduct for this.  Otherwise I like this a lot.</td>', 'Good color.  I like the glare.  I love the silhouette of the trees, and the lamp post is the cherry on top. The only thng I find....um...not really wrong, but inconsistant, is the little bit of green about 2/3rds of the way from the lamp to the edge on the right.  Dosen''t look like foliage since all the other branches are bare.  I must deduct for this.  Otherwise I like this a lot.', '2002-07-19 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84498, 3151, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice sunrise.  the sillhouette of something less busy than all the branches would''ve been preferrable to me, but there may not have been anything around.  i like the lamppost, however, it does show that your horizon isn''t quite level because the post is slightly leaving to the left. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'nice sunrise.  the sillhouette of something less busy than all the branches would''ve been preferrable to me, but there may not have been anything around.  i like the lamppost, however, it does show that your horizon isn''t quite level because the post is slightly leaving to the left. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-07-19 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84499, 3151, 2428, '<td valign="top">Even tough all the elements are there, a fine sun, nice contrast, the tree is interesting... I still feel there''s something missing, it doesn''t generate anything in me.</td>', 'Even tough all the elements are there, a fine sun, nice contrast, the tree is interesting... I still feel there''s something missing, it doesn''t generate anything in me.', '2002-07-19 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
