(84629, 3158, 811, '<td valign="top">Great job!  The only suggestion I would have is to crop it closer to the lightening, so that the viewer doesn''t wander around in the picture looking that the red lights, and other such stuff.  Nice colors!</td>', 'Great job!  The only suggestion I would have is to crop it closer to the lightening, so that the viewer doesn''t wander around in the picture looking that the red lights, and other such stuff.  Nice colors!', '2002-07-21 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84630, 3158, 2, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would work _really_ well as a panoramic, with less sky at the top and less dark ground as well.  The color range is wonderful here, though.  I love your title, too.</td>', 'I think this shot would work _really_ well as a panoramic, with less sky at the top and less dark ground as well.  The color range is wonderful here, though.  I love your title, too.', '2002-07-22 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
