(84632, 3158, 714, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo.  This is something I would love to hang on my wall.  Really!  Good job.<br/>:)</td>', 'I really love this photo.  This is something I would love to hang on my wall.  Really!  Good job.:)', '2002-07-22 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(84634, 3166, 1897, '<td valign="top">What is your subject here?  If you like the scenic, shoot the scenic.  If yuo what a portrait, move in and get close.  If you want a full body shoot, shoot vertically, and and do not cut of the feet.  This is a grainy poorly composed snap shot as it stands.</td>', 'What is your subject here?  If you like the scenic, shoot the scenic.  If yuo what a portrait, move in and get close.  If you want a full body shoot, shoot vertically, and and do not cut of the feet.  This is a grainy poorly composed snap shot as it stands.', '2002-07-15 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84635, 3166, 889, '<td valign="top">you over sharpened too much or started with too small an original. Between the sharpening and the flash she looks pasted in. This would have been an interesting shot during the advertising challenge.</td>', 'you over sharpened too much or started with too small an original. Between the sharpening and the flash she looks pasted in. This would have been an interesting shot during the advertising challenge.', '2002-07-15 03:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84636, 3166, 327, '<td valign="top">Real nice work. Pretty girl, pretty sky, good light on her face. I would only of liked to see her feet in the shot. All in all I like this.</td>', 'Real nice work. Pretty girl, pretty sky, good light on her face. I would only of liked to see her feet in the shot. All in all I like this.', '2002-07-15 05:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84637, 3166, 1330, '<td valign="top">Off center but good</td>', 'Off center but good', '2002-07-15 06:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84638, 3166, 772, '<td valign="top">The girl is definitely cute, but I think this image would have more artistic value and more impact if she was not in the image.  Her presence turns this photo into a snapshot, where as it would have more artistic impact without her.  The sunset and clouds look nice :) = 4 - jmsetzler</td>', 'The girl is definitely cute, but I think this image would have more artistic value and more impact if she was not in the image.  Her presence turns this photo into a snapshot, where as it would have more artistic impact without her.  The sunset and clouds look nice :) = 4 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-15 07:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84639, 3166, 1175, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl.  Not the greatest sunset though.  You should have just gotten closer to the girl.</td>', 'Pretty girl.  Not the greatest sunset though.  You should have just gotten closer to the girl.', '2002-07-15 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84640, 3166, 2058, '<td valign="top">Good shot, and nice colors.  I like the pose of the model too.  Only suggestions I have are a bit tighter crop, and more sharpness.  There are a lot of jpeg artifacts.</td>', 'Good shot, and nice colors.  I like the pose of the model too.  Only suggestions I have are a bit tighter crop, and more sharpness.  There are a lot of jpeg artifacts.', '2002-07-15 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84641, 3166, 1779, '<td valign="top">very nice (and sexy) the flash could be softer though...</td>', 'very nice (and sexy) the flash could be softer though...', '2002-07-15 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84642, 3166, 2091, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot, A little grainy though....</td>', 'Nice Shot, A little grainy though....', '2002-07-15 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84643, 3166, 2, '<td valign="top">Putting pretty girls in your photos is unfair to me as wanna-be-unbiased viewer, and yet I cannot bring myself to complain. :)  I really like the contrast you''ve set up.  Her jeans seem jagged on the edges -- not sure if that''s oversharpening or a result of adjusting the levels to get that dark background.</td>', 'Putting pretty girls in your photos is unfair to me as wanna-be-unbiased viewer, and yet I cannot bring myself to complain. :)  I really like the contrast you''ve set up.  Her jeans seem jagged on the edges -- not sure if that''s oversharpening or a result of adjusting the levels to get that dark background.', '2002-07-15 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84644, 3166, 1323, '<td valign="top">More zoom and less jpeg compression would help</td>', 'More zoom and less jpeg compression would help', '2002-07-15 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
