(84696, 3167, 327, '<td valign="top">Fits the _texture_  and _fear_ challenge too. Nice shot and good color. Would of like to see the bottom cropped more but nice shot. Kee</td>', 'Fits the _texture_  and _fear_ challenge too. Nice shot and good color. Would of like to see the bottom cropped more but nice shot. Kee', '2002-07-15 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84697, 3167, 1779, '<td valign="top">great definition...</td>', 'great definition...', '2002-07-15 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84698, 3167, 92, '<td valign="top">You''ve really pushed your limits on this one. The clarity, DOF, color and crop are all perfect. I like being able to see you in it''s eye. It just adds to the whole picture:) = 10 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'You''ve really pushed your limits on this one. The clarity, DOF, color and crop are all perfect. I like being able to see you in it''s eye. It just adds to the whole picture:) = 10 Shiiizzzam', '2002-07-15 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84699, 3167, 308, '<td valign="top">The detail of this is great and creates a photo that gathers a response from me (I''m afraid!).  Would have worked well for the fear challenge, I bet.  Is that your reflection in the eyes?  You''re braver than I am!</td>', 'The detail of this is great and creates a photo that gathers a response from me (I''m afraid!).  Would have worked well for the fear challenge, I bet.  Is that your reflection in the eyes?  You''re braver than I am!', '2002-07-15 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
