(84704, 3167, 1041, '<td valign="top">very cool.  really like the composition and the selective DOF.  also fun to see your reflection in the snake''s eye.  my top 5 this week -- gr8photos (10)</td>', 'very cool.  really like the composition and the selective DOF.  also fun to see your reflection in the snake''s eye.  my top 5 this week -- gr8photos (10)', '2002-07-15 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
