(84723, 3167, 2111, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2002-07-17 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84724, 3167, 1255, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. I like the crop on the shot, although it would be nice to see a bit more of his head.  I know it''s hard sometimes though with the shots needing to be a specific dimesion for entry.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. I like the crop on the shot, although it would be nice to see a bit more of his head.  I know it''s hard sometimes though with the shots needing to be a specific dimesion for entry.', '2002-07-17 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84725, 3167, 668, '<td valign="top">good  would be even better with teeth</td>', 'good  would be even better with teeth', '2002-07-17 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84726, 3167, 1202, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like snakes, but you captured this one about as well as I have seen.   Good job! Composition10,<br/>Technical Aspects10,<br/>Meets Challenge10,<br/>Originality9,<br/>Average Score10,<br/>Autool.<br/></td>', 'I really don''t like snakes, but you captured this one about as well as I have seen.   Good job! Composition10,Technical Aspects10,Meets Challenge10,Originality9,Average Score10,Autool.', '2002-07-17 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84727, 3167, 1707, '<td valign="top">good picture!  It would be cool to see the tongue too.</td>', 'good picture!  It would be cool to see the tongue too.', '2002-07-18 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84728, 3167, 772, '<td valign="top">what can i say?  this is an excellent image... great composition and subject material... I even *like* the reflection of the photographer in the snake''s eye :)  good shot! = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'what can i say?  this is an excellent image... great composition and subject material... I even *like* the reflection of the photographer in the snake''s eye :)  good shot! = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-18 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84729, 3167, 885, '<td valign="top">Eeww.  I don''t like snakes too much, but this is an excellent composition with lovely depth of field and colors.  I''m so sad you''re in the photograph as a reflection in his eye :)  The good news is that you could probably clone it out (afterwards) without too much trouble, and probably most people wont notice...</td>', 'Eeww.  I don''t like snakes too much, but this is an excellent composition with lovely depth of field and colors.  I''m so sad you''re in the photograph as a reflection in his eye :)  The good news is that you could probably clone it out (afterwards) without too much trouble, and probably most people wont notice...', '2002-07-18 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84730, 3167, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really nice face shot.  Needs more depth of field for this close.  I like how you appear in the snake''s eye.  Great color!  8 Swash</td>', 'Really nice face shot.  Needs more depth of field for this close.  I like how you appear in the snake''s eye.  Great color!  8 Swash', '2002-07-18 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84731, 3167, 2586, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Like the way you cropped this image; makes it very interesting.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Like the way you cropped this image; makes it very interesting.', '2002-07-18 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84732, 3167, 1280, '<td valign="top">I love all animals so this is appealing.  I just can''t help wondering if this was in captivity? Well executed.</td>', 'I love all animals so this is appealing.  I just can''t help wondering if this was in captivity? Well executed.', '2002-07-19 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84733, 3167, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wow. Nice shot.</td>', 'Wow. Nice shot.', '2002-07-19 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84734, 3167, 2802, '<td valign="top">i like the subject</td>', 'i like the subject', '2002-07-20 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84735, 3167, 2783, '<td valign="top">I''d be willing to bet money this one wins. Getting this close to a deadly snake (I''m assuming its deadly) and getting the colors just right, It deserves a:<br/>-9</td>', 'I''d be willing to bet money this one wins. Getting this close to a deadly snake (I''m assuming its deadly) and getting the colors just right, It deserves a:-9', '2002-07-20 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84736, 3167, 2634, '<td valign="top">too close for me!  Interesting pict.</td>', 'too close for me!  Interesting pict.', '2002-07-20 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84737, 3167, 2815, '<td valign="top">Scary</td>', 'Scary', '2002-07-20 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84738, 3167, 835, '<td valign="top">Great focus but I''m, personaly, not a fan of the way it is cropped.  I would like to see a bit more of the head.</td>', 'Great focus but I''m, personaly, not a fan of the way it is cropped.  I would like to see a bit more of the head.', '2002-07-20 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84739, 3167, 2079, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo, This is one of my favorites for this challenge. Great color, excellent angle, it clearly shows its enormous size. Nice clear focus, I can actually see you in the snakes eye. The green in the background and the brown on the ground give the feeling of a natural habitat. (I like it). 9</td>', 'Awesome photo, This is one of my favorites for this challenge. Great color, excellent angle, it clearly shows its enormous size. Nice clear focus, I can actually see you in the snakes eye. The green in the background and the brown on the ground give the feeling of a natural habitat. (I like it). 9', '2002-07-20 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84740, 3167, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good angle to get an unusual "pose." Nice reflection too -- check out The Mirror Project if you haven''t already...</td>', 'Good angle to get an unusual "pose." Nice reflection too -- check out The Mirror Project if you haven''t already...', '2002-07-20 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84741, 3167, 811, '<td valign="top">To be honest -- voting on thumbnail.  hate snakes.  don''t want to see full-size.  two extra points just ''cause I won''t look at it.  (would''ve gotten a 10 from me in the fear challenge.)  I think I''m going to pass out now, it downloaded before i could finish commenting.  *shudder* karmat</td>', 'To be honest -- voting on thumbnail.  hate snakes.  don''t want to see full-size.  two extra points just ''cause I won''t look at it.  (would''ve gotten a 10 from me in the fear challenge.)  I think I''m going to pass out now, it downloaded before i could finish commenting.  *shudder* karmat', '2002-07-20 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84742, 3167, 2752, '<td valign="top">great shot and composition</td>', 'great shot and composition', '2002-07-20 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84743, 3167, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice macro but perhaps a little too tight for my taste.  Still a good shot though. 7-ClubJuggle</td>', 'Nice macro but perhaps a little too tight for my taste.  Still a good shot though. 7-ClubJuggle', '2002-07-21 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84744, 3167, 2428, '<td valign="top">with a different crop, it would have been excellent for the texture challenge.</td>', 'with a different crop, it would have been excellent for the texture challenge.', '2002-07-21 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84745, 3167, 472, '<td valign="top">this picture rules</td>', 'this picture rules', '2002-07-21 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84746, 3167, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Personally, I wish the reflection of the person wasn''t in the eye -- but I''m sure you have otehr people telling you they like it -- so what do I know.  I hate snakes -- but I have this morbid curiosity to capture them on film.  During a recent trip to the zoo, I managed to capture a rattlesnake yawning -- the pictures weren''t very good cauz I was kinda freaking out.  Anyway -- good lighting, nice back and foregrounds.  good composition with the snake.  If the tongue had been out, now that would have added the icing to the cake.  :-)</td>', 'Nicely done.  Personally, I wish the reflection of the person wasn''t in the eye -- but I''m sure you have otehr people telling you they like it -- so what do I know.  I hate snakes -- but I have this morbid curiosity to capture them on film.  During a recent trip to the zoo, I managed to capture a rattlesnake yawning -- the pictures weren''t very good cauz I was kinda freaking out.  Anyway -- good lighting, nice back and foregrounds.  good composition with the snake.  If the tongue had been out, now that would have added the icing to the cake.  :-)', '2002-07-22 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84747, 3167, 2667, '<td valign="top">very nice shot of reptilian stoicism (new title?) and is''nt that your reflection in his eye? neat.</td>', 'very nice shot of reptilian stoicism (new title?) and is''nt that your reflection in his eye? neat.', '2002-07-22 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84748, 3167, 2310, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments!  This python is my pet and only about 3.5 feet long and will not bite - I was safe the entire time!  Personally I like my reflection in his eye...I had to crop it so tight because his tail is looped around him near his head and it looked horrible until I cropped it out...</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments!  This python is my pet and only about 3.5 feet long and will not bite - I was safe the entire time!  Personally I like my reflection in his eye...I had to crop it so tight because his tail is looped around him near his head and it looked horrible until I cropped it out...', '2002-07-22 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(84751, 3171, 1907, '<td valign="top">Lighting issues</td>', 'Lighting issues', '2002-07-15 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84752, 3171, 2011, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this pic alot, but I wish the girl was a little more in focus</td>', 'I like the concept of this pic alot, but I wish the girl was a little more in focus', '2002-07-15 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84753, 3171, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice... and your going to kill me but, isn''t a bit bright?</td>', 'nice... and your going to kill me but, isn''t a bit bright?', '2002-07-15 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84754, 3171, 1005, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot.  It''s always hard for me to "see" the difference between soft focus and out of focus/grainy.  To me, the bright light through the window is too bright, so the little girl is heavily shadowed.  The upper part of the window frame seems too clear for soft focus filters that I have seen.  I still like this photo.  Let''s go 7 Swash</td>', 'A lovely shot.  It''s always hard for me to "see" the difference between soft focus and out of focus/grainy.  To me, the bright light through the window is too bright, so the little girl is heavily shadowed.  The upper part of the window frame seems too clear for soft focus filters that I have seen.  I still like this photo.  Let''s go 7 Swash', '2002-07-15 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84755, 3171, 92, '<td valign="top">This would be so cool if you sprayed water on the window like a gentle rain. I like that:)</td>', 'This would be so cool if you sprayed water on the window like a gentle rain. I like that:)', '2002-07-15 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84756, 3171, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice light.....very nice. Focus could of been improved but this is nice.  Kee</td>', 'Nice light.....very nice. Focus could of been improved but this is nice.  Kee', '2002-07-15 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84757, 3171, 1572, '<td valign="top">I love the colors that the leaves ''tint'' the rest of the picture.  Nice effect.  If I had to shoot it over I would try for just a smidge less glare.  Maybe wait a little later in the day.  :)  8</td>', 'I love the colors that the leaves ''tint'' the rest of the picture.  Nice effect.  If I had to shoot it over I would try for just a smidge less glare.  Maybe wait a little later in the day.  :)  8', '2002-07-15 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84758, 3171, 1280, '<td valign="top">It''s ok...but lacking something...not sure what.</td>', 'It''s ok...but lacking something...not sure what.', '2002-07-16 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84759, 3171, 2058, '<td valign="top">Nice composition... I think the brighness is a bit overpowering though... maybe a black and white version would work well</td>', 'Nice composition... I think the brighness is a bit overpowering though... maybe a black and white version would work well', '2002-07-16 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84760, 3171, 2661, '<td valign="top">this is a really pretty shot. oh how I wish it were focused better. this picture conjures up so many memories from my own childhood. I love it. Cute kid too. That''s always a plus.</td>', 'this is a really pretty shot. oh how I wish it were focused better. this picture conjures up so many memories from my own childhood. I love it. Cute kid too. That''s always a plus.', '2002-07-16 03:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84761, 3171, 2152, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been an effective shot if you silhouetted the girl and had the window properly exposed.  Also, the focus is off.</td>', 'I think this could have been an effective shot if you silhouetted the girl and had the window properly exposed.  Also, the focus is off.', '2002-07-16 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84762, 3171, 1019, '<td valign="top">Evocative photo of childhood</td>', 'Evocative photo of childhood', '2002-07-16 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84763, 3171, 1041, '<td valign="top">i bet this was a hard one to take, the contrast between the bright sunshine outside and the boy inside is a lot, and camera''s have a hard time handling that.  i like the concept of the photo, but i think i would like to see it taken when it''s not so bright outside or there''s more light inside so i can make out the boy a little more.  picture also seems a tad soft. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'i bet this was a hard one to take, the contrast between the bright sunshine outside and the boy inside is a lot, and camera''s have a hard time handling that.  i like the concept of the photo, but i think i would like to see it taken when it''s not so bright outside or there''s more light inside so i can make out the boy a little more.  picture also seems a tad soft. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-16 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84764, 3171, 2261, '<td valign="top">Its too light outside and too dull inside, although it is difficult to shot through windows.</td>', 'Its too light outside and too dull inside, although it is difficult to shot through windows.', '2002-07-16 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84765, 3171, 409, '<td valign="top">I love this blurry effect! very eerie..   sort of hopeful and melancholy.</td>', 'I love this blurry effect! very eerie..   sort of hopeful and melancholy.', '2002-07-16 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84766, 3171, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept on this one but the exposure is a touch too hot for me.. :) = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I really like the concept on this one but the exposure is a touch too hot for me.. :) = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84767, 3171, 878, '<td valign="top">I know that you were going for the soft focus with this shot however, I think its a little too soft.  The shadows are a little noisy too.  I like the light through the leaves.</td>', 'I know that you were going for the soft focus with this shot however, I think its a little too soft.  The shadows are a little noisy too.  I like the light through the leaves.', '2002-07-17 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84768, 3171, 245, '<td valign="top">the soft feel and colors are wonderful, but the framing or angle of the window throws me off, it feels cramped.</td>', 'the soft feel and colors are wonderful, but the framing or angle of the window throws me off, it feels cramped.', '2002-07-17 05:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
