(84914, 3183, 772, '<td valign="top">nice shot!  The composition here is excellent... The lighting is a little bright to suit my tastes.. I have photographed flowers in the past and found that an overcast day or some amount of shade on teh flower helps the ''punch'' quite a bit :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice shot!  The composition here is excellent... The lighting is a little bright to suit my tastes.. I have photographed flowers in the past and found that an overcast day or some amount of shade on teh flower helps the ''punch'' quite a bit :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-17 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84915, 3183, 2334, '<td valign="top">really, this looks strange</td>', 'really, this looks strange', '2002-07-17 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84916, 3183, 671, '<td valign="top">I like your cropping on this.</td>', 'I like your cropping on this.', '2002-07-17 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84917, 3183, 1748, '<td valign="top">a bit washed outbut poppies always get to me</td>', 'a bit washed outbut poppies always get to me', '2002-07-17 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84918, 3183, 2481, '<td valign="top">VERY nice; contrasts of color, texture and shape; translucent and transparent areas in the petals; nice detail in the flower center; even the tiny bit of green in the upper left works.</td>', 'VERY nice; contrasts of color, texture and shape; translucent and transparent areas in the petals; nice detail in the flower center; even the tiny bit of green in the upper left works.', '2002-07-18 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84919, 3183, 2111, '<td valign="top">looks larger than true life 6</td>', 'looks larger than true life 6', '2002-07-18 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84920, 3183, 527, '<td valign="top">This is very well done. It has all of the right elements, vivid color, exceptional composition, the right amount of contrast, and even an abstract element.<br/><br/>10  -Tim J</td>', 'This is very well done. It has all of the right elements, vivid color, exceptional composition, the right amount of contrast, and even an abstract element.10  -Tim J', '2002-07-18 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84921, 3183, 587, '<td valign="top">very interesting. Mother nature always was a fan of abstracts :) Except for that small, minute slice of green in upper left I''d say it''s perfect :)  great job. 10 cthenk</td>', 'very interesting. Mother nature always was a fan of abstracts :) Except for that small, minute slice of green in upper left I''d say it''s perfect :)  great job. 10 cthenk', '2002-07-18 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84922, 3183, 2785, '<td valign="top">A fairly sharp and well defined macro. A bit too much free space. a tighter crop would have worked more effectively IMO.</td>', 'A fairly sharp and well defined macro. A bit too much free space. a tighter crop would have worked more effectively IMO.', '2002-07-18 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84923, 3183, 1280, '<td valign="top">good...bright, bold, rich, good depth.</td>', 'good...bright, bold, rich, good depth.', '2002-07-19 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84924, 3183, 1031, '<td valign="top">Unusual colors, nice detail.</td>', 'Unusual colors, nice detail.', '2002-07-19 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84925, 3183, 2777, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. I like soft focus as well.</td>', 'I like the composition. I like soft focus as well.', '2002-07-19 06:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84926, 3183, 2752, '<td valign="top">great colors and composition</td>', 'great colors and composition', '2002-07-20 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84927, 3183, 2789, '<td valign="top">Great Macro.  Looks like a tart.</td>', 'Great Macro.  Looks like a tart.', '2002-07-21 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84928, 3183, 1759, '<td valign="top">This is the closest I''ve been to a poppy and it does indeed make for a nice composition. Wonderful color and texture, and tack sharp too. Well done!</td>', 'This is the closest I''ve been to a poppy and it does indeed make for a nice composition. Wonderful color and texture, and tack sharp too. Well done!', '2002-07-21 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84929, 3184, 2724, '<td valign="top">The sky and the wooden posts add something really special to this.  The framing and angles are superb.</td>', 'The sky and the wooden posts add something really special to this.  The framing and angles are superb.', '2002-07-15 04:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84930, 3184, 133, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and clear.</td>', 'Very sharp and clear.', '2002-07-15 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84931, 3184, 2004, '<td valign="top">Wonderful ! Excellent colors and composition ! But... can''t you remove the little buoy on the bottom right of the picture ? My top 10 this week.</td>', 'Wonderful ! Excellent colors and composition ! But... can''t you remove the little buoy on the bottom right of the picture ? My top 10 this week.', '2002-07-15 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84932, 3184, 117, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2002-07-15 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84933, 3184, 1779, '<td valign="top">wow!</td>', 'wow!', '2002-07-15 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84934, 3184, 2261, '<td valign="top">Good shot, like the blues.</td>', 'Good shot, like the blues.', '2002-07-15 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84935, 3184, 573, '<td valign="top">Ooo! another postcard landscape  :-)<br/>Early morning, I''d guess, verry well done.  One of my top picks this challenge.</td>', 'Ooo! another postcard landscape  :-)Early morning, I''d guess, verry well done.  One of my top picks this challenge.', '2002-07-15 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84936, 3184, 2477, '<td valign="top">Serene, restful, beautiful ... good job</td>', 'Serene, restful, beautiful ... good job', '2002-07-15 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84937, 3184, 327, '<td valign="top">Super nice shot. My only negitive comment would be the life preserver to the right you could of cropped it out. Over all well done, good shot. Kee</td>', 'Super nice shot. My only negitive comment would be the life preserver to the right you could of cropped it out. Over all well done, good shot. Kee', '2002-07-15 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84938, 3184, 142, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image.  The only thing I would change is to crop the life saver ring and a little of the left side.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image.  The only thing I would change is to crop the life saver ring and a little of the left side.', '2002-07-15 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84939, 3184, 1572, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - I love all of the blue, it really sets the mood.   Could be early morn as well.  9</td>', 'Beautiful - I love all of the blue, it really sets the mood.   Could be early morn as well.  9', '2002-07-15 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84940, 3184, 1831, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, very calming "9" Dogman ;-)</td>', 'Nice photo, very calming "9" Dogman ;-)', '2002-07-15 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84941, 3184, 689, '<td valign="top">This is one I would hang on the wall. Great job. I would crop out the life preserver on the right of the image ... and maybe get a guy in a boat or even a nice bird ... but somethings you cant control! Def a 9.</td>', 'This is one I would hang on the wall. Great job. I would crop out the life preserver on the right of the image ... and maybe get a guy in a boat or even a nice bird ... but somethings you cant control! Def a 9.', '2002-07-15 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84942, 3184, 92, '<td valign="top">The lifesaver needs to be in or out but not both. I''m thinking a angle down the pier would work great ! I love the calm feel of this and the blue tones.</td>', 'The lifesaver needs to be in or out but not both. I''m thinking a angle down the pier would work great ! I love the calm feel of this and the blue tones.', '2002-07-15 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84943, 3184, 1543, '<td valign="top">oooh!  beautiful colors!</td>', 'oooh!  beautiful colors!', '2002-07-15 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84944, 3184, 1877, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, I would have moved the camera more to the left, get that life tube thingie out of the shot as well as push that pole more to the right. :) 6</td>', 'beautiful colors, I would have moved the camera more to the left, get that life tube thingie out of the shot as well as push that pole more to the right. :) 6', '2002-07-16 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84945, 3184, 656, '<td valign="top">moody lighting works well in this.  It is always slightly disconcerting to see a skewed horizon when it is only slighty skewed. <br/><br/>Would be more ''lonely'' without the boat on the left, and the bouy on the right</td>', 'moody lighting works well in this.  It is always slightly disconcerting to see a skewed horizon when it is only slighty skewed. Would be more ''lonely'' without the boat on the left, and the bouy on the right', '2002-07-16 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84946, 3184, 1856, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great composition.  I love this.  I only wish the sun was over the hills straight ahead.  9 Lisa</td>', 'Wow!  Great composition.  I love this.  I only wish the sun was over the hills straight ahead.  9 Lisa', '2002-07-16 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84947, 3184, 1658, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel of the shot.  I''m not sure I can isolate exactly why, but it is a nice shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like the feel of the shot.  I''m not sure I can isolate exactly why, but it is a nice shot.  Nicely done.', '2002-07-16 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84948, 3184, 748, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it better by framing the shot to eliminate the closest pole and the life thingy, but a nice shot.</td>', 'I would have liked it better by framing the shot to eliminate the closest pole and the life thingy, but a nice shot.', '2002-07-16 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84949, 3184, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''d have preferred it without that half lifebuoy on the right and with the pole slightly closer to the edge.</td>', 'I''d have preferred it without that half lifebuoy on the right and with the pole slightly closer to the edge.', '2002-07-16 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84950, 3184, 1003, '<td valign="top">beautiful sky</td>', 'beautiful sky', '2002-07-16 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84951, 3184, 1880, '<td valign="top">Nice composition ... The life perserver is a little distracting ... Good lighting to catch the mood ... Nice focus for the lighting used ...  8 ... RLS</td>', 'Nice composition ... The life perserver is a little distracting ... Good lighting to catch the mood ... Nice focus for the lighting used ...  8 ... RLS', '2002-07-17 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84952, 3184, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice job maintaining some texture and detail in the clouds and mountains under low light. Looks like there could have been a great sunset too.</td>', 'Nice job maintaining some texture and detail in the clouds and mountains under low light. Looks like there could have been a great sunset too.', '2002-07-17 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84953, 3184, 1042, '<td valign="top">This is so calming. I''m not sure if it''s the blue color or just the fact that I love water. Very nice shot. 9- KDJohnson</td>', 'This is so calming. I''m not sure if it''s the blue color or just the fact that I love water. Very nice shot. 9- KDJohnson', '2002-07-17 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84954, 3184, 2650, '<td valign="top">the colors are absolutely gorgeous. i would wallpaper my room with this.</td>', 'the colors are absolutely gorgeous. i would wallpaper my room with this.', '2002-07-17 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84955, 3184, 2256, '<td valign="top">This is REALLY great, from the boats at the end of the dock to the tiny bit of red in the sky...</td>', 'This is REALLY great, from the boats at the end of the dock to the tiny bit of red in the sky...', '2002-07-17 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
