(84986, 3184, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Love the poles'' silhouettes and the touch of definition to the pier.  Kind of wish there was either a little bit more color in the sky from the sunset to add some other colors, or a little less to make it all blue.  The only thing I really find my eye repeatedly going back to in a bad way is the life-preserver.  I don''t know what you''d do with it though -- crop it out and you''re too close to the pole, put it in and you lose the nice composition you have.</td>', 'Nice image.  Love the poles'' silhouettes and the touch of definition to the pier.  Kind of wish there was either a little bit more color in the sky from the sunset to add some other colors, or a little less to make it all blue.  The only thing I really find my eye repeatedly going back to in a bad way is the life-preserver.  I don''t know what you''d do with it though -- crop it out and you''re too close to the pole, put it in and you lose the nice composition you have.', '2002-07-21 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
