(84999, 3187, 1041, '<td valign="top">while there''s nothing wrong technically with this shot, it''s just not too exciting for me.  the moon is rather small in comparison to the rest of the shot (yes, i do realize that the moon is a looong way away from earth) and therefore is easily lost.  even though the clouds frame it nicely. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'while there''s nothing wrong technically with this shot, it''s just not too exciting for me.  the moon is rather small in comparison to the rest of the shot (yes, i do realize that the moon is a looong way away from earth) and therefore is easily lost.  even though the clouds frame it nicely. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-17 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
