(85007, 3187, 1175, '<td valign="top">Great color in the sky, but if thats the best lens you have you should avoid submitting pictures of the moon.  you need a lens with a larger focal length, maybe a telescope, I''m not familiar with taking pictures of the moon.  But you need something to make that moon larger.</td>', 'Great color in the sky, but if thats the best lens you have you should avoid submitting pictures of the moon.  you need a lens with a larger focal length, maybe a telescope, I''m not familiar with taking pictures of the moon.  But you need something to make that moon larger.', '2002-07-19 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
