(85018, 3187, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here, and the simplicity.  The clouds form a nice lower and upper fram as well.  However, I almost lost the moon my first time looking.  Unless you have a telescope or really good zoom, I think pictures of the moon are hard to do well.</td>', 'I like the colors here, and the simplicity.  The clouds form a nice lower and upper fram as well.  However, I almost lost the moon my first time looking.  Unless you have a telescope or really good zoom, I think pictures of the moon are hard to do well.', '2002-07-21 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85019, 3187, 2126, '<td valign="top">Bigger moon next time</td>', 'Bigger moon next time', '2002-07-21 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85020, 3187, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice framing job with the clouds.  The hard part of shooting moon shots is getting it big enough -- people at my work don''t seem to get that -- you pretty much need some incredible equipment to pull it off well.  I think that''s the biggest problem, the moon just isn''t large enough in this shot.  It''s supposed to be the center of attention, but it gets lost in all the blue.</td>', 'Nice framing job with the clouds.  The hard part of shooting moon shots is getting it big enough -- people at my work don''t seem to get that -- you pretty much need some incredible equipment to pull it off well.  I think that''s the biggest problem, the moon just isn''t large enough in this shot.  It''s supposed to be the center of attention, but it gets lost in all the blue.', '2002-07-21 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85021, 3188, 1944, '<td valign="top">A little dim.</td>', 'A little dim.', '2002-07-15 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85022, 3188, 889, '<td valign="top">yay someone did a sensible black and white.</td>', 'yay someone did a sensible black and white.', '2002-07-15 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85023, 3188, 2719, '<td valign="top">And stopping time.</td>', 'And stopping time.', '2002-07-15 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85024, 3188, 2, '<td valign="top">I really like the framing of this shot, and I believe the soft blur is intentional -- but the jpeg compression is pretty noticable.  I''d save this at higher quality.  Good shot overall.</td>', 'I really like the framing of this shot, and I believe the soft blur is intentional -- but the jpeg compression is pretty noticable.  I''d save this at higher quality.  Good shot overall.', '2002-07-15 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85025, 3188, 1005, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  (Joke:  did the camera move to the left?)  I wish I had something more positive for you, but I can''t muster it.  4 Swash</td>', 'Too dark.  (Joke:  did the camera move to the left?)  I wish I had something more positive for you, but I can''t muster it.  4 Swash', '2002-07-15 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85026, 3188, 436, '<td valign="top">Look at the train shot in this challenge.  You need more variation in light and dark.  Pages should be a crisper white.  Did you use two light sources?</td>', 'Look at the train shot in this challenge.  You need more variation in light and dark.  Pages should be a crisper white.  Did you use two light sources?', '2002-07-15 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
