(85045, 3188, 811, '<td valign="top">This may not make sense, but I like the distance this picture has.  I guess because it spills out of the top and left, so you can''t really read what it is and the bw makes it seem moody.  The viewer is there, but not there.  he can see it, but can''t experience it.</td>', 'This may not make sense, but I like the distance this picture has.  I guess because it spills out of the top and left, so you can''t really read what it is and the bw makes it seem moody.  The viewer is there, but not there.  he can see it, but can''t experience it.', '2002-07-21 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85046, 3188, 1078, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the idea, but the B&amp;W needs a little bit of a levels adjustment I think.  This is so grey -- it needs some differentiation between white and blacks and middle values.</td>', 'I like the composition and the idea, but the B&W needs a little bit of a levels adjustment I think.  This is so grey -- it needs some differentiation between white and blacks and middle values.', '2002-07-22 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85047, 3192, 1360, '<td valign="top">Out of all the cliche''d flower pics, this one I think is my favorite.</td>', 'Out of all the cliche''d flower pics, this one I think is my favorite.', '2002-07-15 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85048, 3192, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice shot. I do think the composition could of been improved. The leaf in the front is the least interesting. Your tones are okay I just would of liked them a bit lighter or with more contrast. Over all I like this shot. Kee</td>', 'Pretty nice shot. I do think the composition could of been improved. The leaf in the front is the least interesting. Your tones are okay I just would of liked them a bit lighter or with more contrast. Over all I like this shot. Kee', '2002-07-15 05:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85049, 3192, 2618, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen this in colour rather than B/W.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen this in colour rather than B/W.', '2002-07-15 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85050, 3192, 1779, '<td valign="top">very, very nice...</td>', 'very, very nice...', '2002-07-15 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85051, 3192, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is sooo nice.  I love these water cupped shots.  I would have been tempted to center on one leaf, but this is a really nice view.  Color looked bad?  (I really like color...)  8 Swash</td>', 'This is sooo nice.  I love these water cupped shots.  I would have been tempted to center on one leaf, but this is a really nice view.  Color looked bad?  (I really like color...)  8 Swash', '2002-07-15 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85052, 3192, 2373, '<td valign="top">How could you not title this photo, Its a great photo!!</td>', 'How could you not title this photo, Its a great photo!!', '2002-07-15 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85053, 3192, 737, '<td valign="top">Nice. I''d also like to see this in color.</td>', 'Nice. I''d also like to see this in color.', '2002-07-15 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85054, 3192, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very delicately photographed and processed. I love the tonality you''ve achieved with the B/W conversion.</td>', 'Very delicately photographed and processed. I love the tonality you''ve achieved with the B/W conversion.', '2002-07-15 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85055, 3192, 1859, '<td valign="top">Interesting why you chose to remove the color from this photo.  It seems to me that it would have worked much better in color.</td>', 'Interesting why you chose to remove the color from this photo.  It seems to me that it would have worked much better in color.', '2002-07-15 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85056, 3192, 806, '<td valign="top">The water looks silver in this photo! I like this. I just wish the leaf in the foreground wasn''t so prominent. I keep wanting to push it out of my way! ;0)</td>', 'The water looks silver in this photo! I like this. I just wish the leaf in the foreground wasn''t so prominent. I keep wanting to push it out of my way! ;0)', '2002-07-15 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85057, 3192, 1572, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  How do you get your water to shine?  I tried this on a shot and it didn''t bead up OR shine like this.  karen_v</td>', 'Very nice!  How do you get your water to shine?  I tried this on a shot and it didn''t bead up OR shine like this.  karen_v', '2002-07-15 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85058, 3192, 2700, '<td valign="top">we have some of those plan</td>', 'we have some of those plan', '2002-07-16 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85059, 3192, 656, '<td valign="top">not sure the B&amp;W helps on this - the contrast is quite soft.  Perhaps not enough light on the area that''s been focused on.  Could be interesting to isolate just one leaf/ water and have that as the only thing in the frame ?</td>', 'not sure the B&W helps on this - the contrast is quite soft.  Perhaps not enough light on the area that''s been focused on.  Could be interesting to isolate just one leaf/ water and have that as the only thing in the frame ?', '2002-07-16 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85060, 3192, 1569, '<td valign="top">I really think this would have been better in color.Maybe if you punch up the contrast.</td>', 'I really think this would have been better in color.Maybe if you punch up the contrast.', '2002-07-16 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85061, 3192, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot, but it seems to be begging for color.  the black and white seems to flatten out the contrast quite a bit... = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting shot, but it seems to be begging for color.  the black and white seems to flatten out the contrast quite a bit... = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85062, 3192, 2261, '<td valign="top">I like b/w shots but this just dosen''t work for me.</td>', 'I like b/w shots but this just dosen''t work for me.', '2002-07-16 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85063, 3192, 1667, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see the water drop in the front leaf.  Still a very nice pic.</td>', 'I would have loved to see the water drop in the front leaf.  Still a very nice pic.', '2002-07-17 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85064, 3192, 889, '<td valign="top">this might have looked better in color.</td>', 'this might have looked better in color.', '2002-07-17 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85065, 3192, 2111, '<td valign="top">i love it except for the grey 4</td>', 'i love it except for the grey 4', '2002-07-17 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85066, 3192, 2717, '<td valign="top">Rain or did you place the water.  I think I would like color.</td>', 'Rain or did you place the water.  I think I would like color.', '2002-07-17 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85067, 3192, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very very interesting. - really cool - I''m going out on a limb and suggesting more contrast/white - a little too grey for me--or just a little more zing.  Otherwise really excellent work!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Very very interesting. - really cool - I''m going out on a limb and suggesting more contrast/white - a little too grey for me--or just a little more zing.  Otherwise really excellent work!Ruthann', '2002-07-17 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85068, 3192, 668, '<td valign="top">excelent.  maybe a bit more contrast/saturation</td>', 'excelent.  maybe a bit more contrast/saturation', '2002-07-17 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85069, 3192, 2668, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the color version with its deep greens and the water would''ve made it a bit more lively.  Nice affect though.</td>', 'Great shot, the color version with its deep greens and the water would''ve made it a bit more lively.  Nice affect though.', '2002-07-17 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85070, 3192, 1202, '<td valign="top">We''ve seen a lot of water drops here but yours are special.   Superb contrast and clarity.  I agree a good picture don''t need a stinkin title. Composition9,<br/>Technical Aspects9,<br/>Meets Challenge9,<br/>Originality9,<br/>Average Score9,<br/>Autool.<br/></td>', 'We''ve seen a lot of water drops here but yours are special.   Superb contrast and clarity.  I agree a good picture don''t need a stinkin title. Composition9,Technical Aspects9,Meets Challenge9,Originality9,Average Score9,Autool.', '2002-07-17 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85071, 3192, 1707, '<td valign="top">light loves the water</td>', 'light loves the water', '2002-07-18 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85072, 3192, 2123, '<td valign="top">I hate to say this, cause I''m sure you had a reason for shooting it in B&amp;W, but I really would have liked to see this one in color :-) 6</td>', 'I hate to say this, cause I''m sure you had a reason for shooting it in B&W, but I really would have liked to see this one in color :-) 6', '2002-07-19 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85073, 3192, 2472, '<td valign="top">I missed color in this theme</td>', 'I missed color in this theme', '2002-07-19 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85074, 3192, 2370, '<td valign="top">it might have looked better in color instead??</td>', 'it might have looked better in color instead??', '2002-07-19 04:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85075, 3192, 2777, '<td valign="top">Nice color balance</td>', 'Nice color balance', '2002-07-19 07:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85076, 3192, 2109, '<td valign="top">I bet this looks nice in color</td>', 'I bet this looks nice in color', '2002-07-19 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85077, 3192, 842, '<td valign="top">beautiful. I like the contrast.</td>', 'beautiful. I like the contrast.', '2002-07-19 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85078, 3192, 2801, '<td valign="top">Why B&amp;W?</td>', 'Why B&W?', '2002-07-20 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
