(85140, 3196, 2661, '<td valign="top">A really nice landscape. The clouds are simply breathtaking. I also like the way that the ruins hint at human existance, but the landscape still looks so pristine. EXCELLENT.</td>', 'A really nice landscape. The clouds are simply breathtaking. I also like the way that the ruins hint at human existance, but the landscape still looks so pristine. EXCELLENT.', '2002-07-16 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
