(85148, 3196, 2111, '<td valign="top">4</td>', '4', '2002-07-17 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85149, 3196, 2703, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, color and use of subject matter (trees and rock) to offset what could have been ''just another landscape''.  I am not sure what I should focus on as the subject (trees or rock). I find my eyes bouncing back and forth. My natural tendency is to move from left to right so I might have cropped out the trees on the left (though you could do the opposite and remove the rock). I might also have cropped out about half the grass to give more drama to the sky.</td>', 'Nice depth of field, color and use of subject matter (trees and rock) to offset what could have been ''just another landscape''.  I am not sure what I should focus on as the subject (trees or rock). I find my eyes bouncing back and forth. My natural tendency is to move from left to right so I might have cropped out the trees on the left (though you could do the opposite and remove the rock). I might also have cropped out about half the grass to give more drama to the sky.', '2002-07-17 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85150, 3196, 1856, '<td valign="top">I love the cloud perspective.  I wish you had had a polarized lens for this...would have made a great surreal image.  Really nice composition. 7 Lisa</td>', 'I love the cloud perspective.  I wish you had had a polarized lens for this...would have made a great surreal image.  Really nice composition. 7 Lisa', '2002-07-17 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
