(85176, 3197, 889, '<td valign="top">this seems silly but next time maybe try rotating the picture a little so the pond doenst appear to be draining off to the left of the frame.</td>', 'this seems silly but next time maybe try rotating the picture a little so the pond doenst appear to be draining off to the left of the frame.', '2002-07-17 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85177, 3197, 2172, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  There is something that isn''t quite right - to me that is.  I don''t care for the overexposed bench and surrounding dirt - it is distracting and takes away from the rest of the photo - wonder what it looks like in b/w or with a different dof?   Anyway - still a good composed photo.  Nice work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Nice composition.  There is something that isn''t quite right - to me that is.  I don''t care for the overexposed bench and surrounding dirt - it is distracting and takes away from the rest of the photo - wonder what it looks like in b/w or with a different dof?   Anyway - still a good composed photo.  Nice work.Ruthann', '2002-07-17 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85178, 3197, 917, '<td valign="top">Its OK as a picture of places you''ve been to, but as a picture in its own right, the landscape here is a bit uninteresting.</td>', 'Its OK as a picture of places you''ve been to, but as a picture in its own right, the landscape here is a bit uninteresting.', '2002-07-19 07:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85179, 3197, 2777, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting.</td>', 'Poor lighting.', '2002-07-19 08:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85180, 3197, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice placement o the bench within the frame, and an ok view, too.  would be nicer if it was more green, but i know that''s outside of your control.  what''s inside your control (potentially) is the lighting.  the shadow from the bench is quite harsh.  was there a way of taking this in the late afternoon or early morning to have softer light (and maybe even a colorful sky depending on whether you are facing the right way?) -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'nice placement o the bench within the frame, and an ok view, too.  would be nicer if it was more green, but i know that''s outside of your control.  what''s inside your control (potentially) is the lighting.  the shadow from the bench is quite harsh.  was there a way of taking this in the late afternoon or early morning to have softer light (and maybe even a colorful sky depending on whether you are facing the right way?) -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-07-19 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85181, 3197, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is nice, a touch "plain", but nice.  Seems serene enough, but I don''t think I would enjoy staring at the dirt hill in the background.  7 Swash</td>', 'This is nice, a touch "plain", but nice.  Seems serene enough, but I don''t think I would enjoy staring at the dirt hill in the background.  7 Swash', '2002-07-19 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
