(85245, 3210, 2639, '<td valign="top">is that... hair??</td>', 'is that... hair??', '2002-07-15 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85246, 3210, 806, '<td valign="top">When I saw this quickly in the thumbnail, I thought it was fire! Interesting perspective.</td>', 'When I saw this quickly in the thumbnail, I thought it was fire! Interesting perspective.', '2002-07-15 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85247, 3210, 2, '<td valign="top">This is a really amazing picture, and the only thing I''m trying to figure out if I like is the pure-white highlights in the hair.  If it wasn''t necessary to make your whole background white, I''d tone down the highlights in her hair just a tad.  They make parts of the image seem very harsh, where the flowing hair is very smooth and calming.  The shapes and colors of her hair, though, really make for an outstanding, original shot.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is a really amazing picture, and the only thing I''m trying to figure out if I like is the pure-white highlights in the hair.  If it wasn''t necessary to make your whole background white, I''d tone down the highlights in her hair just a tad.  They make parts of the image seem very harsh, where the flowing hair is very smooth and calming.  The shapes and colors of her hair, though, really make for an outstanding, original shot.  Nice job.', '2002-07-15 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85248, 3210, 2661, '<td valign="top">Well, I like the shot. I just can''t figure out what it is. Looks like a mass of hair like a wig or something, but could also be a small furry animal.</td>', 'Well, I like the shot. I just can''t figure out what it is. Looks like a mass of hair like a wig or something, but could also be a small furry animal.', '2002-07-16 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85249, 3210, 2004, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good composition, but two remarks : 1. why is it cropped on the right ? and 2. I don''t like to over-exposure of the subject, texture would be better with a little less eposition IMHO</td>', 'Good idea, good composition, but two remarks : 1. why is it cropped on the right ? and 2. I don''t like to over-exposure of the subject, texture would be better with a little less eposition IMHO', '2002-07-16 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85250, 3210, 2456, '<td valign="top">like the different colours and the shine of the hair. Would like to see a contrast to the background...</td>', 'like the different colours and the shine of the hair. Would like to see a contrast to the background...', '2002-07-16 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85251, 3210, 1042, '<td valign="top">My daughter was viewing this with me and we thought it was flames when we saw the thumbnail. Then found out it was hair?  right? I love the white space around this and the flamelike quality of her/his? hair.Gosh...I''m hoping I''m right on this and it''s really hair...:P Pretty cool pic..  8 - KDJohnson</td>', 'My daughter was viewing this with me and we thought it was flames when we saw the thumbnail. Then found out it was hair?  right? I love the white space around this and the flamelike quality of her/his? hair.Gosh...I''m hoping I''m right on this and it''s really hair...:P Pretty cool pic..  8 - KDJohnson', '2002-07-16 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
