(85263, 3210, 2337, '<td valign="top">This is one that is probably much better than I can apprieciate.  I''m bothered by things you probably did on purpose (and your probably the one that''s right) but the way the hair is cut off on the right, the harsh near the bottom and all that wide open space at the top all hurt it for me.  But that''s a matter of taste. ~ Qyl 5</td>', 'This is one that is probably much better than I can apprieciate.  I''m bothered by things you probably did on purpose (and your probably the one that''s right) but the way the hair is cut off on the right, the harsh near the bottom and all that wide open space at the top all hurt it for me.  But that''s a matter of taste. ~ Qyl 5', '2002-07-18 02:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85264, 3210, 885, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked this better if it were the red hair on the completely white background, but if you''d done it without having to way overexpose the whole thing.</td>', 'I''d have liked this better if it were the red hair on the completely white background, but if you''d done it without having to way overexpose the whole thing.', '2002-07-18 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85265, 3210, 587, '<td valign="top">This is great. I think the title fits it exactly ;)  I wish all her hair could have made it in the shot, and the few remains of the face still visible were gone. Either case this is a great photo. Good job. 8 cthenk</td>', 'This is great. I think the title fits it exactly ;)  I wish all her hair could have made it in the shot, and the few remains of the face still visible were gone. Either case this is a great photo. Good job. 8 cthenk', '2002-07-18 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85266, 3210, 1005, '<td valign="top">Honestly kinda tossed on this one.  This is a really cool representation of fire.  Some parts seem too bright, especially the background, but the hair effect is sooo cool.  Extra cool points!  9 Swash</td>', 'Honestly kinda tossed on this one.  This is a really cool representation of fire.  Some parts seem too bright, especially the background, but the hair effect is sooo cool.  Extra cool points!  9 Swash', '2002-07-18 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
