(85273, 3210, 715, '<td valign="top">Very impressive photo.  The simplicity of colors and the composition is superb.<br/>I''m pretty sure you gonna get a lot of comments about the "hair-cut" at the right edge. Well, here''s another one: I like it!  I think the subject would look kind of lost in the white space if it wasn''t for the cut-off.<br/></td>', 'Very impressive photo.  The simplicity of colors and the composition is superb.I''m pretty sure you gonna get a lot of comments about the "hair-cut" at the right edge. Well, here''s another one: I like it!  I think the subject would look kind of lost in the white space if it wasn''t for the cut-off.', '2002-07-19 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85274, 3210, 2801, '<td valign="top">Hair? Interesting.</td>', 'Hair? Interesting.', '2002-07-20 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85275, 3210, 2783, '<td valign="top">AHH!!! THE 80''S ARE BACK!!! NO!!! <br/>Just kidding! the only real problem I notice is It''s simply way too bright<br/>Keep up the good work: -7</td>', 'AHH!!! THE 80''S ARE BACK!!! NO!!! Just kidding! the only real problem I notice is It''s simply way too brightKeep up the good work: -7', '2002-07-20 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85276, 3210, 741, '<td valign="top">Love the negative space.  Would have been a 10 if you hadn''t clipped the rhs!</td>', 'Love the negative space.  Would have been a 10 if you hadn''t clipped the rhs!', '2002-07-20 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85277, 3210, 2172, '<td valign="top">Different and creative.  Cool image.  I like this a lot.  Great work!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Different and creative.  Cool image.  I like this a lot.  Great work!Ruthann', '2002-07-20 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85278, 3210, 2317, '<td valign="top">Nice idea<br/></td>', 'Nice idea', '2002-07-20 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85279, 3210, 835, '<td valign="top">I like the effect but I would prefer a different crop to it.  I don''t like the top right of the hair to be cut off.</td>', 'I like the effect but I would prefer a different crop to it.  I don''t like the top right of the hair to be cut off.', '2002-07-20 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85280, 3210, 1031, '<td valign="top">I hope your model didn''t get whiplash!</td>', 'I hope your model didn''t get whiplash!', '2002-07-20 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85281, 3210, 2752, '<td valign="top">very dramatic and good composition</td>', 'very dramatic and good composition', '2002-07-21 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85282, 3210, 472, '<td valign="top">looks odd... i wonder what this would have looked like not overexposed?</td>', 'looks odd... i wonder what this would have looked like not overexposed?', '2002-07-21 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85283, 3210, 811, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  I like the white background, but I think it feels a little too chopped off on the far right.  If more was cropped/framed out, it might feel intentional to me, because I think this picture would also look good with a wide left "margin" and "flowing" out of the frame on the right.</td>', 'Very interesting.  I like the white background, but I think it feels a little too chopped off on the far right.  If more was cropped/framed out, it might feel intentional to me, because I think this picture would also look good with a wide left "margin" and "flowing" out of the frame on the right.', '2002-07-21 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85284, 3210, 2188, '<td valign="top">Is this hair still attached? I can''t tell!</td>', 'Is this hair still attached? I can''t tell!', '2002-07-22 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85285, 3210, 255, '<td valign="top">What kind of placement is this? Jeez. This photo got a 9 from me (can''t believe I forgot to come back and comment on it). The only thing that kept it from being a 10 is that I wish that I could have seen just a *hint* more of her facial structure, but who cares, it is still an awesome photo and should be in the top rankings!</td>', 'What kind of placement is this? Jeez. This photo got a 9 from me (can''t believe I forgot to come back and comment on it). The only thing that kept it from being a 10 is that I wish that I could have seen just a *hint* more of her facial structure, but who cares, it is still an awesome photo and should be in the top rankings!', '2002-07-22 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(85286, 3210, 656, '<td valign="top">Some comments :  It is hair (not a wig, not an animal!) and it''s a shot of my wife, lying on a white board.  About the right hand side truncation - that''s where her shoulders are...  I know a lot of people hated it, but it was required for the shot.<br/><br/>also the exposure - again required to ''white out'' the skin of the face.</td>', 'Some comments :  It is hair (not a wig, not an animal!) and it''s a shot of my wife, lying on a white board.  About the right hand side truncation - that''s where her shoulders are...  I know a lot of people hated it, but it was required for the shot.also the exposure - again required to ''white out'' the skin of the face.', '2002-07-22 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 0);
