(85413, 3219, 2172, '<td valign="top">Lovin'' it.  Really great.   Only one small thing.  Whatever material is under the dice, is a little scratchy and distracting.  If it was perfectly smooth, it would truly be an awesome photo.  But I still like this very much.  Great Work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Lovin'' it.  Really great.   Only one small thing.  Whatever material is under the dice, is a little scratchy and distracting.  If it was perfectly smooth, it would truly be an awesome photo.  But I still like this very much.  Great Work.Ruthann', '2002-07-20 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85414, 3219, 2317, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.... i like the light filtering.. and the shadow effects</td>', 'Nice idea.... i like the light filtering.. and the shadow effects', '2002-07-20 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85415, 3219, 1031, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it''s a good thing when the pips on the SIDES add up to seven...</td>', 'I don''t think it''s a good thing when the pips on the SIDES add up to seven...', '2002-07-20 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85416, 3219, 2752, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2002-07-20 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85417, 3219, 2810, '<td valign="top">Like the b/w, but slightly distracted by too many holes in the bottom.  Good focus on the die.</td>', 'Like the b/w, but slightly distracted by too many holes in the bottom.  Good focus on the die.', '2002-07-21 03:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85418, 3219, 472, '<td valign="top">baby needs a new pair of shoes.  i like this.  i think i saw something similar on photosig - maybe that was yours also .. i would suggest slightly reducing the intensiity of the lights behind the collander, or using a little more fill. nice shot</td>', 'baby needs a new pair of shoes.  i like this.  i think i saw something similar on photosig - maybe that was yours also .. i would suggest slightly reducing the intensiity of the lights behind the collander, or using a little more fill. nice shot', '2002-07-21 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85419, 3219, 2835, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT PICTURE.</td>', 'EXCELLENT PICTURE.', '2002-07-21 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85420, 3219, 1078, '<td valign="top">Saw a similar shot over at Photosig -- don''t think it''s your work -- the dice look different.  As silly as this will sound, it looks like you had a hair on the negative -- over on the left hand die at the top.  The light coming out of the foreground holes is just a little too hot -- like the way it looks on the ones in the back better.  I''m also gonna be picky in a stupid way.  I know you meant for the 4 and 3 that point toward the camera to indicate the lucky number 7.  But one of the dice actually has either a 6 or a 1 pointed up, and the other hase either a 5 or a 2.  So this roller rolled either, 3, 6, 8, or 11.  :-)  Like I said being honery just for the sake of it.  :-)</td>', 'Saw a similar shot over at Photosig -- don''t think it''s your work -- the dice look different.  As silly as this will sound, it looks like you had a hair on the negative -- over on the left hand die at the top.  The light coming out of the foreground holes is just a little too hot -- like the way it looks on the ones in the back better.  I''m also gonna be picky in a stupid way.  I know you meant for the 4 and 3 that point toward the camera to indicate the lucky number 7.  But one of the dice actually has either a 6 or a 1 pointed up, and the other hase either a 5 or a 2.  So this roller rolled either, 3, 6, 8, or 11.  :-)  Like I said being honery just for the sake of it.  :-)', '2002-07-21 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85421, 3220, 2058, '<td valign="top">A pretty nice shot.  Too bad you missed the bee :)  They can be hard to catch, I know, I''ve tried.  I think if you had used a different angle, the picture would be a bit more interesting.  Try taking one that looks down the center of the flower maybe.</td>', 'A pretty nice shot.  Too bad you missed the bee :)  They can be hard to catch, I know, I''ve tried.  I think if you had used a different angle, the picture would be a bit more interesting.  Try taking one that looks down the center of the flower maybe.', '2002-07-15 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85422, 3220, 1897, '<td valign="top">semi interesting, not very sharp, and the exposure and saturation could be better.</td>', 'semi interesting, not very sharp, and the exposure and saturation could be better.', '2002-07-15 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85423, 3220, 2202, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I love the contrasting colors.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I love the contrasting colors.', '2002-07-15 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
