(85426, 3220, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Too bad about the bee, adds extra element/intest etc.  A little less reflection off the petal might have been nice for a deeper, richer color.  9 Swash</td>', 'Great shot!  Too bad about the bee, adds extra element/intest etc.  A little less reflection off the petal might have been nice for a deeper, richer color.  9 Swash', '2002-07-15 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
