(85608, 3229, 2317, '<td valign="top">Cute shot but I dont like the contrast of browns &amp; light blue....</td>', 'Cute shot but I dont like the contrast of browns & light blue....', '2002-07-21 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85609, 3230, 714, '<td valign="top">It looks to much like a snapshot 4</td>', 'It looks to much like a snapshot 4', '2002-07-15 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85610, 3230, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a fun photo :)  This type of photo is not easy to do with the glass reflections... the banister in the lower portion of the image is a little distracting... = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is a fun photo :)  This type of photo is not easy to do with the glass reflections... the banister in the lower portion of the image is a little distracting... = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-15 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85611, 3230, 2553, '<td valign="top">I found this photo to be very "distracting" with the sort of "split screen" effect, the reflections on the glass, and the dark edges of the aquarium.</td>', 'I found this photo to be very "distracting" with the sort of "split screen" effect, the reflections on the glass, and the dark edges of the aquarium.', '2002-07-15 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85612, 3230, 2058, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... I think if you had zoomed in more and just captured the underwater portion, it would look nicer.</td>', 'Nice shot... I think if you had zoomed in more and just captured the underwater portion, it would look nicer.', '2002-07-15 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85613, 3230, 806, '<td valign="top">This is a nice capture of two "cultures" (if you will) trying to communicate. I would suggest, however, to get down on the floor more, and shoot under the top railing, as it cuts off the subjects. With the glow in the tank, there was a good chance here of getting the kids in silouette. The arrangement of the seals to the kids was timed perfectly - it takes my eye in a circle from the top right seal, to the middle, bottom, girl - then almost to the boy (if it weren''t for that rail!)<br/>Keep shooting!</td>', 'This is a nice capture of two "cultures" (if you will) trying to communicate. I would suggest, however, to get down on the floor more, and shoot under the top railing, as it cuts off the subjects. With the glow in the tank, there was a good chance here of getting the kids in silouette. The arrangement of the seals to the kids was timed perfectly - it takes my eye in a circle from the top right seal, to the middle, bottom, girl - then almost to the boy (if it weren''t for that rail!)Keep shooting!', '2002-07-16 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85614, 3230, 2456, '<td valign="top">cool idea! Like the contrast between the colours of the pool and the rocks above. Danie</td>', 'cool idea! Like the contrast between the colours of the pool and the rocks above. Danie', '2002-07-16 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85615, 3230, 1569, '<td valign="top">The reflection on the right is really distracting.</td>', 'The reflection on the right is really distracting.', '2002-07-16 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85616, 3230, 2152, '<td valign="top">Maybe this would look better if you got up close behind the girl on the left instead of a wider shot.  That would also help get rid of the reflection on the right side of the glass.</td>', 'Maybe this would look better if you got up close behind the girl on the left instead of a wider shot.  That would also help get rid of the reflection on the right side of the glass.', '2002-07-16 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85617, 3230, 1403, '<td valign="top">excelent.  if it werent for that bar across the kid''s head.. it would be perfect</td>', 'excelent.  if it werent for that bar across the kid''s head.. it would be perfect', '2002-07-16 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85618, 3230, 2195, '<td valign="top">was this taken at the OKC zoo? the dirty window and the rail reflection are somewhat distracting</td>', 'was this taken at the OKC zoo? the dirty window and the rail reflection are somewhat distracting', '2002-07-16 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85619, 3230, 1897, '<td valign="top">the color is off, and the exposure is weak.  What were you trying to convey?</td>', 'the color is off, and the exposure is weak.  What were you trying to convey?', '2002-07-17 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85620, 3230, 2437, '<td valign="top">u could have moved to the right t get a good angle</td>', 'u could have moved to the right t get a good angle', '2002-07-17 06:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85621, 3230, 2334, '<td valign="top">i don''t like the rail.</td>', 'i don''t like the rail.', '2002-07-17 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85622, 3230, 2256, '<td valign="top">too bad you couldn''t get that reflection out of there.....</td>', 'too bad you couldn''t get that reflection out of there.....', '2002-07-17 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85623, 3230, 811, '<td valign="top">I almost think getting just the child on the left with the hands on the aquarium and one of the seals (?) would have made a more interesting picture.  Good shot to be in low-light though.  And excellent at keeping the reflection to a minimum.  karmat</td>', 'I almost think getting just the child on the left with the hands on the aquarium and one of the seals (?) would have made a more interesting picture.  Good shot to be in low-light though.  And excellent at keeping the reflection to a minimum.  karmat', '2002-07-17 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85624, 3230, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Wish there was a curtain on the doorway, don''t you?  I have tried this shot a number of times, this is the best I have ever seen.  This is harder than it looks!  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice shot.  Wish there was a curtain on the doorway, don''t you?  I have tried this shot a number of times, this is the best I have ever seen.  This is harder than it looks!  8 Swash', '2002-07-18 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85625, 3230, 1041, '<td valign="top">sorry, but this looks rather like a snapshot to me.  the rails going through the little boy''s head, the reflection, and the sloping horizon (see the water).  i know some of these things are either hard to control or out of your control altogether. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'sorry, but this looks rather like a snapshot to me.  the rails going through the little boy''s head, the reflection, and the sloping horizon (see the water).  i know some of these things are either hard to control or out of your control altogether. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-07-18 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85626, 3230, 1031, '<td valign="top">You could run some filters on this and make it look like one of those "island paintings" which are so popular on greeting cards. I''d try and lose some of the reflection on the right though.</td>', 'You could run some filters on this and make it look like one of those "island paintings" which are so popular on greeting cards. I''d try and lose some of the reflection on the right though.', '2002-07-19 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85627, 3230, 2777, '<td valign="top">It needs better framing. Cut out the top of the imge, bar at the bottom. Story is about girl and seal, focus on them. COlor of the water is great - it should fill out whole background.</td>', 'It needs better framing. Cut out the top of the imge, bar at the bottom. Story is about girl and seal, focus on them. COlor of the water is great - it should fill out whole background.', '2002-07-19 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85628, 3230, 637, '<td valign="top">Not very compelling... more like a snapshot... looking for more thought or some kind of a "handle" 4 sjgleah</td>', 'Not very compelling... more like a snapshot... looking for more thought or some kind of a "handle" 4 sjgleah', '2002-07-20 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85629, 3230, 472, '<td valign="top">i love aquariums.  where''s this one?  looks like california somewhere.</td>', 'i love aquariums.  where''s this one?  looks like california somewhere.', '2002-07-20 03:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85630, 3230, 1759, '<td valign="top">Cute shot. I''m not sure if this works (don''t have time to try it now), but you can also add interest sometimes by making the water level and the children angled to change the perspective a bit (just a thought).</td>', 'Cute shot. I''m not sure if this works (don''t have time to try it now), but you can also add interest sometimes by making the water level and the children angled to change the perspective a bit (just a thought).', '2002-07-20 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85631, 3230, 2317, '<td valign="top">Not a very studied shot....</td>', 'Not a very studied shot....', '2002-07-21 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85632, 3230, 2428, '<td valign="top">a clse of just the hand of the face would have been nicer.</td>', 'a clse of just the hand of the face would have been nicer.', '2002-07-21 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85633, 3230, 2539, '<td valign="top">nice photo</td>', 'nice photo', '2002-07-21 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85634, 3230, 1078, '<td valign="top">Wow, really fun picture.  Would it have been possible to get more squarely on to the window instead of off to the side?  Or maybe to have straightened things up a bit in an editing program?  Love the little girl''s (?) hands up against the glass.  Wish the other child''s head wasn''t being blocked by the rail.  Nice timing as the one seal was banking and flippers outstretched.</td>', 'Wow, really fun picture.  Would it have been possible to get more squarely on to the window instead of off to the side?  Or maybe to have straightened things up a bit in an editing program?  Love the little girl''s (?) hands up against the glass.  Wish the other child''s head wasn''t being blocked by the rail.  Nice timing as the one seal was banking and flippers outstretched.', '2002-07-21 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85635, 3232, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good color and super dof. Kee</td>', 'Nice shot, good color and super dof. Kee', '2002-07-15 06:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85636, 3232, 133, '<td valign="top">Good use of depth.</td>', 'Good use of depth.', '2002-07-15 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85637, 3232, 917, '<td valign="top">Always difficult lighting these. Try for a smaller aperture, longer exposure and use a tripod to steady things.</td>', 'Always difficult lighting these. Try for a smaller aperture, longer exposure and use a tripod to steady things.', '2002-07-15 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85638, 3232, 2261, '<td valign="top">Alot in the picture but not alot going on. Dont like the subject matter, maybe because I see this sight too often myself.</td>', 'Alot in the picture but not alot going on. Dont like the subject matter, maybe because I see this sight too often myself.', '2002-07-15 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85639, 3232, 1944, '<td valign="top">Your photo looked good in the thumbnail and I was looking forward to getting to it, but it doesn''t have the critical sharpness a shot like this needs.</td>', 'Your photo looked good in the thumbnail and I was looking forward to getting to it, but it doesn''t have the critical sharpness a shot like this needs.', '2002-07-15 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85640, 3232, 1078, '<td valign="top">"Mind the Gap!  Stand clear of the doors please." -- Only probably not in that station -- too straight for a gap.  (A "real" critique to come later.)</td>', '"Mind the Gap!  Stand clear of the doors please." -- Only probably not in that station -- too straight for a gap.  (A "real" critique to come later.)', '2002-07-15 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85641, 3232, 92, '<td valign="top">I''ve always wanted to ride one of these. We don''t have them here. This is a really interesting photo to me, maybe for that reason. I also like the shot angle and color so it just all adds up:)</td>', 'I''ve always wanted to ride one of these. We don''t have them here. This is a really interesting photo to me, maybe for that reason. I also like the shot angle and color so it just all adds up:)', '2002-07-15 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85642, 3232, 2058, '<td valign="top">Neat looking subway tunnel.  Might be made more dramatic if you had stood on something, giving a bit more unusual angle.</td>', 'Neat looking subway tunnel.  Might be made more dramatic if you had stood on something, giving a bit more unusual angle.', '2002-07-15 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
