(85670, 3232, 472, '<td valign="top">nice effort. not a lot going on in this picture, though.  i mean, yes, it''s the subway. but then what happened?  know what I mean?   it''s a little blurry too.</td>', 'nice effort. not a lot going on in this picture, though.  i mean, yes, it''s the subway. but then what happened?  know what I mean?   it''s a little blurry too.', '2002-07-19 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
