(85683, 3233, 327, '<td valign="top">Such a face! &amp;lt;g&amp;gt; Your color seems a bit too red? However, I do like this....I mean with that title and that face it''s a winner!! Kee</td>', 'Such a face! &lt;g&gt; Your color seems a bit too red? However, I do like this....I mean with that title and that face it''s a winner!! Kee', '2002-07-15 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
