(85686, 3233, 1280, '<td valign="top">omigosh!  This otter is toooooooo cute!  Flat little head...Great picture. Caught light in his eyes too.</td>', 'omigosh!  This otter is toooooooo cute!  Flat little head...Great picture. Caught light in his eyes too.', '2002-07-16 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1);
