(85858, 3241, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this particular photo would hold more impact if shot from a lower angle... The overexposure in the upper right is not adding any impact for me.. = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I think this particular photo would hold more impact if shot from a lower angle... The overexposure in the upper right is not adding any impact for me.. = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-15 07:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
