(85860, 3241, 327, '<td valign="top">I almost like this shot. I''m not being silly it''s just that there is soooo much going on here. The only real negitive I can say is the bright sun light on the left that''s a distraction and looks fried. The car bothers me but I love the cans stacked on his left. Hummm, I''ll have to go with a six here. Kee</td>', 'I almost like this shot. I''m not being silly it''s just that there is soooo much going on here. The only real negitive I can say is the bright sun light on the left that''s a distraction and looks fried. The car bothers me but I love the cans stacked on his left. Hummm, I''ll have to go with a six here. Kee', '2002-07-15 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85861, 3241, 2373, '<td valign="top">the light in the upper left hand corner linda spoils it.</td>', 'the light in the upper left hand corner linda spoils it.', '2002-07-15 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
