(85863, 3241, 885, '<td valign="top">I think it''s too bad about the car behind him...the overexposed left I don''t mind as much as the car.</td>', 'I think it''s too bad about the car behind him...the overexposed left I don''t mind as much as the car.', '2002-07-15 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
