(85871, 3241, 1856, '<td valign="top">The bright light on the left is a little too harsh.  I wonder if you could have gotten a better picture from the left of your subject.  Other than that...great picture!  7 Lisa</td>', 'The bright light on the left is a little too harsh.  I wonder if you could have gotten a better picture from the left of your subject.  Other than that...great picture!  7 Lisa', '2002-07-16 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85872, 3241, 1759, '<td valign="top">Great storytelling. You did an excellent job of capturing this moment. The lighting is very good and complimentary to the subject.</td>', 'Great storytelling. You did an excellent job of capturing this moment. The lighting is very good and complimentary to the subject.', '2002-07-16 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85873, 3241, 878, '<td valign="top">Good color and detail, I like the light in the top left corner.  I know some people wont like it.</td>', 'Good color and detail, I like the light in the top left corner.  I know some people wont like it.', '2002-07-17 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85874, 3241, 245, '<td valign="top">anoter fine example of a wel-used blow-out, i realy like how he''s framed by... well, nothing really, on the left.</td>', 'anoter fine example of a wel-used blow-out, i realy like how he''s framed by... well, nothing really, on the left.', '2002-07-17 05:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85875, 3241, 671, '<td valign="top">good portrait.  The glare on the left is effective, but maybe just a touch too much glare.  Overall, the photo works well, though.</td>', 'good portrait.  The glare on the left is effective, but maybe just a touch too much glare.  Overall, the photo works well, though.', '2002-07-17 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85876, 3241, 889, '<td valign="top">looks like the upper left corner was editied out, see the very sharp demarcation between the light and the stones, not a gradient like it is in other places.</td>', 'looks like the upper left corner was editied out, see the very sharp demarcation between the light and the stones, not a gradient like it is in other places.', '2002-07-17 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85877, 3241, 2668, '<td valign="top">I''d have tried this one in b/w or sepia tone to give it a different affect, I''d also crop out the paper, cropping that might also cut out some of the glare in the upper left corner as well.  Otherwise a great shot, showing something thats getting harder to find.</td>', 'I''d have tried this one in b/w or sepia tone to give it a different affect, I''d also crop out the paper, cropping that might also cut out some of the glare in the upper left corner as well.  Otherwise a great shot, showing something thats getting harder to find.', '2002-07-17 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85878, 3241, 1031, '<td valign="top">Only thing I don''t like is the overexposure in the upper left, although I''m not claiming anything could have been done...</td>', 'Only thing I don''t like is the overexposure in the upper left, although I''m not claiming anything could have been done...', '2002-07-18 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85879, 3241, 1707, '<td valign="top">are those your shoes?</td>', 'are those your shoes?', '2002-07-18 03:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85880, 3241, 587, '<td valign="top">I wish the car behind him wasn''t there - what''s with the paper in bottom left? The photo is too busy (IMO).  If someone is sitting there, I wish we could see the shoe shiner working on ''them'' instead of the single shoe. This has great clarity and I like the lighting. good job. 6 cthenk</td>', 'I wish the car behind him wasn''t there - what''s with the paper in bottom left? The photo is too busy (IMO).  If someone is sitting there, I wish we could see the shoe shiner working on ''them'' instead of the single shoe. This has great clarity and I like the lighting. good job. 6 cthenk', '2002-07-18 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85881, 3241, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good photo depicting a sector of the job force.  Man and his craft, you might say.  I don''t like the washed out portion in the upper left. I still like it though.</td>', 'Good photo depicting a sector of the job force.  Man and his craft, you might say.  I don''t like the washed out portion in the upper left. I still like it though.', '2002-07-19 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
