(85933, 3253, 2003, '<td valign="top">the only think i wasn''t happy with was that it wasn''t as sharp as when you''re just looking through the scope - if i can find the hardware (which i KNOW i have somewhere), i''ll reshoot this setup with eyepiece projection - i''m pretty sure that will bring it in nice &amp; crispy --- and to those of you who would like to see more of the moon, sorry but there was no moon cropped out of this - yup, it''s a BIG lens!</td>', 'the only think i wasn''t happy with was that it wasn''t as sharp as when you''re just looking through the scope - if i can find the hardware (which i KNOW i have somewhere), i''ll reshoot this setup with eyepiece projection - i''m pretty sure that will bring it in nice & crispy --- and to those of you who would like to see more of the moon, sorry but there was no moon cropped out of this - yup, it''s a BIG lens!', '2002-07-22 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
