(85955, 3254, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat geometry.  I''m so happy that the vertical line on the left is parallel to the edge of the frame, even if the others aren''t.  I sort of wish that the clouds on the right weren''t lighter than those on the left which would reinforce the absolute symmetry, but I guess that tends to be the nature of clouds.</td>', 'Neat geometry.  I''m so happy that the vertical line on the left is parallel to the edge of the frame, even if the others aren''t.  I sort of wish that the clouds on the right weren''t lighter than those on the left which would reinforce the absolute symmetry, but I guess that tends to be the nature of clouds.', '2002-07-16 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(85956, 3254, 656, '<td valign="top">like the composition on this - works well in B&amp;W to show the textures/ patterns.   Wonder if it needs to be rotated though - vertical and rising to a point would be more ''dramatic'' ?</td>', 'like the composition on this - works well in B&W to show the textures/ patterns.   Wonder if it needs to be rotated though - vertical and rising to a point would be more ''dramatic'' ?', '2002-07-16 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
