(86087, 3257, 133, '<td valign="top">Nice clear macro.  I always wish for the frontside of a bee but know that it does not always happen that way.</td>', 'Nice clear macro.  I always wish for the frontside of a bee but know that it does not always happen that way.', '2002-07-15 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
