(86161, 3260, 436, '<td valign="top">It would be fun to play with a variety of lighting with this subject.  The one you chose, while clear and pretty sharp could be more dramatic, as could a less busy background choice.  Mat board is pretty cheap and comes in a variety of colors. You might want to play with that (no ironing required).</td>', 'It would be fun to play with a variety of lighting with this subject.  The one you chose, while clear and pretty sharp could be more dramatic, as could a less busy background choice.  Mat board is pretty cheap and comes in a variety of colors. You might want to play with that (no ironing required).', '2002-07-15 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86162, 3260, 2261, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but not so sharp.</td>', 'Nice picture but not so sharp.', '2002-07-15 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
