(86281, 3263, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is the best of the wasp shots.  Too bad the flower''s pestal is in the way.  Most of this week''s shots had serious macro/depth of field problems.  In your case, the wasp is more on a single plane, leaving it all in focus.  I think I would have liked having more of the flower in focus, but in this case, the lack of depth isn''t so bad for the subject.  8 Swash</td>', 'Wow, this is the best of the wasp shots.  Too bad the flower''s pestal is in the way.  Most of this week''s shots had serious macro/depth of field problems.  In your case, the wasp is more on a single plane, leaving it all in focus.  I think I would have liked having more of the flower in focus, but in this case, the lack of depth isn''t so bad for the subject.  8 Swash', '2002-07-19 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86282, 3263, 2009, '<td valign="top">I liked the one in your outtakes like this but without the bug. It was a more balanced image.</td>', 'I liked the one in your outtakes like this but without the bug. It was a more balanced image.', '2002-07-19 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86283, 3263, 2317, '<td valign="top">In this type of photos (macro shots) Try to keep your subject as the center spot...</td>', 'In this type of photos (macro shots) Try to keep your subject as the center spot...', '2002-07-21 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86284, 3263, 472, '<td valign="top">ooo, look at that bug! : )</td>', 'ooo, look at that bug! : )', '2002-07-21 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86285, 3263, 2120, '<td valign="top">Great Color, but the pixels are showing quite a bit on the insects legs. Moving out a bit on the cropping might help.</td>', 'Great Color, but the pixels are showing quite a bit on the insects legs. Moving out a bit on the cropping might help.', '2002-07-21 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86286, 3265, 2058, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  I think if you had aimed a bit left and down, you would have the 2 guys in a better position (rule of thirds), and you might have been able to get the entire shadow in the shot.</td>', 'Not bad.  I think if you had aimed a bit left and down, you would have the 2 guys in a better position (rule of thirds), and you might have been able to get the entire shadow in the shot.', '2002-07-15 04:33:00.000000', NULL, 1);
