(86290, 3265, 92, '<td valign="top">The bright sun right at the camera just doesn''t do this justice. This has the look of a snapshot  rather than a professional photo .</td>', 'The bright sun right at the camera just doesn''t do this justice. This has the look of a snapshot  rather than a professional photo .', '2002-07-15 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
