(86388, 3268, 806, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting to look at - nice idea! The lighting is warm, and the play of shadows across the wall captures your eye. I''m not sure I like the lamp in the corner. Nice contrast between places: the warm glow of the room in contrast to the stress of the city - although the distance and lighting there makes it feel asleep and subdued as well.</td>', 'This is very interesting to look at - nice idea! The lighting is warm, and the play of shadows across the wall captures your eye. I''m not sure I like the lamp in the corner. Nice contrast between places: the warm glow of the room in contrast to the stress of the city - although the distance and lighting there makes it feel asleep and subdued as well.', '2002-07-15 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
