(86395, 3268, 2172, '<td valign="top">10, 10, 10   I''m in awe.  Such talent.  I truly have this strange wave of emotion come over me from this photo!  This is honestly a piece of work!  So I guess I need to start getting up earlier in order to get these great shots (yeah right-I''m a night owl).    Magnificant work - LOVE IT, LOVE IT, LOOOVE IT!<br/>Ruthann</td>', '10, 10, 10   I''m in awe.  Such talent.  I truly have this strange wave of emotion come over me from this photo!  This is honestly a piece of work!  So I guess I need to start getting up earlier in order to get these great shots (yeah right-I''m a night owl).    Magnificant work - LOVE IT, LOVE IT, LOOOVE IT!Ruthann', '2002-07-17 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
