(86402, 3268, 1041, '<td valign="top">personally, i think i would''ve liked to see more of the view and less of the room, but i understand you probably wanted to include all the shadows.  well, they are nice, but the ones from the xmas lighting are distracting to me.  also, your photo does not seem to be quite straight, the wall (corner) in the middle should be vertical.  there are a couple of things (plant? and something else) almost visible at the bottom, and a little distracting, too. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'personally, i think i would''ve liked to see more of the view and less of the room, but i understand you probably wanted to include all the shadows.  well, they are nice, but the ones from the xmas lighting are distracting to me.  also, your photo does not seem to be quite straight, the wall (corner) in the middle should be vertical.  there are a couple of things (plant? and something else) almost visible at the bottom, and a little distracting, too. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-19 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
