(86511, 3273, 2079, '<td valign="top">A beautiful sunset in the harbor. (any harbor). Most everyone can identify with a picture like this. After reading through the forums about the types of photos that just dont do well with the voters, among them are babies, pets and sunsets.   This is much more than just a sunset.-  I think you will do well with this one  Its just a little dark for my taste,  Im giving it an  8</td>', 'A beautiful sunset in the harbor. (any harbor). Most everyone can identify with a picture like this. After reading through the forums about the types of photos that just dont do well with the voters, among them are babies, pets and sunsets.   This is much more than just a sunset.-  I think you will do well with this one  Its just a little dark for my taste,  Im giving it an  8', '2002-07-20 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86512, 3273, 811, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  Peaceful and serene.  If it could have been framed to eliminate the two boats on the outer extremes, it would have been almost perfect, for me.</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  Peaceful and serene.  If it could have been framed to eliminate the two boats on the outer extremes, it would have been almost perfect, for me.', '2002-07-20 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
