(86516, 3273, 2, '<td valign="top">I''m not one for sunsets, but this picture is amazing.  It''s so incredibly serene, I think I need to go to sleep.  You''ve done a great job of acheiving the painting-like feeling that is so effective here.  Nice job.</td>', 'I''m not one for sunsets, but this picture is amazing.  It''s so incredibly serene, I think I need to go to sleep.  You''ve done a great job of acheiving the painting-like feeling that is so effective here.  Nice job.', '2002-07-22 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
