(86528, 3275, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the metallic color and the repeating patterns of the wheels.  Good choice of sepia (?) as it accentuates the metal tones by making them seem coppery or goldish...might be a bit busy at the upper right.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the metallic color and the repeating patterns of the wheels.  Good choice of sepia (?) as it accentuates the metal tones by making them seem coppery or goldish...might be a bit busy at the upper right.', '2002-07-15 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86529, 3275, 1360, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest, this is a very plainjane photo, but I LOVE steam trains, so I was forced to rate it high ;)<br/>Seriously tho, very technically nice photo, just a little bland subjectwise.</td>', 'I''ll be honest, this is a very plainjane photo, but I LOVE steam trains, so I was forced to rate it high ;)Seriously tho, very technically nice photo, just a little bland subjectwise.', '2002-07-15 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
