(86578, 3276, 1005, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  I really like these flowers (forget the name), from a straight on view, they resemble blue fireworks, plus that view is "flatter" so less need for a broader depth of field.  Pretty good depth of field, petals pointing at us are a bit out of focus.  8 Swash</td>', 'Lovely shot.  I really like these flowers (forget the name), from a straight on view, they resemble blue fireworks, plus that view is "flatter" so less need for a broader depth of field.  Pretty good depth of field, petals pointing at us are a bit out of focus.  8 Swash', '2002-07-15 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
