(86600, 3276, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the subject....I do a lot of botanicals myself.  I like the out of focus background.  The bit of blue flower showing in the upper left is distracting.   It could have been cropped out. Ohhh also too centered.</td>', 'I like the subject....I do a lot of botanicals myself.  I like the out of focus background.  The bit of blue flower showing in the upper left is distracting.   It could have been cropped out. Ohhh also too centered.', '2002-07-19 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
