(86706, 3284, 2146, '<td valign="top">cool idea</td>', 'cool idea', '2002-07-15 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86707, 3284, 1759, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of taking something simple and capitalizing on the color and geometric form. Photographically there are some problems with lighting, noisi, and contrast. Some of the highlights are blown out, especially on the green piece. I''m not sure why there is so much noise, but if you have PhotoShop elements, PhotoPaint or some such program, then you can remove some of the noise. I would suggest increasing the color saturation and possibly the contrast too. I''ll assume some of these problems are related to the camera so I''m scoring a bit higher than I otherwise might have based on the creativity and composition, which are good.</td>', 'I like the concept of taking something simple and capitalizing on the color and geometric form. Photographically there are some problems with lighting, noisi, and contrast. Some of the highlights are blown out, especially on the green piece. I''m not sure why there is so much noise, but if you have PhotoShop elements, PhotoPaint or some such program, then you can remove some of the noise. I would suggest increasing the color saturation and possibly the contrast too. I''ll assume some of these problems are related to the camera so I''m scoring a bit higher than I otherwise might have based on the creativity and composition, which are good.', '2002-07-15 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86708, 3284, 1856, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lines.  Seems a little pixelated and maybe a tad overexposed.  The folds on the yellow paper bother me because they''re kind of messed up.  6 Lisa</td>', 'Nice colors and lines.  Seems a little pixelated and maybe a tad overexposed.  The folds on the yellow paper bother me because they''re kind of messed up.  6 Lisa', '2002-07-16 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86709, 3284, 2011, '<td valign="top">I love all the colors</td>', 'I love all the colors', '2002-07-16 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86710, 3284, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  A little grainy and soft, but that''s probably your camera.</td>', 'Nice idea.  A little grainy and soft, but that''s probably your camera.', '2002-07-16 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86711, 3284, 1831, '<td valign="top">Good use of colour. Dogman "7" ;-)</td>', 'Good use of colour. Dogman "7" ;-)', '2002-07-16 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86712, 3284, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice idea, and simple to implement.  i''ve tried playing with colored paper but haven''t been happy with any of my shots yet.  i like this one.  couple of nitpicky things: the black corners at top left and bottom right.  would be nice if there was colored paper there, too.  the orange paper that sticks out under the blue (tiny corner) is distracting.  i told you i was being nitpicky. :)  other than that, the shot is a tad grainy but you may have intended that.  i would''ve preferred less grain personally. -- gr8photos (6)</td>', 'nice idea, and simple to implement.  i''ve tried playing with colored paper but haven''t been happy with any of my shots yet.  i like this one.  couple of nitpicky things: the black corners at top left and bottom right.  would be nice if there was colored paper there, too.  the orange paper that sticks out under the blue (tiny corner) is distracting.  i told you i was being nitpicky. :)  other than that, the shot is a tad grainy but you may have intended that.  i would''ve preferred less grain personally. -- gr8photos (6)', '2002-07-16 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86713, 3284, 2428, '<td valign="top">nice colors, but there''s nothing to it.</td>', 'nice colors, but there''s nothing to it.', '2002-07-16 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
