(86731, 3284, 1078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  I think you have the basis for a great idea here.  I''d suggest using a really smooth paper (maybe origami paper?) and take some real care to fold the fans perfectly.  Then make sure it''s well lit to avoid as much of the camera "grain" as possible from being introduced to the picture.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  I think you have the basis for a great idea here.  I''d suggest using a really smooth paper (maybe origami paper?) and take some real care to fold the fans perfectly.  Then make sure it''s well lit to avoid as much of the camera "grain" as possible from being introduced to the picture.', '2002-07-22 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
