(86761, 3285, 1856, '<td valign="top">adorable....8...later...I would have cropped this just above the hemline.  Too bad the set dimensions for submission wouldn''t allow for a nice crop.   Her expression is what makes this picture special...the prissy hands are nice too.  I''ve read that if you include any part of the lower leg, you must include the feet.  That makes sense to me because her legs seem ''cut-off'' in this photo.  I also think a crop down to just her face would be nice.  Oh...great background!  Still an 8 : ) Lisa</td>', 'adorable....8...later...I would have cropped this just above the hemline.  Too bad the set dimensions for submission wouldn''t allow for a nice crop.   Her expression is what makes this picture special...the prissy hands are nice too.  I''ve read that if you include any part of the lower leg, you must include the feet.  That makes sense to me because her legs seem ''cut-off'' in this photo.  I also think a crop down to just her face would be nice.  Oh...great background!  Still an 8 : ) Lisa', '2002-07-16 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
