(86817, 3286, 587, '<td valign="top">This is the first photo I opened, the thumbnail caught my eye immediately. It''s cotton? Don''t you hate it when you take a great photo that works for this challenge and the next (texture) ;)   I really like the coloring on this - I think of a hot and tiresome day, a view the pickers might see - and the way you captured the ''strands'' of cotton thru the light.  Perhaps if the background was a tad more in focus...not sure though.  I do know this is a great photo, a top 10 I think.  9 cthenk</td>', 'This is the first photo I opened, the thumbnail caught my eye immediately. It''s cotton? Don''t you hate it when you take a great photo that works for this challenge and the next (texture) ;)   I really like the coloring on this - I think of a hot and tiresome day, a view the pickers might see - and the way you captured the ''strands'' of cotton thru the light.  Perhaps if the background was a tad more in focus...not sure though.  I do know this is a great photo, a top 10 I think.  9 cthenk', '2002-07-16 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(86818, 3286, 2373, '<td valign="top">I really like this but i wish ther was the smallest bit of fill flash or somthing so that we could see the flower just a little bit, I maen a really little bit more. Really nice shot.</td>', 'I really like this but i wish ther was the smallest bit of fill flash or somthing so that we could see the flower just a little bit, I maen a really little bit more. Really nice shot.', '2002-07-16 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
