(86834, 3286, 715, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, the duotone works very well.<br/>I''ve got some minor remarks about the composition though: the stem on the left looks out of place and I would like to see everything shifted a little towards to the bottom so it would comply to the rule of thirds. But that''s a matter of personal taste I guess.<br/>Nevertheless it''s one of my favorites this week.<br/></td>', 'Beautiful photo, the duotone works very well.I''ve got some minor remarks about the composition though: the stem on the left looks out of place and I would like to see everything shifted a little towards to the bottom so it would comply to the rule of thirds. But that''s a matter of personal taste I guess.Nevertheless it''s one of my favorites this week.', '2002-07-19 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
