(86879, 3287, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the melting motion, but overall, it doesn''t appeal to me.  The focus is good, composition is nice (a bit close, but necessary).  It''s a bit dark.  7 Swash</td>', 'I like the melting motion, but overall, it doesn''t appeal to me.  The focus is good, composition is nice (a bit close, but necessary).  It''s a bit dark.  7 Swash', '2002-07-19 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
