(86962, 3289, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful doll, and nice picture.  Your lighting and focus is very good, and allows the viewer to see the details of her garment.  The only thing I would change would be the background.  The yellowish/tan/beige color doesn''t provide enough contrast, I think.  Maybe a greenish background (dark, not bright) would really bring out the greens in her garments, and allow the red to be really zippy.</td>', 'Beautiful doll, and nice picture.  Your lighting and focus is very good, and allows the viewer to see the details of her garment.  The only thing I would change would be the background.  The yellowish/tan/beige color doesn''t provide enough contrast, I think.  Maybe a greenish background (dark, not bright) would really bring out the greens in her garments, and allow the red to be really zippy.', '2002-07-18 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
