(86978, 3290, 1845, '<td valign="top">I''m reminded of Beckett''s Stirrings Still when I look at this, but I have my doubts about the intention.  I think this would look better all B&amp;W or with the colours much more muted; the framing could be improved by reducing the stretch of trees above.  This is still the most evocative piece this week and it deserves a 10 on artistic merit alone.</td>', 'I''m reminded of Beckett''s Stirrings Still when I look at this, but I have my doubts about the intention.  I think this would look better all B&W or with the colours much more muted; the framing could be improved by reducing the stretch of trees above.  This is still the most evocative piece this week and it deserves a 10 on artistic merit alone.', '2002-07-15 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
