(87046, 3291, 1005, '<td valign="top">Hormonal teenager?  I like the 90 degree turn, but the light on the heel, plus the shoelace are dead give-aways.  Very good shot of the tennis shoe.  Without the 90 degree turn, I would score this 5, with the turn, 7 Swash</td>', 'Hormonal teenager?  I like the 90 degree turn, but the light on the heel, plus the shoelace are dead give-aways.  Very good shot of the tennis shoe.  Without the 90 degree turn, I would score this 5, with the turn, 7 Swash', '2002-07-19 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
