(87071, 3292, 142, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful nature shot.  I like the way you used your DOF to accentuate the front leaves.</td>', 'This is a beautiful nature shot.  I like the way you used your DOF to accentuate the front leaves.', '2002-07-18 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87072, 3292, 1280, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhhhh my favorite color....green.  Being a tree hugger an'' all.  Leaves are one of my favorite subjects. I love the foreground leaves.  Nice and rich coloring, nice defined veins.  What I don''t like is too many out of focus leaves in the background that don''t contribute to the image.  I would have changed my position to compose differently to eliminate the excess in the background.  With sky as the background the foreground leaves would also be a little more translucent too.  That would allow the veins to be even more pronounced.</td>', 'Ahhhhhhhh my favorite color....green.  Being a tree hugger an'' all.  Leaves are one of my favorite subjects. I love the foreground leaves.  Nice and rich coloring, nice defined veins.  What I don''t like is too many out of focus leaves in the background that don''t contribute to the image.  I would have changed my position to compose differently to eliminate the excess in the background.  With sky as the background the foreground leaves would also be a little more translucent too.  That would allow the veins to be even more pronounced.', '2002-07-18 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87073, 3292, 2798, '<td valign="top">Not enough blue. :) Lovely atmosphere though.</td>', 'Not enough blue. :) Lovely atmosphere though.', '2002-07-19 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
