(87101, 3293, 885, '<td valign="top">It looks like they''re posing for someone else...?</td>', 'It looks like they''re posing for someone else...?', '2002-07-18 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87102, 3293, 2111, '<td valign="top">custard pie shot</td>', 'custard pie shot', '2002-07-18 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87103, 3293, 1280, '<td valign="top">Photo is composed nicely, and the lighting is good.  Although this has nothing at all to do with the image''s quality, I must say I am concerned about exotic animals being out of their environment.  They require very special needs.  Of course this may be in a zoo or something.  I see a stamp on one of the young lady''s hand.  I hope that is the case.  Ok....stepping off my milk crate now....oooooops...I fell!  No offense I hope. Nice job with your photo....  :-)</td>', 'Photo is composed nicely, and the lighting is good.  Although this has nothing at all to do with the image''s quality, I must say I am concerned about exotic animals being out of their environment.  They require very special needs.  Of course this may be in a zoo or something.  I see a stamp on one of the young lady''s hand.  I hope that is the case.  Ok....stepping off my milk crate now....oooooops...I fell!  No offense I hope. Nice job with your photo....  :-)', '2002-07-18 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87104, 3293, 640, '<td valign="top">I don''t like snakes. I''ve met too many poisoness ones in the wild. Nothing to laugh about. One like this ate my neigbor''s chicken.</td>', 'I don''t like snakes. I''ve met too many poisoness ones in the wild. Nothing to laugh about. One like this ate my neigbor''s chicken.', '2002-07-19 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87105, 3293, 2801, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Not the best angle or composition.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Not the best angle or composition.', '2002-07-20 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87106, 3293, 741, '<td valign="top">I hate to sound harsh - this is a fairly competant snapshot.  If the too girls had been looking at the camera then it would have been a very competant snapshot.  Apart from that and too much dof and an untidy background there''s nothing really wrong with it.  However, snapshots are seldom great pictures.  This would probably be very appealing to parents/friends of the girls but doesn''t rate highly in a competition.</td>', 'I hate to sound harsh - this is a fairly competant snapshot.  If the too girls had been looking at the camera then it would have been a very competant snapshot.  Apart from that and too much dof and an untidy background there''s nothing really wrong with it.  However, snapshots are seldom great pictures.  This would probably be very appealing to parents/friends of the girls but doesn''t rate highly in a competition.', '2002-07-20 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87107, 3293, 2815, '<td valign="top">Chicks with snakes!!!   I love it</td>', 'Chicks with snakes!!!   I love it', '2002-07-20 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87108, 3293, 2783, '<td valign="top">I''d give this one a six.<br/>It just looks like a picture that you would take with a disposable camera.</td>', 'I''d give this one a six.It just looks like a picture that you would take with a disposable camera.', '2002-07-20 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87109, 3293, 2317, '<td valign="top">Casual</td>', 'Casual', '2002-07-21 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
