(87142, 3294, 1569, '<td valign="top">The dandelion head should be in focus.You have to trick the auto focus into doing what you want.Moveing in on the head and pushing down on the shutter button to set the focus,then backing out to compose the shot and pressing all the way down on the shutter button,is one way to trick the auto focus.</td>', 'The dandelion head should be in focus.You have to trick the auto focus into doing what you want.Moveing in on the head and pushing down on the shutter button to set the focus,then backing out to compose the shot and pressing all the way down on the shutter button,is one way to trick the auto focus.', '2002-07-16 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
