(87161, 3294, 1041, '<td valign="top">this would be a great photo (and is a good title) if the dandylion was in focus and not the background.  depending on how close up your camera focuses, you may simply have been too close. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'this would be a great photo (and is a good title) if the dandylion was in focus and not the background.  depending on how close up your camera focuses, you may simply have been too close. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-07-18 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
