(87190, 3295, 811, '<td valign="top">Would it have been possible to get a different "stack" instead of just two rows.  Maybe a pyramid or something.  The open wall/blinds makes it seem like it needs something.  Or fill the frame up with Pepsi, even if you couldn''t include all of the cans.</td>', 'Would it have been possible to get a different "stack" instead of just two rows.  Maybe a pyramid or something.  The open wall/blinds makes it seem like it needs something.  Or fill the frame up with Pepsi, even if you couldn''t include all of the cans.', '2002-07-17 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
