(87192, 3295, 2337, '<td valign="top">This didn''t inspire me much either way... Technically, I think a closer crop that excluded the space on the right and left of the cans.  The blinds are kind of interesting, but there''s too much of it for my taste.</td>', 'This didn''t inspire me much either way... Technically, I think a closer crop that excluded the space on the right and left of the cans.  The blinds are kind of interesting, but there''s too much of it for my taste.', '2002-07-18 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87193, 3295, 2481, '<td valign="top">A warhol thing?  not sure what part the blinds play</td>', 'A warhol thing?  not sure what part the blinds play', '2002-07-18 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87194, 3295, 2539, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter</td>', 'Interesting subject matter', '2002-07-18 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87195, 3295, 2785, '<td valign="top">The blinds in the BG are a distraction and while we have some repetitive objects there''s not much novelty or interest in the capture.</td>', 'The blinds in the BG are a distraction and while we have some repetitive objects there''s not much novelty or interest in the capture.', '2002-07-18 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87196, 3295, 878, '<td valign="top">Need to have better lighting for this shot.  Also could of been cooler if the wall was not as wide and another level higher or the cans completely filling the frame.</td>', 'Need to have better lighting for this shot.  Also could of been cooler if the wall was not as wide and another level higher or the cans completely filling the frame.', '2002-07-18 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87197, 3295, 2777, '<td valign="top">It''s tilted to the right. Object on the left is ditracting. Good choice of blue-yellow contrast, but use of flash is bad choice. Also, geting closer and capturing only details could work much better. Good effort.</td>', 'It''s tilted to the right. Object on the left is ditracting. Good choice of blue-yellow contrast, but use of flash is bad choice. Also, geting closer and capturing only details could work much better. Good effort.', '2002-07-19 05:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87198, 3295, 1041, '<td valign="top">you were obviously trying to create a repeating pattern here, and the idea is good, however, i would''ve cropped the shot so that the cans at either side are partially cropped off, implying a continuation, and i would''ve also turned the labels to face all the same way.  not sure how i would''ve used the space above the cans, i think it''s too much and detracts from the repeating pattern aspect.  just my thoughs. -- gr8photos (4)<br/><br/>addition: just occured to me, it would''ve been fun to fill the frame with the cans and place one different can (coke?) in there somewhere just to create a break in the pattern.</td>', 'you were obviously trying to create a repeating pattern here, and the idea is good, however, i would''ve cropped the shot so that the cans at either side are partially cropped off, implying a continuation, and i would''ve also turned the labels to face all the same way.  not sure how i would''ve used the space above the cans, i think it''s too much and detracts from the repeating pattern aspect.  just my thoughs. -- gr8photos (4)addition: just occured to me, it would''ve been fun to fill the frame with the cans and place one different can (coke?) in there somewhere just to create a break in the pattern.', '2002-07-19 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87199, 3295, 1280, '<td valign="top">A different angle may have added a little interest on this....maybe.  As it is it isn''''t too interesting.</td>', 'A different angle may have added a little interest on this....maybe.  As it is it isn''''t too interesting.', '2002-07-19 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87200, 3295, 1759, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of the photo, the color and symmetry of the cans, and the reflection in front. I think that the background weakens the shot though and should have been a solid white or high contrast color. I think also to crop the front so the table edge doesn''t show or better yet, to have more front surface to reflect the full image of the cans.</td>', 'I like the concept of the photo, the color and symmetry of the cans, and the reflection in front. I think that the background weakens the shot though and should have been a solid white or high contrast color. I think also to crop the front so the table edge doesn''t show or better yet, to have more front surface to reflect the full image of the cans.', '2002-07-20 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87201, 3295, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hmm...would I be impressed or depressed if all the little tab-pushers were obviously up indicating a stack of empty cans?</td>', 'Hmm...would I be impressed or depressed if all the little tab-pushers were obviously up indicating a stack of empty cans?', '2002-07-20 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87202, 3295, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, someone like Pepsi WAY too much.  But beyond that, I find myself simply just thinking, "Ummmm, ok."  Trying to figure out what this shot is supposed to convey and I''m just not getting it.  About the only suggestion I can make is that you stack enough of the cans so that you could shoot an entire "wall" of them instead of just two rows -- the table and windowblind aren''t doing anything for your presentation.</td>', 'OK, someone like Pepsi WAY too much.  But beyond that, I find myself simply just thinking, "Ummmm, ok."  Trying to figure out what this shot is supposed to convey and I''m just not getting it.  About the only suggestion I can make is that you stack enough of the cans so that you could shoot an entire "wall" of them instead of just two rows -- the table and windowblind aren''t doing anything for your presentation.', '2002-07-21 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87203, 3295, 472, '<td valign="top">now that''s a caffeine rush ;)</td>', 'now that''s a caffeine rush ;)', '2002-07-21 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
