(87305, 3308, 587, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers!! However, I''m sorry but I hate the vase! Not a fan of the water of leaf - unless you put some on the petals too. A black vase to just blend into the background would be prettier (IMO) - then again I''m partial to ''floating'' flowers ;) good job. 7 cthenk</td>', 'Beautiful flowers!! However, I''m sorry but I hate the vase! Not a fan of the water of leaf - unless you put some on the petals too. A black vase to just blend into the background would be prettier (IMO) - then again I''m partial to ''floating'' flowers ;) good job. 7 cthenk', '2002-07-18 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
