(87343, 3312, 2058, '<td valign="top">Cool shot... I love F1!  I think you should have shown more of the car though, and it would have been nice if it wasnt sitting on grass... F1 cars arent supposed to be in the grass! :)</td>', 'Cool shot... I love F1!  I think you should have shown more of the car though, and it would have been nice if it wasnt sitting on grass... F1 cars arent supposed to be in the grass! :)', '2002-07-15 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
