(87372, 3314, 889, '<td valign="top">I dont get the Kipling was wrong title.  also I dont look at the title when judging the pictures. its afterall the picture that is being judged. <br/>Since the title obviously ties it together and though I read alot kipling isnt a favorite.  the extra chopped portion of the shields at the top is a distraction</td>', 'I dont get the Kipling was wrong title.  also I dont look at the title when judging the pictures. its afterall the picture that is being judged. Since the title obviously ties it together and though I read alot kipling isnt a favorite.  the extra chopped portion of the shields at the top is a distraction', '2002-07-15 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87373, 3314, 1856, '<td valign="top">Funny.  I wish they had allowed for different image dimensions for this.  I''d like to see the top partial signs cropped out.  5 Lisa</td>', 'Funny.  I wish they had allowed for different image dimensions for this.  I''d like to see the top partial signs cropped out.  5 Lisa', '2002-07-16 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87374, 3314, 1569, '<td valign="top">The bottom of the  signs at the top need to go, other wise nice pix.</td>', 'The bottom of the  signs at the top need to go, other wise nice pix.', '2002-07-16 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87375, 3314, 2373, '<td valign="top">Funn, The color seems to be off a bit, Maybe the contrast.</td>', 'Funn, The color seems to be off a bit, Maybe the contrast.', '2002-07-16 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87376, 3314, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the color in this photo but I wish the depth of field was a little more shallow to blur out the background.. I would have also attempted to shoot this sign straight on to eliminate the perspective tilt... = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like the color in this photo but I wish the depth of field was a little more shallow to blur out the background.. I would have also attempted to shoot this sign straight on to eliminate the perspective tilt... = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87377, 3314, 2261, '<td valign="top">Cutting of the top signs ruined this for me.</td>', 'Cutting of the top signs ruined this for me.', '2002-07-16 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87378, 3314, 2334, '<td valign="top">wtf...</td>', 'wtf...', '2002-07-17 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87379, 3314, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp colors and framing, though maybe tilted a little.  My only suggestion would be to crop the bottom of the interstate signs at the top out leaving just East West and arrow.  karmat</td>', 'Nice crisp colors and framing, though maybe tilted a little.  My only suggestion would be to crop the bottom of the interstate signs at the top out leaving just East West and arrow.  karmat', '2002-07-17 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
