(87385, 3314, 2428, '<td valign="top">I don''t like when pictures need a name to give them meaning, the whole point of photograpy is visual expression.</td>', 'I don''t like when pictures need a name to give them meaning, the whole point of photograpy is visual expression.', '2002-07-21 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87386, 3314, 2539, '<td valign="top">hahaha</td>', 'hahaha', '2002-07-21 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87387, 3314, 1078, '<td valign="top">Sorry, not getting the joke.  This looks like it could use a little sharpening to bring out a crisp focus.  The bottoms of the two interstate signs at the top of the screen are distracting.  Since I don''t get the joke, I''m hesitant to suggest any alternative crops.</td>', 'Sorry, not getting the joke.  This looks like it could use a little sharpening to bring out a crisp focus.  The bottoms of the two interstate signs at the top of the screen are distracting.  Since I don''t get the joke, I''m hesitant to suggest any alternative crops.', '2002-07-21 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87388, 3314, 1031, '<td valign="top">The quotation I should have referenced more directly is "East is East and West is West and the twain shall never meet."<br/> I later figured out I should have titled it either "The Twain Meet Here" or "Twain Station." I''d also had an idea to add on a hand-lettered sign reading "Welcome Tourists!" but fogot to take the materials with me for that. If we were allowed non-standard crops I would have taken off the bottoms of the highway number signs, but I guess I was trying to "disguise" the actual location -- maybe I should have just included the whole sign.<br/><br/>--Paul</td>', 'The quotation I should have referenced more directly is "East is East and West is West and the twain shall never meet." I later figured out I should have titled it either "The Twain Meet Here" or "Twain Station." I''d also had an idea to add on a hand-lettered sign reading "Welcome Tourists!" but fogot to take the materials with me for that. If we were allowed non-standard crops I would have taken off the bottoms of the highway number signs, but I guess I was trying to "disguise" the actual location -- maybe I should have just included the whole sign.--Paul', '2002-07-23 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(87389, 3315, 1897, '<td valign="top">good composition, horrible focus and exposure.</td>', 'good composition, horrible focus and exposure.', '2002-07-15 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87390, 3315, 2146, '<td valign="top">to fuzzy</td>', 'to fuzzy', '2002-07-15 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87391, 3315, 573, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, not a portrate for the wall, but the serious kid look makes this a keeper.  Now the technical, the image seems to have an overall blue-red tint, if this was not intentional it could have something to do with a overcast day and the wqhite balence adjustment if your camers has that.  also the soft focus normalu does no apeal to me when used in boy shots, I like to see the eyes in sharp clear focus.</td>', 'I like the composition, not a portrate for the wall, but the serious kid look makes this a keeper.  Now the technical, the image seems to have an overall blue-red tint, if this was not intentional it could have something to do with a overcast day and the wqhite balence adjustment if your camers has that.  also the soft focus normalu does no apeal to me when used in boy shots, I like to see the eyes in sharp clear focus.', '2002-07-15 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87392, 3315, 327, '<td valign="top">His shirt logo is distracting and the whole shot seems over compressed.  Soft focus. Still over all I like this portait of a cute little guy. KEE</td>', 'His shirt logo is distracting and the whole shot seems over compressed.  Soft focus. Still over all I like this portait of a cute little guy. KEE', '2002-07-15 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87393, 3315, 772, '<td valign="top">a little more focus and contrast and this would be GREAT!  I love the look and the composition :) = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'a little more focus and contrast and this would be GREAT!  I love the look and the composition :) = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-15 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87394, 3315, 2243, '<td valign="top">Cute kid :-)  The words coming out of his cheek are unfortunate though</td>', 'Cute kid :-)  The words coming out of his cheek are unfortunate though', '2002-07-16 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87395, 3315, 656, '<td valign="top">a bit too close for the focus on your camera ?</td>', 'a bit too close for the focus on your camera ?', '2002-07-16 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87396, 3315, 1658, '<td valign="top">It''s a well-balanced shot as far as the composition left to right.  I''d have preferred to see the top and bottom of his face as well, but that''s a stylistic choice.</td>', 'It''s a well-balanced shot as far as the composition left to right.  I''d have preferred to see the top and bottom of his face as well, but that''s a stylistic choice.', '2002-07-16 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87397, 3315, 2261, '<td valign="top">The trouble with pictures of loved ones is that no one else can relate to the subject. This picture could be alot sharper as well.</td>', 'The trouble with pictures of loved ones is that no one else can relate to the subject. This picture could be alot sharper as well.', '2002-07-16 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87398, 3315, 2200, '<td valign="top">logo on shirt lowered value of picture. Otherwise it is great</td>', 'logo on shirt lowered value of picture. Otherwise it is great', '2002-07-16 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
