(87527, 3320, 811, '<td valign="top">The lighting and focus on this picture is great.  the viewer can really make out hte detials on each object.  However, it is just a little too busy.  My suggestion would be to take one or two items and photograph them so that the viewer can really absorb it.  Also, it has kinda an odd crop.  Crowded on the left, open on the right; feels a little off-balance to me.</td>', 'The lighting and focus on this picture is great.  the viewer can really make out hte detials on each object.  However, it is just a little too busy.  My suggestion would be to take one or two items and photograph them so that the viewer can really absorb it.  Also, it has kinda an odd crop.  Crowded on the left, open on the right; feels a little off-balance to me.', '2002-07-19 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87528, 3320, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I''d crop tighter, or maybe rearrange the objects so more detail shows, or maybe not worry about the wolf. Maybe stronger foreground lighting would help.</td>', 'I think I''d crop tighter, or maybe rearrange the objects so more detail shows, or maybe not worry about the wolf. Maybe stronger foreground lighting would help.', '2002-07-19 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
