(87629, 3323, 2199, '<td valign="top">Amazing photograph! Excellent composition -- and almost impossible to imagine how you would freeze this action. Is it a dead bee sitting on glass? One of the best photographs this week -- great job!  10  (LanSnake)</td>', 'Amazing photograph! Excellent composition -- and almost impossible to imagine how you would freeze this action. Is it a dead bee sitting on glass? One of the best photographs this week -- great job!  10  (LanSnake)', '2002-07-17 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
