(87644, 3323, 1041, '<td valign="top">this is awesome.  did you just spend all week sitting there with a camera on the off-chance a bee would land on your finger?? ;)  great capture.  looking fwd to finding out how you did this.  my top 5 this week. -- gr8photos (10)</td>', 'this is awesome.  did you just spend all week sitting there with a camera on the off-chance a bee would land on your finger?? ;)  great capture.  looking fwd to finding out how you did this.  my top 5 this week. -- gr8photos (10)', '2002-07-18 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87645, 3323, 142, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Is the bee actually moving or is this setup with a dead bee on glass?  A friend of mine thought it might be since there is no motion trail.  Either way, I''m very impressed and gave you a 10.  Let us know how you did it.</td>', 'Great shot.  Is the bee actually moving or is this setup with a dead bee on glass?  A friend of mine thought it might be since there is no motion trail.  Either way, I''m very impressed and gave you a 10.  Let us know how you did it.', '2002-07-18 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
