(87654, 3323, 2195, '<td valign="top">great stopped motion but the fingers a bit distracting and the background is a bit bland</td>', 'great stopped motion but the fingers a bit distracting and the background is a bit bland', '2002-07-20 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87655, 3323, 2752, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2002-07-20 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87656, 3323, 2428, '<td valign="top">is the bee trained? great level of detail.</td>', 'is the bee trained? great level of detail.', '2002-07-21 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87657, 3323, 1078, '<td valign="top">Good use of a dead/frozen bee.  Would have given this top mark but for what I see as a few small flaws.  First the focus isn''t quite where it needs to be -- the bee is a little out of focus.  Second, while I really like the simple background, I wish it was some other color that could accentuate the bee and fingertip.  Finally, the bee looks dead because the antennas are hanging down.  (Hopefully I''m not being ignorant and bee antennas do hang down -- if they do, well, I messed up.)  Very clever idea though.</td>', 'Good use of a dead/frozen bee.  Would have given this top mark but for what I see as a few small flaws.  First the focus isn''t quite where it needs to be -- the bee is a little out of focus.  Second, while I really like the simple background, I wish it was some other color that could accentuate the bee and fingertip.  Finally, the bee looks dead because the antennas are hanging down.  (Hopefully I''m not being ignorant and bee antennas do hang down -- if they do, well, I messed up.)  Very clever idea though.', '2002-07-21 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87658, 3323, 2810, '<td valign="top">This seems like a pretty good shot, but I am wondering if you have a Bee Circus.   :)~  I think I I would have chopped more off the top.</td>', 'This seems like a pretty good shot, but I am wondering if you have a Bee Circus.   :)~  I think I I would have chopped more off the top.', '2002-07-21 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87659, 3323, 661, '<td valign="top">Amazing clarity.  Great Composition.</td>', 'Amazing clarity.  Great Composition.', '2002-07-21 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87660, 3323, 1882, '<td valign="top">This is without a doubt the best photo of the week.</td>', 'This is without a doubt the best photo of the week.', '2002-07-22 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(87661, 3323, 472, '<td valign="top">good job, i hope you didnt get hurt, or used someone else :)</td>', 'good job, i hope you didnt get hurt, or used someone else :)', '2002-07-22 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(87662, 3323, 715, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and votes. <br/><br/>Well, like some of you already noticed, the bee is dead. It''s lying on top of a sheet of glass while my finger is below the glass. No bee training and no risk of being stung :)<br/><br/>It wasn''t my goal to make a perfectly sharp macrophoto of a bee, but a balanced photo that shows the tension between the bee and the fingertip. I made a shot on which the bee is perfectly in focus but I didn''t like it because it took all of the viewers attention to the bee only.<br/><br/>After reading the comments about it, I did a try-out with a blue background but it didn''t look too well because the blue didnt match witch the color of the finger. I think blue would look better though if it would be a bright colored flower instead of a finger.<br/><br/>Don''t worry Swashbuckler, the bee killed itself :). It was trying to escape trough a closed window and bees seem to keep trying to escape until they die (BTW before I get any complaints, there was no way I could save the it. The window can''t be opened and the bee was acting pretty aggressive so I didn''t dare to catch it).<br/><br/>I just came to my mind that it actaully might be possible to do a shot like this with a living bee by putting honey on my finger. I dont think Im gonna try it though :)<br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and votes. Well, like some of you already noticed, the bee is dead. It''s lying on top of a sheet of glass while my finger is below the glass. No bee training and no risk of being stung :)It wasn''t my goal to make a perfectly sharp macrophoto of a bee, but a balanced photo that shows the tension between the bee and the fingertip. I made a shot on which the bee is perfectly in focus but I didn''t like it because it took all of the viewers attention to the bee only.After reading the comments about it, I did a try-out with a blue background but it didn''t look too well because the blue didnt match witch the color of the finger. I think blue would look better though if it would be a bright colored flower instead of a finger.Don''t worry Swashbuckler, the bee killed itself :). It was trying to escape trough a closed window and bees seem to keep trying to escape until they die (BTW before I get any complaints, there was no way I could save the it. The window can''t be opened and the bee was acting pretty aggressive so I didn''t dare to catch it).I just came to my mind that it actaully might be possible to do a shot like this with a living bee by putting honey on my finger. I dont think Im gonna try it though :)', '2002-07-23 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(87663, 3323, 142, '<td valign="top">I really thought this should have gotten in the top three.  Great photo!</td>', 'I really thought this should have gotten in the top three.  Great photo!', '2002-07-24 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(87664, 3327, 2058, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot... if there were some ripples in the water to make it stand out more, or less lily pads around the flower, you would have had an even better picture.</td>', 'Very nice shot... if there were some ripples in the water to make it stand out more, or less lily pads around the flower, you would have had an even better picture.', '2002-07-15 03:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87665, 3327, 327, '<td valign="top">Hum, you did this well. I have shot this same shot in the sun and will tell you it was not 1/4 as nice. Good green, yellow and shadow. Well done. Kee</td>', 'Hum, you did this well. I have shot this same shot in the sun and will tell you it was not 1/4 as nice. Good green, yellow and shadow. Well done. Kee', '2002-07-15 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87666, 3327, 2152, '<td valign="top">Good sharp photo with nice colors, but I think the framing could be better.</td>', 'Good sharp photo with nice colors, but I think the framing could be better.', '2002-07-15 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87667, 3327, 737, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice lighting.', '2002-07-15 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87668, 3327, 1944, '<td valign="top">Beautifully sharp picture.</td>', 'Beautifully sharp picture.', '2002-07-15 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87669, 3327, 885, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower.  I wonder if you could have cropped it a big tighter though?  I''m not sure that the extra pads add too much.</td>', 'Pretty flower.  I wonder if you could have cropped it a big tighter though?  I''m not sure that the extra pads add too much.', '2002-07-15 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87670, 3327, 693, '<td valign="top">Great colours.  Finally, a flower shot which is in focus.  Nice one.</td>', 'Great colours.  Finally, a flower shot which is in focus.  Nice one.', '2002-07-15 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87671, 3327, 573, '<td valign="top">Excelent use of white to attract the attention of flower photographers.  ;-)<br/>All thec good, join all of the other flowers this week.</td>', 'Excelent use of white to attract the attention of flower photographers.  ;-)All thec good, join all of the other flowers this week.', '2002-07-15 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87672, 3327, 2700, '<td valign="top">OMFG!!!!!! GREAT DETAIL! (not to mention other stuff...)</td>', 'OMFG!!!!!! GREAT DETAIL! (not to mention other stuff...)', '2002-07-16 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87673, 3327, 2456, '<td valign="top">nice shot. I like the contrast of the rose and the leaves. Danie</td>', 'nice shot. I like the contrast of the rose and the leaves. Danie', '2002-07-16 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87674, 3327, 656, '<td valign="top">need to be closer to isolate the flower more, or further away to contrast the white/ green.</td>', 'need to be closer to isolate the flower more, or further away to contrast the white/ green.', '2002-07-16 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87675, 3327, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot :)  I would like it much better if the flower was more off center for effect... = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a very nice shot :)  I would like it much better if the flower was more off center for effect... = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
