(87677, 3327, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Good focus.  There seems to be a slight blemish on the bottom leaf of the flower...  Couldn''t you find a better one?  (Just Kidding!!)</td>', 'Nice composition.  Good focus.  There seems to be a slight blemish on the bottom leaf of the flower...  Couldn''t you find a better one?  (Just Kidding!!)', '2002-07-16 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
