(87694, 3327, 2810, '<td valign="top">Great composition.</td>', 'Great composition.', '2002-07-21 03:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87695, 3329, 1877, '<td valign="top">Very soft, looks like you did a good job with the light! 6</td>', 'Very soft, looks like you did a good job with the light! 6', '2002-07-15 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87696, 3329, 674, '<td valign="top">Focus a little off but maybe this was meant as it gives a lovely dreamy feel!</td>', 'Focus a little off but maybe this was meant as it gives a lovely dreamy feel!', '2002-07-15 03:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87697, 3329, 2719, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2002-07-15 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87698, 3329, 133, '<td valign="top">Very soft and inviting.  I like the 2 flowers being in the background.</td>', 'Very soft and inviting.  I like the 2 flowers being in the background.', '2002-07-15 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87699, 3329, 2011, '<td valign="top">I like the dark background</td>', 'I like the dark background', '2002-07-15 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87700, 3329, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice...</td>', 'nice...', '2002-07-15 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87701, 3329, 1019, '<td valign="top">lovely colours and texture</td>', 'lovely colours and texture', '2002-07-15 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87702, 3329, 436, '<td valign="top">I wish I''d already learned what you obviously have!  Simply fantastic lighting technique.  Now sahrpen the focus in the foreground and my 10 is yours!  As it stands...9 crisa58</td>', 'I wish I''d already learned what you obviously have!  Simply fantastic lighting technique.  Now sahrpen the focus in the foreground and my 10 is yours!  As it stands...9 crisa58', '2002-07-15 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87703, 3329, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty in pink. Lovely. Kee</td>', 'Pretty in pink. Lovely. Kee', '2002-07-15 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87704, 3329, 885, '<td valign="top">The lighting is nice...really emphasizes the soft colors of the flower.  I think though that if you have a limited depth of field, it''s usually better to focus on the closest element ...the nearest petals in this case.  The soft ones in front seem to detract from the sharper ones in back.</td>', 'The lighting is nice...really emphasizes the soft colors of the flower.  I think though that if you have a limited depth of field, it''s usually better to focus on the closest element ...the nearest petals in this case.  The soft ones in front seem to detract from the sharper ones in back.', '2002-07-15 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87705, 3329, 1944, '<td valign="top">Good practice:) Usually I would comment on the limited depth of focus, but with your picture, it adds to the mood. Very well done.</td>', 'Good practice:) Usually I would comment on the limited depth of focus, but with your picture, it adds to the mood. Very well done.', '2002-07-15 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87706, 3329, 2058, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Only comment is you could crop out the green on the left.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Only comment is you could crop out the green on the left.', '2002-07-15 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87707, 3329, 142, '<td valign="top">I love the soft focus on your rose.  This is beautiful.</td>', 'I love the soft focus on your rose.  This is beautiful.', '2002-07-15 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87708, 3329, 1005, '<td valign="top">Side shot of broad flower needs wider DOF.  Near petals out of focus.  I like the arrangement, color, framing.  6 Swash</td>', 'Side shot of broad flower needs wider DOF.  Near petals out of focus.  I like the arrangement, color, framing.  6 Swash', '2002-07-15 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87709, 3329, 2158, '<td valign="top">Pity the top front petals are out of focus.</td>', 'Pity the top front petals are out of focus.', '2002-07-15 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87710, 3329, 806, '<td valign="top">How pretty! I''d like to see the petals in the foreground (the top ones, not the base petals) a little sharper, but the light is beautiful, and so is the composition. The hint of roses in the back makes this dream-like.</td>', 'How pretty! I''d like to see the petals in the foreground (the top ones, not the base petals) a little sharper, but the light is beautiful, and so is the composition. The hint of roses in the back makes this dream-like.', '2002-07-15 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87711, 3329, 2437, '<td valign="top">soft light is good!</td>', 'soft light is good!', '2002-07-16 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87712, 3329, 2661, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Your practice with light seems to have paid off. Perhaps next time use a larger depth of field? Whatever. Good job.</td>', 'Nice work. Your practice with light seems to have paid off. Perhaps next time use a larger depth of field? Whatever. Good job.', '2002-07-16 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87713, 3329, 1403, '<td valign="top">ive seen way too many flower closeups today</td>', 'ive seen way too many flower closeups today', '2002-07-16 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87714, 3329, 409, '<td valign="top">too much pink</td>', 'too much pink', '2002-07-16 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87715, 3329, 2627, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2002-07-16 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87716, 3329, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image.. the contrast is excellent... If the depth of field encompassed the front side of the large flower, I think the impact would be much greater.  I feel that the large flower should be almost completely in foucs here.  If it was to lose focus, I would feel better about it losing focus on the back side rather than in the foreground... = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a lovely image.. the contrast is excellent... If the depth of field encompassed the front side of the large flower, I think the impact would be much greater.  I feel that the large flower should be almost completely in foucs here.  If it was to lose focus, I would feel better about it losing focus on the back side rather than in the foreground... = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87717, 3329, 1003, '<td valign="top">I find the front of the flower distracting. maybe if it were in focus it wouldn''t distract so much.</td>', 'I find the front of the flower distracting. maybe if it were in focus it wouldn''t distract so much.', '2002-07-16 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87718, 3329, 2200, '<td valign="top">more depth of field to focus petals in foreground would improve this picture.</td>', 'more depth of field to focus petals in foreground would improve this picture.', '2002-07-16 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87719, 3329, 258, '<td valign="top">Nice but background flowers are distracting.</td>', 'Nice but background flowers are distracting.', '2002-07-17 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87720, 3329, 2481, '<td valign="top">nice depth of field, details in flower</td>', 'nice depth of field, details in flower', '2002-07-17 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87721, 3329, 1175, '<td valign="top">I have found that the following comment is completely based on my opinion and not necessarily true techical rule.  I think you need more DOF and I believe it should start from the front of your subject.  For this picture I would have strived to have the DOF encompass the entire flower and then leave the other flowers on the edges of the frame out of focus.</td>', 'I have found that the following comment is completely based on my opinion and not necessarily true techical rule.  I think you need more DOF and I believe it should start from the front of your subject.  For this picture I would have strived to have the DOF encompass the entire flower and then leave the other flowers on the edges of the frame out of focus.', '2002-07-17 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87722, 3329, 2334, '<td valign="top">great soft pink</td>', 'great soft pink', '2002-07-17 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
