(87759, 3330, 2337, '<td valign="top">nice concept, but there are a couple of problems with it.  At least from my point of view.  The lower right flag on the floor shows the white (plastic bag?) thing you used to set up with.  The focus could have been sharper (I know focus is a matter of taste, but a flag shot usually lives and dies on ''sharp'') and the flag would likely have looked better if the ''bend'' in it wasn''t there... Maybe some starch?  This would be an interesting shot to try to reshoot.  It has real potential.  One last thing... If you could find a way to cover the white strip in the center with something red, white and blue, I think it would help a lot.  Qyl 5</td>', 'nice concept, but there are a couple of problems with it.  At least from my point of view.  The lower right flag on the floor shows the white (plastic bag?) thing you used to set up with.  The focus could have been sharper (I know focus is a matter of taste, but a flag shot usually lives and dies on ''sharp'') and the flag would likely have looked better if the ''bend'' in it wasn''t there... Maybe some starch?  This would be an interesting shot to try to reshoot.  It has real potential.  One last thing... If you could find a way to cover the white strip in the center with something red, white and blue, I think it would help a lot.  Qyl 5', '2002-07-18 03:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
