(87867, 3333, 2334, '<td valign="top">ooooh! a fox. it''s so cute. it looks like it''s on drugs.</td>', 'ooooh! a fox. it''s so cute. it looks like it''s on drugs.', '2002-07-17 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87868, 3333, 671, '<td valign="top">good portrait</td>', 'good portrait', '2002-07-17 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87869, 3333, 1005, '<td valign="top">90% wonderful shot.  Was this in a zoo or were you wildly lucky?  I don''t like the "faded" area in the upper left corner.  Did you shoot this through glass, maybe?  The deep greens of the grass and the color of the fox are wonderful.  8 Swash</td>', '90% wonderful shot.  Was this in a zoo or were you wildly lucky?  I don''t like the "faded" area in the upper left corner.  Did you shoot this through glass, maybe?  The deep greens of the grass and the color of the fox are wonderful.  8 Swash', '2002-07-17 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87870, 3333, 409, '<td valign="top">colours could be more lively. more red.</td>', 'colours could be more lively. more red.', '2002-07-17 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87871, 3333, 1748, '<td valign="top">great animal portrait,nature at its best</td>', 'great animal portrait,nature at its best', '2002-07-17 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87872, 3333, 637, '<td valign="top">Very nice look on face of animal.  Interesting, subtle lighting.  6 sjgleah</td>', 'Very nice look on face of animal.  Interesting, subtle lighting.  6 sjgleah', '2002-07-18 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87873, 3333, 1707, '<td valign="top">Good portions and angle of this fox which makes this guy look harmless.  I understand how difficult it can be to get such an excellent shot of wild animals (especially shy ones!). Good job! I only thing that slightly bothers me is the yellow flower.  I wish that was also in focus.</td>', 'Good portions and angle of this fox which makes this guy look harmless.  I understand how difficult it can be to get such an excellent shot of wild animals (especially shy ones!). Good job! I only thing that slightly bothers me is the yellow flower.  I wish that was also in focus.', '2002-07-18 03:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87874, 3333, 917, '<td valign="top">Wildlife is always hard, it doesnt pose, it doesnt like lights, it runs away when you try and get a different angle. All you can really do to improve on this shot is get luckier, which requires practice. Theres some fogging in the top left, which may be from sitting in a damp field for too long. Get a lens cloth and use it regularly.</td>', 'Wildlife is always hard, it doesnt pose, it doesnt like lights, it runs away when you try and get a different angle. All you can really do to improve on this shot is get luckier, which requires practice. Theres some fogging in the top left, which may be from sitting in a damp field for too long. Get a lens cloth and use it regularly.', '2002-07-18 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87875, 3333, 2481, '<td valign="top">fun shot of this fox!  tighter shot or cropping might be more effective</td>', 'fun shot of this fox!  tighter shot or cropping might be more effective', '2002-07-18 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87876, 3333, 2295, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Good focus, good lighting.</td>', 'Great picture.  Good focus, good lighting.', '2002-07-18 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87877, 3333, 587, '<td valign="top">This would make a fantastic cover for a book or in a book about them, I''m not quite sold on his eyes, but great job with DOF, coloring, lighting - great job. 9  cthenk</td>', 'This would make a fantastic cover for a book or in a book about them, I''m not quite sold on his eyes, but great job with DOF, coloring, lighting - great job. 9  cthenk', '2002-07-18 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87878, 3333, 142, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  I like the way you have framed the fox with the foilage around him.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  I like the way you have framed the fox with the foilage around him.', '2002-07-18 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
