(87957, 3336, 772, '<td valign="top">what an amazing scene... i think your exposure here is just about perfect.  any less and you would have too much darkness in the cliff rocks.  any more and you would have blown the water out completely.  I don''t know what is visible to the left of this image, but i would like the overall composition more if the fall was not dead centered.  I also really like the placement of the girl in this photo.  It gives a very nice sense of perspective to the size of these falls... = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'what an amazing scene... i think your exposure here is just about perfect.  any less and you would have too much darkness in the cliff rocks.  any more and you would have blown the water out completely.  I don''t know what is visible to the left of this image, but i would like the overall composition more if the fall was not dead centered.  I also really like the placement of the girl in this photo.  It gives a very nice sense of perspective to the size of these falls... = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-18 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
