(87966, 3336, 2221, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo! Very nice lighting and colors. The only thing is that I would have tried to let the girl look up, maybe a little more to the direction of the watrerfall. Now she seems to be a bit concentrated too much on herself.<br/>The title suggests that she''s falling asleep but then I would have chosen a more relaxed pose. Like resting on her ellbows.</td>', 'Wonderful photo! Very nice lighting and colors. The only thing is that I would have tried to let the girl look up, maybe a little more to the direction of the watrerfall. Now she seems to be a bit concentrated too much on herself.The title suggests that she''s falling asleep but then I would have chosen a more relaxed pose. Like resting on her ellbows.', '2002-07-21 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87967, 3336, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and very nice.  The only comment I would make is about the person.  Though there may be some significance to have her there, it almost looks out of place.  If she is to be there, maybe compose it so that she is a "larger" player in the picture.  Otherwise, an awesome shot.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and very nice.  The only comment I would make is about the person.  Though there may be some significance to have her there, it almost looks out of place.  If she is to be there, maybe compose it so that she is a "larger" player in the picture.  Otherwise, an awesome shot.', '2002-07-21 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(87968, 3336, 2079, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. I like almost everything about it....... The girl is a nice addition, she helps to show the sheer size of the falls. Her body language is all wrong. I want to see her doing something interesting. (perhaps dangling her feet in the water). she is in an exotic place but she is not dressed exotically, she looks more like a tourist- this is giving the feel of a snapshot. - 7</td>', 'Beautiful photo. I like almost everything about it....... The girl is a nice addition, she helps to show the sheer size of the falls. Her body language is all wrong. I want to see her doing something interesting. (perhaps dangling her feet in the water). she is in an exotic place but she is not dressed exotically, she looks more like a tourist- this is giving the feel of a snapshot. - 7', '2002-07-22 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
