(88013, 3338, 1041, '<td valign="top">funny that.  i was in montreal for the first time in my life this weekend, and this shot feels like it could''ve been taken there, too.  i like how much is going on in the shot and how the lights turn everything golden, even though they are a little blown out.  what''s the light to the left turning the shot a little green?  that''s a bit distracting to me.  otherwise fine shot. -- gr8photos (6)</td>', 'funny that.  i was in montreal for the first time in my life this weekend, and this shot feels like it could''ve been taken there, too.  i like how much is going on in the shot and how the lights turn everything golden, even though they are a little blown out.  what''s the light to the left turning the shot a little green?  that''s a bit distracting to me.  otherwise fine shot. -- gr8photos (6)', '2002-07-16 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
