(88019, 3338, 772, '<td valign="top">nice view :)  The glow in the upper left seema a little out of place and the coor of that glow doesn''t match the rest of the lighting in the image... this perspective obviously did not allow for removal of that... good shot :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice view :)  The glow in the upper left seema a little out of place and the coor of that glow doesn''t match the rest of the lighting in the image... this perspective obviously did not allow for removal of that... good shot :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-17 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88020, 3338, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  The glow in the upper left is a little detracting, though. karmat</td>', 'Good capture.  The glow in the upper left is a little detracting, though. karmat', '2002-07-17 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88021, 3338, 2456, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2002-07-17 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88022, 3338, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very nice work.  I like the color tones and the action.  The photo invites you to join in and take a stroll down the street.  Good composition.  Great work!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Very nice work.  I like the color tones and the action.  The photo invites you to join in and take a stroll down the street.  Good composition.  Great work!Ruthann', '2002-07-17 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88023, 3338, 1204, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Disturbing green light on the right.  How about cropping 15% from the right and the top and lose both this green stuff and the white lights in the far building?</td>', 'Nice.  Disturbing green light on the right.  How about cropping 15% from the right and the top and lose both this green stuff and the white lights in the far building?', '2002-07-17 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88024, 3338, 1031, '<td valign="top">Kinda has that "movie set" look.</td>', 'Kinda has that "movie set" look.', '2002-07-19 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88025, 3338, 1003, '<td valign="top">nice city night shot.</td>', 'nice city night shot.', '2002-07-19 04:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88026, 3338, 2802, '<td valign="top">i like it</td>', 'i like it', '2002-07-20 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88027, 3338, 2752, '<td valign="top">great night shot</td>', 'great night shot', '2002-07-21 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88028, 3338, 1078, '<td valign="top">I like some of the motion blue with the people -- gives some energy to the pic.  Wish there was something in the picture to really anchor my attention.  Looks like you got a little bit of a light flare in the upper left.  I wodner about a vertical crop that would center around the street running diagonally.  That would remove the light flare and cut out the mostly portion to the right where nothing much seems to be happening.</td>', 'I like some of the motion blue with the people -- gives some energy to the pic.  Wish there was something in the picture to really anchor my attention.  Looks like you got a little bit of a light flare in the upper left.  I wodner about a vertical crop that would center around the street running diagonally.  That would remove the light flare and cut out the mostly portion to the right where nothing much seems to be happening.', '2002-07-21 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88029, 3338, 2188, '<td valign="top">Great perspective shot! Wow! A little dark maybe?</td>', 'Great perspective shot! Wow! A little dark maybe?', '2002-07-22 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88031, 3343, 2312, '<td valign="top">Could you not crop the date out??? *3* --balynch</td>', 'Could you not crop the date out??? *3* --balynch', '2002-07-15 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88032, 3343, 2058, '<td valign="top">First, turn of the date feature of the camera ;) Then add some more light to the subject, run the water into something really dark, and increase the sharpness, and you''ll approach something that looks a lot nicer.</td>', 'First, turn of the date feature of the camera ;) Then add some more light to the subject, run the water into something really dark, and increase the sharpness, and you''ll approach something that looks a lot nicer.', '2002-07-15 04:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88033, 3343, 772, '<td valign="top">I would definitely turn the date function off... As for subject, I would not suggest bullseye centering.  This particular subject doesn''t hold any artistic or visual impact value for me.  The lighting is also a bit weak... = 3 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I would definitely turn the date function off... As for subject, I would not suggest bullseye centering.  This particular subject doesn''t hold any artistic or visual impact value for me.  The lighting is also a bit weak... = 3 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-15 07:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88034, 3343, 327, '<td valign="top"><br/></td>', '', '2002-07-15 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88035, 3343, 1005, '<td valign="top">I think I see what you were going for, but it''s too dark overall and there isn''t enough constrast between the water and the sink to really see the effects.  Please turn off the date stamp or step back so you can crop it out.  No downgrading for it, but it is distracting.  4 Swash</td>', 'I think I see what you were going for, but it''s too dark overall and there isn''t enough constrast between the water and the sink to really see the effects.  Please turn off the date stamp or step back so you can crop it out.  No downgrading for it, but it is distracting.  4 Swash', '2002-07-15 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88036, 3343, 587, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately your photo doesn''t do much for me - too dark (which in turn perhaps is why it''s so grainy), water coming out too fast to see any real stopped motion.  IMO you would do yourself a huge favor by reading your manual and turning off that offensive date stamp - that''s horrible. ~ cthenk</td>', 'Unfortunately your photo doesn''t do much for me - too dark (which in turn perhaps is why it''s so grainy), water coming out too fast to see any real stopped motion.  IMO you would do yourself a huge favor by reading your manual and turning off that offensive date stamp - that''s horrible. ~ cthenk', '2002-07-15 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88037, 3343, 142, '<td valign="top">The date stamp takes away from the picture and you need more light to bring out the details of the water.  Good effort.</td>', 'The date stamp takes away from the picture and you need more light to bring out the details of the water.  Good effort.', '2002-07-15 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88038, 3343, 280, '<td valign="top">Lose the date and get some more dramatic lighting on the subject</td>', 'Lose the date and get some more dramatic lighting on the subject', '2002-07-15 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88039, 3343, 1003, '<td valign="top">i like dating my photo''s too, but i hear that it detracts from the photo......</td>', 'i like dating my photo''s too, but i hear that it detracts from the photo......', '2002-07-16 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88040, 3343, 2337, '<td valign="top">The timestamp doesn''t really help this shot.  The rest of the shot is kind of dark with flat colors.  If that was your intent, you hit it on the money, but it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'The timestamp doesn''t really help this shot.  The rest of the shot is kind of dark with flat colors.  If that was your intent, you hit it on the money, but it doesn''t work for me.', '2002-07-16 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
