(88048, 3343, 2256, '<td valign="top">hmmm.....</td>', 'hmmm.....', '2002-07-17 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88049, 3343, 1041, '<td valign="top">that date stamp makes it look as if you took this shot a day before the challenge ... anyway, were you trying to recrate the stop motion challenge?  you did stop the motion, but, unfortunately, the subject''s not very enticing to me. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'that date stamp makes it look as if you took this shot a day before the challenge ... anyway, were you trying to recrate the stop motion challenge?  you did stop the motion, but, unfortunately, the subject''s not very enticing to me. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-07-17 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88050, 3343, 671, '<td valign="top">the date stamp is a nice touch.</td>', 'the date stamp is a nice touch.', '2002-07-17 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88051, 3343, 811, '<td valign="top">I think a couple of things could be done to make this a more interesting picture.  First, crop it or frame it so that the subject isn''t in the middle.  That makes it look kinda static.  Moving it to the left or right, or even moving the camera to get a funky angle would get a more dynamic shot.  Second, the try making it brighter by using more lights, or if you could get a hold of some colored lights that might be neat.  Good capture of water; not an easy subject to tackle, I think. karmat</td>', 'I think a couple of things could be done to make this a more interesting picture.  First, crop it or frame it so that the subject isn''t in the middle.  That makes it look kinda static.  Moving it to the left or right, or even moving the camera to get a funky angle would get a more dynamic shot.  Second, the try making it brighter by using more lights, or if you could get a hold of some colored lights that might be neat.  Good capture of water; not an easy subject to tackle, I think. karmat', '2002-07-17 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88052, 3343, 2172, '<td valign="top">I thought about not commenting, but ok here it is...Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t  really ''see'' this image - the subject or the photography.  I guess you''ll have to explain to me later.  I don''t know what else to say - sorry.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I thought about not commenting, but ok here it is...Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t  really ''see'' this image - the subject or the photography.  I guess you''ll have to explain to me later.  I don''t know what else to say - sorry.Ruthann', '2002-07-17 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88053, 3343, 889, '<td valign="top">I imagine you have gotten this already, but turn off the date when you take a picture for the contest.<br/>Also this is probably the worst subject you could have picked for your free shoot. and it isnt even clear.</td>', 'I imagine you have gotten this already, but turn off the date when you take a picture for the contest.Also this is probably the worst subject you could have picked for your free shoot. and it isnt even clear.', '2002-07-17 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88054, 3343, 668, '<td valign="top">AH! devine!!!</td>', 'AH! devine!!!', '2002-07-17 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88055, 3343, 2481, '<td valign="top">color values not distinct enough to make this effective</td>', 'color values not distinct enough to make this effective', '2002-07-18 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88056, 3343, 2152, '<td valign="top">I like how this picture makes me wonder what the subject is - the water, the drain or the date.  It looks like you did a pretty good job cleaning the sink, but it is underexposed.  The red date is a nice contrast against the sink.  It really stands out.  You should remember the rule of thirds on shots like this.</td>', 'I like how this picture makes me wonder what the subject is - the water, the drain or the date.  It looks like you did a pretty good job cleaning the sink, but it is underexposed.  The red date is a nice contrast against the sink.  It really stands out.  You should remember the rule of thirds on shots like this.', '2002-07-18 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88057, 3343, 2785, '<td valign="top">Underexposed, soft and exhibiting noise. Nothing of any great interest here.</td>', 'Underexposed, soft and exhibiting noise. Nothing of any great interest here.', '2002-07-18 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88058, 3343, 2370, '<td valign="top">underexposed!</td>', 'underexposed!', '2002-07-19 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
