(88060, 3343, 2815, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that date</td>', 'I don''t like that date', '2002-07-20 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88061, 3343, 2783, '<td valign="top">I''m just not sure what this picture is all about. And I hate that annoy date<br/>-4</td>', 'I''m just not sure what this picture is all about. And I hate that annoy date-4', '2002-07-20 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88062, 3343, 1407, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, the timestamp just kills it.</td>', 'I''m sorry, the timestamp just kills it.', '2002-07-21 04:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88063, 3343, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, I have to admit, I''m confused as to why you would enter this -- but beyond that....  If possible, please try to turn off the date stamp -- it can ruin really great photos.  The levels here could use some work -- so that everythign isn''t a totally flat color.  Third, try a different composition instead of dead center for your subject.  Though should get you started.</td>', 'OK, I have to admit, I''m confused as to why you would enter this -- but beyond that....  If possible, please try to turn off the date stamp -- it can ruin really great photos.  The levels here could use some work -- so that everythign isn''t a totally flat color.  Third, try a different composition instead of dead center for your subject.  Though should get you started.', '2002-07-21 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88064, 3343, 2079, '<td valign="top">Ooops, don''t forget to turn off the date feature, or allow enough room to crop it out. You  might try this with a little more light as well.</td>', 'Ooops, don''t forget to turn off the date feature, or allow enough room to crop it out. You  might try this with a little more light as well.', '2002-07-22 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88065, 3343, 2317, '<td valign="top">GEEE!<br/>I am new at this (dp) and this was my very first dp photo ever....<br/>When I shot this photo, my camera was about 26 min old...<br/><br/>Anyway, I didnt expected to have the last place... Well, I''m not frustrated, I promise I will improve... BEWARE OF ME... (in about 100 years)</td>', 'GEEE!I am new at this (dp) and this was my very first dp photo ever....When I shot this photo, my camera was about 26 min old...Anyway, I didnt expected to have the last place... Well, I''m not frustrated, I promise I will improve... BEWARE OF ME... (in about 100 years)', '2002-07-22 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88066, 3343, 668, '<td valign="top">damn...  I had seriously grown fond of this photo. i really like the complicated simplicity. its more real and intreaguing.  <br/>I think that the photos which rated the lowest are actually the most interesting, specially as they usually have alot hidden and, instead of the  boldly, unambigously stated images (usually ranking in the top-ten) this photos requires the participation of the ''audience''s'' creativity. i like not being spoon-fed. <br/>dont try to copy the winners just to rank higher - you''ll loose your individuality.</td>', 'damn...  I had seriously grown fond of this photo. i really like the complicated simplicity. its more real and intreaguing.  I think that the photos which rated the lowest are actually the most interesting, specially as they usually have alot hidden and, instead of the  boldly, unambigously stated images (usually ranking in the top-ten) this photos requires the participation of the ''audience''s'' creativity. i like not being spoon-fed. dont try to copy the winners just to rank higher - you''ll loose your individuality.', '2002-07-22 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88067, 3344, 2719, '<td valign="top">Or morning sex (reproductive cycle)!</td>', 'Or morning sex (reproductive cycle)!', '2002-07-15 08:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
