(88069, 3344, 92, '<td valign="top">This is a nice macro. The color just isn''t right and I''m not sure if that''s your camera that limits you or a change in levels you did.</td>', 'This is a nice macro. The color just isn''t right and I''m not sure if that''s your camera that limits you or a change in levels you did.', '2002-07-15 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
