(88207, 3349, 2703, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the water drops on the leaves. The color and exposure look good. I notice that the 2 leaves in front are slightly out of focus but the 2 leaves at the top of the frame a sharp as a tack. Was that done on purpose? The background is busy and kind of distracting. I probably would have made the depth of field shallower to make the subject jump out. Perhaps move in closer to isolate the subject to one leaf.</td>', 'I like the idea of the water drops on the leaves. The color and exposure look good. I notice that the 2 leaves in front are slightly out of focus but the 2 leaves at the top of the frame a sharp as a tack. Was that done on purpose? The background is busy and kind of distracting. I probably would have made the depth of field shallower to make the subject jump out. Perhaps move in closer to isolate the subject to one leaf.', '2002-07-17 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
