(88251, 3351, 1759, '<td valign="top">Interesting how one''s perception changes by merely flipping the image. The brain has it''s mechanisms and expects things to be a certain way, but when the artist deviates from the expected, a whole new world opens up to the senses. Very good out of the box job on this. I like the reflection much because it is strong and very well composed. Another of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Interesting how one''s perception changes by merely flipping the image. The brain has it''s mechanisms and expects things to be a certain way, but when the artist deviates from the expected, a whole new world opens up to the senses. Very good out of the box job on this. I like the reflection much because it is strong and very well composed. Another of my favorites this week.', '2002-07-20 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88252, 3351, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think flipping the image is good here, but I''d also crop it to 640x427 and eliminate the woodwork (now) at the bottom entirely.</td>', 'I think flipping the image is good here, but I''d also crop it to 640x427 and eliminate the woodwork (now) at the bottom entirely.', '2002-07-20 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
