(88276, 3352, 1793, '<td valign="top">i really like the tones that are used in this color. even the sky is darkish. <br/>perhaps i would choose a different angle and composition though -  for example to emphasize the size of the field relatively to the truck, if that''s possible.</td>', 'i really like the tones that are used in this color. even the sky is darkish. perhaps i would choose a different angle and composition though -  for example to emphasize the size of the field relatively to the truck, if that''s possible.', '2002-07-17 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88277, 3352, 573, '<td valign="top">Old T36 isn''t doing so well any more!  :-/<br/>I will pass along a bit of the advice that was given me on my last vehicle picture, it looke like you just walked up and took a picture from a standing position.  Try taking the picture from a diferent angle, may be low to the ground giving the feeling of power and strength to your picture, FWIW.</td>', 'Old T36 isn''t doing so well any more!  :-/I will pass along a bit of the advice that was given me on my last vehicle picture, it looke like you just walked up and took a picture from a standing position.  Try taking the picture from a diferent angle, may be low to the ground giving the feeling of power and strength to your picture, FWIW.', '2002-07-17 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88278, 3352, 772, '<td valign="top">I was wondering where i left my car... I went to the bar with a few friends, had a few drinks, and called a cab to take me home... oh well... it looks like someone stole my radio :(  Can ya give me a lift? ... excellent shot :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I was wondering where i left my car... I went to the bar with a few friends, had a few drinks, and called a cab to take me home... oh well... it looks like someone stole my radio :(  Can ya give me a lift? ... excellent shot :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-18 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88279, 3352, 527, '<td valign="top">Did you squeeze this photo to fit the proportions? That is a real no no in my book. It is still pretty cool with lots of neat details.<br/><br/>8  -Tim J</td>', 'Did you squeeze this photo to fit the proportions? That is a real no no in my book. It is still pretty cool with lots of neat details.8  -Tim J', '2002-07-18 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88280, 3352, 2785, '<td valign="top">crisp focus and nice perspective. Colors well defined and true. Aptly titled</td>', 'crisp focus and nice perspective. Colors well defined and true. Aptly titled', '2002-07-18 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88281, 3352, 1280, '<td valign="top">very good...clear, nice saturation, and certainly a nostalgia thingy.</td>', 'very good...clear, nice saturation, and certainly a nostalgia thingy.', '2002-07-19 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88282, 3352, 637, '<td valign="top">I like this idea alot, perhaps cuz I found a truck in even worse shape in a redwood forest.  I tried different angles and lighting and couldn''t capture something memorable... I''m not sure you''ve succeeded either... I''d like to see a perspective from below, looking up... or perhaps more of the field in which the truck is sitting.  5 sjgleah</td>', 'I like this idea alot, perhaps cuz I found a truck in even worse shape in a redwood forest.  I tried different angles and lighting and couldn''t capture something memorable... I''m not sure you''ve succeeded either... I''d like to see a perspective from below, looking up... or perhaps more of the field in which the truck is sitting.  5 sjgleah', '2002-07-19 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88283, 3352, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sad but true.  Sorry, but I just don''t know what to say about this shot.  7 Swash</td>', 'Sad but true.  Sorry, but I just don''t know what to say about this shot.  7 Swash', '2002-07-19 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88284, 3352, 1031, '<td valign="top">You capture the "mood" well in this one.</td>', 'You capture the "mood" well in this one.', '2002-07-20 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88285, 3352, 2783, '<td valign="top">Very artist and meaningful<br/><br/>It''s too bad I have to drive one of those!-9</td>', 'Very artist and meaningfulIt''s too bad I have to drive one of those!-9', '2002-07-20 03:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
