(88311, 3353, 2661, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. You did a great job of making both the sky and the building come out, which is often hard to do. I like the star and moon a lot.</td>', 'Very nice lighting. You did a great job of making both the sky and the building come out, which is often hard to do. I like the star and moon a lot.', '2002-07-16 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
