(88313, 3353, 2152, '<td valign="top">Great symmetry and I especially like what the moon adds to this shot.  I think the building could be a little sharper.  It seems like the focus is *just* off - but maybe that''s just me.  Other than that, a great shot.</td>', 'Great symmetry and I especially like what the moon adds to this shot.  I think the building could be a little sharper.  It seems like the focus is *just* off - but maybe that''s just me.  Other than that, a great shot.', '2002-07-16 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88314, 3353, 326, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I was one who left a comment about tilt. I understand now about the lens distortion, I am still in the process of learning this stuff. I also gave you a very nice score when I voted because this is a wonderful image.</td>', 'Sorry, I was one who left a comment about tilt. I understand now about the lens distortion, I am still in the process of learning this stuff. I also gave you a very nice score when I voted because this is a wonderful image.', '2002-07-16 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
