(88337, 3353, 472, '<td valign="top">the top spires with the lights and the moon in the sky are teh best part of this image.  the lower parts with the tree is not nearly as interesting.</td>', 'the top spires with the lights and the moon in the sky are teh best part of this image.  the lower parts with the tree is not nearly as interesting.', '2002-07-21 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
