(88346, 3355, 2058, '<td valign="top">Nice flower shot.  The white petals look a bit overexposed, but the overall brightness seems good to me.</td>', 'Nice flower shot.  The white petals look a bit overexposed, but the overall brightness seems good to me.', '2002-07-15 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88347, 3355, 327, '<td valign="top">How nice and calm this shot makes me feel. Lovely. Kee</td>', 'How nice and calm this shot makes me feel. Lovely. Kee', '2002-07-15 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88348, 3355, 573, '<td valign="top">Copy the comments from the last postcard photo and past here &amp;gt;&amp;gt;<br/>Copy the comments from the last flower photo and past here &amp;gt;&amp;gt;<br/>I''m feeling this is verry busy ckuttered, my attention is fluttering all over the place, nothing grabs me and says look at me I''m...</td>', 'Copy the comments from the last postcard photo and past here &gt;&gt;Copy the comments from the last flower photo and past here &gt;&gt;I''m feeling this is verry busy ckuttered, my attention is fluttering all over the place, nothing grabs me and says look at me I''m...', '2002-07-15 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88349, 3355, 806, '<td valign="top">Like Better Homes and Gardens! The whites are a bit washed out in the foreground, but it''s a pleasant shot.</td>', 'Like Better Homes and Gardens! The whites are a bit washed out in the foreground, but it''s a pleasant shot.', '2002-07-15 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88350, 3355, 1003, '<td valign="top">nice subject</td>', 'nice subject', '2002-07-15 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88351, 3355, 1856, '<td valign="top">beautiful garden.  I think I would have liked this more if the lighting hadn''t been so harsh.  7 Lisa</td>', 'beautiful garden.  I think I would have liked this more if the lighting hadn''t been so harsh.  7 Lisa', '2002-07-16 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88352, 3355, 2437, '<td valign="top">nice contrast...</td>', 'nice contrast...', '2002-07-16 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88353, 3355, 2661, '<td valign="top">looks like a nice place to be. The shot might be more effective if you isolated just one or two daisies, so the veritable army of flowers wouldn''t be quite so overwhelming. You could use pull-focus, a new angle, or a new composition. Nice shot though. My compliments to the gardener.</td>', 'looks like a nice place to be. The shot might be more effective if you isolated just one or two daisies, so the veritable army of flowers wouldn''t be quite so overwhelming. You could use pull-focus, a new angle, or a new composition. Nice shot though. My compliments to the gardener.', '2002-07-16 03:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88354, 3355, 1569, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field!</td>', 'Great depth of field!', '2002-07-16 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88355, 3355, 772, '<td valign="top">I love daisies... nice shot :) = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I love daisies... nice shot :) = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88356, 3355, 2334, '<td valign="top">nice. all the white balances well with all the green. or something.</td>', 'nice. all the white balances well with all the green. or something.', '2002-07-17 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88357, 3355, 1572, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!</td>', 'Very pretty!', '2002-07-17 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88358, 3355, 671, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, good composition.  The blurriness gives it a watercolor effect.</td>', 'Nice subject, good composition.  The blurriness gives it a watercolor effect.', '2002-07-17 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88359, 3355, 2111, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2002-07-17 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88360, 3355, 1005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful garden.  Nice shot.  I should say something silly like, where''s the bees or needs more exotic plants, but that could be confusing.  Nice use of available subject, seriously.  I know, could you have clipped half the flowers, so it wouldn''t look so busy?  Still kidding!  I never can guess what sillyness some voters will find to complain about.  Finally, well shot, good composition, just plain great.  8 Swash</td>', 'Beautiful garden.  Nice shot.  I should say something silly like, where''s the bees or needs more exotic plants, but that could be confusing.  Nice use of available subject, seriously.  I know, could you have clipped half the flowers, so it wouldn''t look so busy?  Still kidding!  I never can guess what sillyness some voters will find to complain about.  Finally, well shot, good composition, just plain great.  8 Swash', '2002-07-17 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88361, 3355, 1897, '<td valign="top">Pretty, bt a little busy.   A verticle of the left half would better suit my tastes.</td>', 'Pretty, bt a little busy.   A verticle of the left half would better suit my tastes.', '2002-07-17 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88362, 3355, 2481, '<td valign="top">nice garden shot, lighting could be more dramatic, maybe wait until later in the day or in the morning?</td>', 'nice garden shot, lighting could be more dramatic, maybe wait until later in the day or in the morning?', '2002-07-18 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88363, 3355, 637, '<td valign="top">The white flowers are a little too washed out for me... I like the composition and the colors otherwise.  5 sjgleah</td>', 'The white flowers are a little too washed out for me... I like the composition and the colors otherwise.  5 sjgleah', '2002-07-19 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88364, 3355, 2777, '<td valign="top">If daisies are main subject exposure should be the best on them - they seem over-exposed.</td>', 'If daisies are main subject exposure should be the best on them - they seem over-exposed.', '2002-07-19 05:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88365, 3355, 2125, '<td valign="top">Very good!! would also be nice if the hot photographer was in this pic with a daisy in her mouth ;-)</td>', 'Very good!! would also be nice if the hot photographer was in this pic with a daisy in her mouth ;-)', '2002-07-19 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88366, 3355, 2373, '<td valign="top">really pretty. nice shot</td>', 'really pretty. nice shot', '2002-07-20 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88367, 3355, 2801, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the composition. Overexposed.</td>', 'Don''t like the composition. Overexposed.', '2002-07-20 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88368, 3355, 1759, '<td valign="top">Lovely spot! Looks like a nice place to nuzzle in with a book and cup of favorite tea. Compositionally, I like this very much, it sets a nice mood. Technically, the green stuff is nicely exposed, but the white petals are just a tad overexposed. It''s tough to get a perfect exposure with a digicam, either the highlights blow out, or the shadow areas get lost.</td>', 'Lovely spot! Looks like a nice place to nuzzle in with a book and cup of favorite tea. Compositionally, I like this very much, it sets a nice mood. Technically, the green stuff is nicely exposed, but the white petals are just a tad overexposed. It''s tough to get a perfect exposure with a digicam, either the highlights blow out, or the shadow areas get lost.', '2002-07-20 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88369, 3355, 2752, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2002-07-21 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88370, 3355, 2428, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, thers nothing more to it.</td>', 'Nice colors, thers nothing more to it.', '2002-07-21 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88371, 3355, 472, '<td valign="top">good and sharp!  a profusion of flowers</td>', 'good and sharp!  a profusion of flowers', '2002-07-21 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88372, 3356, 1877, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I like your idea, but I think there needed to be more light on it. The arm of the record player blends in with the record itself too much. I like how you have some shine to the bottom-left, but a little more would have given you a few more points from me. 4</td>', 'Hmm, I like your idea, but I think there needed to be more light on it. The arm of the record player blends in with the record itself too much. I like how you have some shine to the bottom-left, but a little more would have given you a few more points from me. 4', '2002-07-15 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88373, 3356, 2719, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2002-07-15 07:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88374, 3356, 133, '<td valign="top">Great use of blur/motion in a photograph.</td>', 'Great use of blur/motion in a photograph.', '2002-07-15 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88375, 3356, 1856, '<td valign="top">This has great potential.  I would have polished up the metal on the arm and used a stronger light for reflection.  May have cropped a tad wider on the top and left.  7 Lisa</td>', 'This has great potential.  I would have polished up the metal on the arm and used a stronger light for reflection.  May have cropped a tad wider on the top and left.  7 Lisa', '2002-07-15 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
