(88377, 3356, 2058, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition.  I think a bit more light on the record would have helped.  It looks like the needle is just floating in the air.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition.  I think a bit more light on the record would have helped.  It looks like the needle is just floating in the air.', '2002-07-15 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
