(88396, 3356, 1759, '<td valign="top">Love it! love the concept, the message, and the photo. I like how the reflected light at left balances with the tone arm and anchors to the frame.  I notice that you got motion in the label, but also caught the label at an upright position. How''d you do that?</td>', 'Love it! love the concept, the message, and the photo. I like how the reflected light at left balances with the tone arm and anchors to the frame.  I notice that you got motion in the label, but also caught the label at an upright position. How''d you do that?', '2002-07-20 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
