(88464, 3362, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, wonderful shot.  Great everything.  This is my fourth 10 for this challenge, but this is the best I have seen so far.  Good luck!  10 Swash</td>', 'Wow, wonderful shot.  Great everything.  This is my fourth 10 for this challenge, but this is the best I have seen so far.  Good luck!  10 Swash', '2002-07-15 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88465, 3362, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed and posed photo. Good color and exposure.</td>', 'Very nicely composed and posed photo. Good color and exposure.', '2002-07-15 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88466, 3362, 573, '<td valign="top">You have captured the verv of the moment. One of my tens this week.</td>', 'You have captured the verv of the moment. One of my tens this week.', '2002-07-15 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88467, 3362, 693, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful!  However there are a few minor imperfections.  First, the overall image appears slightly dark and flat - some time spent colour correcting with curves in photoshop would have brought out the colours and made it more brilliant/vibrant.  Second, the image appears slightly out of focus - some minor sharpening would have likely improved it.  Have a look at //homepage.mac.com/ashahrestani/PhotoAlbum17.html  for before and after comparisons of your image.<br/><br/>Great composition though. 8 Brumos</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful!  However there are a few minor imperfections.  First, the overall image appears slightly dark and flat - some time spent colour correcting with curves in photoshop would have brought out the colours and made it more brilliant/vibrant.  Second, the image appears slightly out of focus - some minor sharpening would have likely improved it.  Have a look at //homepage.mac.com/ashahrestani/PhotoAlbum17.html  for before and after comparisons of your image.Great composition though. 8 Brumos', '2002-07-15 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88468, 3362, 2, '<td valign="top">The composition of this shot is really wonderful.  I think if the grass were as bold and bright as her dress is, I''d give this one a 10.  You might want to play with the levels/saturation on this shot.</td>', 'The composition of this shot is really wonderful.  I think if the grass were as bold and bright as her dress is, I''d give this one a 10.  You might want to play with the levels/saturation on this shot.', '2002-07-15 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
