(88484, 3362, 1856, '<td valign="top">I''ve been through 161 images and this is my favorite so far.  I love the feeling of this photo...a classic and tasteful shot of a child.  Great job!  9</td>', 'I''ve been through 161 images and this is my favorite so far.  I love the feeling of this photo...a classic and tasteful shot of a child.  Great job!  9', '2002-07-16 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
