(88492, 3362, 641, '<td valign="top">What a great shot! So soft and lovely. - faerieaeone</td>', 'What a great shot! So soft and lovely. - faerieaeone', '2002-07-17 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88493, 3362, 2456, '<td valign="top">I think it''s really hard to take pictures with peple for this challenge. But this is really a very very nice shot. I love it. Was it composed or did you just catch her like that? Danie</td>', 'I think it''s really hard to take pictures with peple for this challenge. But this is really a very very nice shot. I love it. Was it composed or did you just catch her like that? Danie', '2002-07-17 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88494, 3362, 668, '<td valign="top">lovely and futuristic</td>', 'lovely and futuristic', '2002-07-17 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88495, 3362, 1748, '<td valign="top">classic shot</td>', 'classic shot', '2002-07-17 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88496, 3362, 917, '<td valign="top">Its a bit too posed for my taste.</td>', 'Its a bit too posed for my taste.', '2002-07-18 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88497, 3362, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice lighting, nice pose, beautiful beach, beautiful child...the white dress is so striking with her skin tone.  I''m not crazy about the title...i think it suggests too much grown-up-ness, but of course I don''t have a better suggestion or anything :-)  Good work.</td>', 'Nice composition, nice lighting, nice pose, beautiful beach, beautiful child...the white dress is so striking with her skin tone.  I''m not crazy about the title...i think it suggests too much grown-up-ness, but of course I don''t have a better suggestion or anything :-)  Good work.', '2002-07-18 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88498, 3362, 933, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo!  The sky seems just a touch grainy to me, and the contrast set a bit strong, but otherwise a perfect photo!  Great work!  9 - md</td>', 'Excellent photo!  The sky seems just a touch grainy to me, and the contrast set a bit strong, but otherwise a perfect photo!  Great work!  9 - md', '2002-07-18 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88499, 3362, 772, '<td valign="top">lovely photograph.. can''t say much more than that.  = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'lovely photograph.. can''t say much more than that.  = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-18 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88500, 3362, 1793, '<td valign="top">10! no words, just 10!</td>', '10! no words, just 10!', '2002-07-18 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88501, 3362, 2079, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, This is my top pick for this challenge. 10  This is picture perfect I do like the title, but I cant figure out how it ties in with the picture.  (I never let the title influence the quality of the picture)  The skin tones are excellent, The hat, the bare feet, the white dress is all superb against the other colors. This picture allows me to be many places, It gives a strong feeling of being in the Mediterranean.</td>', 'Congratulations, This is my top pick for this challenge. 10  This is picture perfect I do like the title, but I cant figure out how it ties in with the picture.  (I never let the title influence the quality of the picture)  The skin tones are excellent, The hat, the bare feet, the white dress is all superb against the other colors. This picture allows me to be many places, It gives a strong feeling of being in the Mediterranean.', '2002-07-18 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88502, 3362, 811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, composition, and framing.  This would make a wonderful print.</td>', 'Wonderful colors, composition, and framing.  This would make a wonderful print.', '2002-07-19 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88503, 3362, 640, '<td valign="top">really nice. looks like my dream world</td>', 'really nice. looks like my dream world', '2002-07-19 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88504, 3362, 637, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure; nice composition; nice idea 6 sjgleah</td>', 'Nice exposure; nice composition; nice idea 6 sjgleah', '2002-07-19 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88505, 3362, 2120, '<td valign="top">My scores always change the longer I look at things. I gave this a first impression 6 however the more I look at the more it seemed to work for me. It is definately something I would like to see in its original form. Now it is an 8</td>', 'My scores always change the longer I look at things. I gave this a first impression 6 however the more I look at the more it seemed to work for me. It is definately something I would like to see in its original form. Now it is an 8', '2002-07-19 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88506, 3362, 2586, '<td valign="top">Great composition. This picture is mood invoking. Reminds me of paintings.</td>', 'Great composition. This picture is mood invoking. Reminds me of paintings.', '2002-07-19 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88507, 3362, 715, '<td valign="top">Great composition and I like the way the white dress contrasts with the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Great composition and I like the way the white dress contrasts with the rest of the photo.', '2002-07-19 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88508, 3362, 1193, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  No complaints or suggestions.  I love her pose and the composition of the photo in general.</td>', 'Great photo!  No complaints or suggestions.  I love her pose and the composition of the photo in general.', '2002-07-20 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88509, 3362, 2255, '<td valign="top">The white dress and the contrasting shadow hiding her face make this picture absolutely beautiful in my opinion.  Great work!</td>', 'The white dress and the contrasting shadow hiding her face make this picture absolutely beautiful in my opinion.  Great work!', '2002-07-20 05:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88510, 3362, 2634, '<td valign="top">love your photo - great composition and color</td>', 'love your photo - great composition and color', '2002-07-20 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88511, 3362, 741, '<td valign="top">Normally I hate the "cute kid" style of pictures - but this looks like it''s taken from a high quality calendar.  I''ve looked hard for something to comment on but it''s just too good.</td>', 'Normally I hate the "cute kid" style of pictures - but this looks like it''s taken from a high quality calendar.  I''ve looked hard for something to comment on but it''s just too good.', '2002-07-20 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88512, 3362, 2172, '<td valign="top">Nice work - so soft.  This is a very pleasing photo.  Great work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Nice work - so soft.  This is a very pleasing photo.  Great work.Ruthann', '2002-07-20 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88513, 3362, 2783, '<td valign="top">Very good, just a little out of focus in the background<br/>-9</td>', 'Very good, just a little out of focus in the background-9', '2002-07-20 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88514, 3362, 835, '<td valign="top">Sweet picture and I really like the placement of it all.  I love the white dress with the scene but the pose looks too "posed" for me.  I like the pose but for a perfect 10 it needs to look more natural. I give it a 9</td>', 'Sweet picture and I really like the placement of it all.  I love the white dress with the scene but the pose looks too "posed" for me.  I like the pose but for a perfect 10 it needs to look more natural. I give it a 9', '2002-07-20 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88515, 3362, 1031, '<td valign="top">I Like the composition. Color looks a little flat for a sunny day.</td>', 'I Like the composition. Color looks a little flat for a sunny day.', '2002-07-20 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88516, 3362, 2317, '<td valign="top">Catalogable!!!</td>', 'Catalogable!!!', '2002-07-21 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88517, 3362, 2810, '<td valign="top">Composition is ok, lighting is good, but could use a bit more focus.</td>', 'Composition is ok, lighting is good, but could use a bit more focus.', '2002-07-21 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88518, 3362, 2825, '<td valign="top">very beautiful</td>', 'very beautiful', '2002-07-21 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88519, 3362, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, I reallt like this one. 9-ClubJuggle</td>', 'Excellent shot, I reallt like this one. 9-ClubJuggle', '2002-07-21 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88520, 3362, 1847, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for beach pictures.  And the cropping here is perfect.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for beach pictures.  And the cropping here is perfect.', '2002-07-21 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88521, 3362, 1078, '<td valign="top">Pretty, pretty picture.  I love the bright white of her dress, and her skins tones look good, but the rest of the levels seem a little dark (especially the grass).  I also think this one would be good for a really large depth of field (small aperture, big F#) so that everything was in a sharp focus.  The downside of that is a longer shutter speed -- if it was windy, it wouldn''t work because everything would be blurry for other reasons.  Anyway, good capture.</td>', 'Pretty, pretty picture.  I love the bright white of her dress, and her skins tones look good, but the rest of the levels seem a little dark (especially the grass).  I also think this one would be good for a really large depth of field (small aperture, big F#) so that everything was in a sharp focus.  The downside of that is a longer shutter speed -- if it was windy, it wouldn''t work because everything would be blurry for other reasons.  Anyway, good capture.', '2002-07-21 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88522, 3362, 2317, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.... as I said... CATALOGABLE!!!!!</td>', 'Congratulations.... as I said... CATALOGABLE!!!!!', '2002-07-22 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88523, 3362, 772, '<td valign="top">WTG Karen!  Excellent shot... well deserved ribbon :)</td>', 'WTG Karen!  Excellent shot... well deserved ribbon :)', '2002-07-22 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88524, 3362, 587, '<td valign="top">Hooray on your 2nd place finish!!</td>', 'Hooray on your 2nd place finish!!', '2002-07-22 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88525, 3362, 806, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for such wonderful comments and support! This was the first time I envisioned how I wanted a photograph to appear, and then set out to produce it. I got the feeling and results I wanted to acheive. Felt good! It has been an uplifting week!<br/></td>', 'Thank you everyone for such wonderful comments and support! This was the first time I envisioned how I wanted a photograph to appear, and then set out to produce it. I got the feeling and results I wanted to acheive. Felt good! It has been an uplifting week!', '2002-07-22 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88526, 3362, 327, '<td valign="top">CONGRATS!!.....well deserved!</td>', 'CONGRATS!!.....well deserved!', '2002-07-22 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88527, 3362, 2586, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Karen. I just love this picture and thought it was taken somewhere in Central America! lol<br/>It''s funny how subjective one is. I read Patella''s comment and he would have liked to see everything in sharp focus. I, on the other hand, particularly likes the grass out of focus. It gives the image a painterly feel and it draws all the attention on the little girl in the white dress.</td>', 'Congrats, Karen. I just love this picture and thought it was taken somewhere in Central America! lolIt''s funny how subjective one is. I read Patella''s comment and he would have liked to see everything in sharp focus. I, on the other hand, particularly likes the grass out of focus. It gives the image a painterly feel and it draws all the attention on the little girl in the white dress.', '2002-07-22 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88528, 3362, 1042, '<td valign="top">Congrats Karen!! I loved this shot...one of my 10''s for sure. :)</td>', 'Congrats Karen!! I loved this shot...one of my 10''s for sure. :)', '2002-07-22 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88529, 3362, 737, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on 2nd place. Simply a very beautiful shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on 2nd place. Simply a very beautiful shot.', '2002-07-22 08:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88530, 3362, 1569, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on second,Karen, great photo!!!</td>', 'Congratulations on second,Karen, great photo!!!', '2002-07-22 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88531, 3362, 806, '<td valign="top">BTW: I should have also said: Thank you to my daughter, Kaela, as she was a very cooperative model! ;)</td>', 'BTW: I should have also said: Thank you to my daughter, Kaela, as she was a very cooperative model! ;)', '2002-07-22 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(88532, 3362, 885, '<td valign="top">Great work, Karen.  I guessed this was yours :-)</td>', 'Great work, Karen.  I guessed this was yours :-)', '2002-07-22 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
