(88540, 3363, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very good macro shot. Your depth of field is perfect. What should be sharp is. Good exposure.</td>', 'Very good macro shot. Your depth of field is perfect. What should be sharp is. Good exposure.', '2002-07-15 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
