(88587, 3364, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice pet portrait.  If you have a chance, I think it would be better to photograph him/her on a darker or lighter background so he/she doesn''t blend into the carpet so much.  Also, though I like the light on the top of the head and how it brings out the texture of the fur, that on the left of the photo is a little distracting.  It also feels quite closely cropped...I might try giving him/her a little more room in the frame.</td>', 'Nice pet portrait.  If you have a chance, I think it would be better to photograph him/her on a darker or lighter background so he/she doesn''t blend into the carpet so much.  Also, though I like the light on the top of the head and how it brings out the texture of the fur, that on the left of the photo is a little distracting.  It also feels quite closely cropped...I might try giving him/her a little more room in the frame.', '2002-07-16 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
