(88762, 3379, 2172, '<td valign="top">Interesting and good photography - just 1 quest.  What are the lines? - that''s the only thing that distracts me - I can''t seem to not-concentrate on the lines.  Also - just my opinion - I think I would like it a little more cropped (off of the bottom) I think the strong aspect is the cieling - perhaps about 1/2'' off the bottom - would give a great angle down the middle.  Anyway, you probably have a different view.  Still really great work!! - Can''t wait to find out where this is.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Interesting and good photography - just 1 quest.  What are the lines? - that''s the only thing that distracts me - I can''t seem to not-concentrate on the lines.  Also - just my opinion - I think I would like it a little more cropped (off of the bottom) I think the strong aspect is the cieling - perhaps about 1/2'' off the bottom - would give a great angle down the middle.  Anyway, you probably have a different view.  Still really great work!! - Can''t wait to find out where this is.Ruthann', '2002-07-17 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
