(88814, 3382, 811, '<td valign="top">Was the yellowish cast intentional?  If not, adjusting the white balance on your camera, if possible, or in post-processing, if accessible, may eliminate it for you.  There may simply be too much "stuff" in this picture, especially with the empty space behind it.  If the entire countertop (?) had been full of stuff, it would look more intentional.</td>', 'Was the yellowish cast intentional?  If not, adjusting the white balance on your camera, if possible, or in post-processing, if accessible, may eliminate it for you.  There may simply be too much "stuff" in this picture, especially with the empty space behind it.  If the entire countertop (?) had been full of stuff, it would look more intentional.', '2002-07-17 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88815, 3382, 1041, '<td valign="top">don''t see any flies, but can see why you expect them imminently.  not a very appetizing photo.  the yellow tint doesn''t help. and the wine glass looks too clean.  this photo just doesn''t do anything for me, sorry. -- gr8photos (2)</td>', 'don''t see any flies, but can see why you expect them imminently.  not a very appetizing photo.  the yellow tint doesn''t help. and the wine glass looks too clean.  this photo just doesn''t do anything for me, sorry. -- gr8photos (2)', '2002-07-17 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
