(88821, 3382, 1658, '<td valign="top">There is really a lot going on here.  I think the shot would have had more impact to me if there was a more defined continuity to the objects, and fewer of them.  The shot has a lot of potential, but I think with less happening in it, it would be a stronger shot.</td>', 'There is really a lot going on here.  I think the shot would have had more impact to me if there was a more defined continuity to the objects, and fewer of them.  The shot has a lot of potential, but I think with less happening in it, it would be a stronger shot.', '2002-07-18 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
