(88990, 3389, 2337, '<td valign="top">Looks a little snapshotish... From what I can see the audiance looks like a real interesting subject.  Maybe if you go to another of whatever this is, you should try shooting the folks around you that are watching.</td>', 'Looks a little snapshotish... From what I can see the audiance looks like a real interesting subject.  Maybe if you go to another of whatever this is, you should try shooting the folks around you that are watching.', '2002-07-17 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88991, 3389, 811, '<td valign="top">Good focus and lighting for this kind of situation.  There is alot going on in this picture.  Maybe choosing one element and focusing on it would improve effectiveness.  Or if you had changed the angle just a little so that the people across the ring didn''t have a rope across their eyes.  karmat</td>', 'Good focus and lighting for this kind of situation.  There is alot going on in this picture.  Maybe choosing one element and focusing on it would improve effectiveness.  Or if you had changed the angle just a little so that the people across the ring didn''t have a rope across their eyes.  karmat', '2002-07-17 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(88992, 3389, 2172, '<td valign="top">I can''t help it, but wrestling is one of my least favorite things and therefore am prejudice against this photo ...trying to put that aside, perhaps cropping in more to focus on the ref would''ve made it stronger.   Just being honest - sorry.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I can''t help it, but wrestling is one of my least favorite things and therefore am prejudice against this photo ...trying to put that aside, perhaps cropping in more to focus on the ref would''ve made it stronger.   Just being honest - sorry.Ruthann', '2002-07-17 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
