(89005, 3390, 2058, '<td valign="top">Good subject and composition.  I do like black and white, and I think it does work on some of the textures in this image, but I think color might have worked better here.  Maybe desaturated color like you see in Saving Private Ryan</td>', 'Good subject and composition.  I do like black and white, and I think it does work on some of the textures in this image, but I think color might have worked better here.  Maybe desaturated color like you see in Saving Private Ryan', '2002-07-15 03:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
