(89007, 3390, 2120, '<td valign="top">Well, I have only been voting for two weeks, however this is my first 10 so you win the prize. The expression and something about the contrasting textures between the shirt and the flag just work for me. I am curious if you have a color version of this, however I feel that the B&amp;W was a better choice. Great Shot.   --Agamemnon</td>', 'Well, I have only been voting for two weeks, however this is my first 10 so you win the prize. The expression and something about the contrasting textures between the shirt and the flag just work for me. I am curious if you have a color version of this, however I feel that the B&W was a better choice. Great Shot.   --Agamemnon', '2002-07-15 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89008, 3390, 1997, '<td valign="top">Ok picture, but the subject (american flag) is tired...</td>', 'Ok picture, but the subject (american flag) is tired...', '2002-07-15 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89009, 3390, 573, '<td valign="top">Grabs my patriotism but not my WOW factor, technicaly very well done.</td>', 'Grabs my patriotism but not my WOW factor, technicaly very well done.', '2002-07-15 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89010, 3390, 327, '<td valign="top">Real nice shot. The white on her left is too harsh, fried. I know it''s what the camera was using to make it''s adjustments. Still this is a moving photo, and she is just perfectly wonderful. Great expression for this shot. Kee</td>', 'Real nice shot. The white on her left is too harsh, fried. I know it''s what the camera was using to make it''s adjustments. Still this is a moving photo, and she is just perfectly wonderful. Great expression for this shot. Kee', '2002-07-15 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89011, 3390, 885, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait.  The woman looks very suspicious looking off to the side like that to me...so I don''t what message this is supposed to be giving.  I guess it''s supposed to be one of resolute determination judging from the title.  I''d have preferred her outfit to be a bit less strongly lighted so that it would blend in more with the flag in the background which would emphasize your ''indivisible'' theme a bit more.  I guess I''m assuming this is set up, so my comments are revolving around that...if this is candid then it''s extremely excellent :-)</td>', 'Interesting portrait.  The woman looks very suspicious looking off to the side like that to me...so I don''t what message this is supposed to be giving.  I guess it''s supposed to be one of resolute determination judging from the title.  I''d have preferred her outfit to be a bit less strongly lighted so that it would blend in more with the flag in the background which would emphasize your ''indivisible'' theme a bit more.  I guess I''m assuming this is set up, so my comments are revolving around that...if this is candid then it''s extremely excellent :-)', '2002-07-15 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89012, 3390, 714, '<td valign="top">Seems a little bright in some areas.  6</td>', 'Seems a little bright in some areas.  6', '2002-07-15 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
