(89014, 3390, 92, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a journalism photo. This is great ! I like that she isn''t looking right at you like a statue. This looks like a 60''s Viet Nam photo from some support group...well for that matter it fits the US today ! GREAT job !!!! = 10 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'This reminds me of a journalism photo. This is great ! I like that she isn''t looking right at you like a statue. This looks like a 60''s Viet Nam photo from some support group...well for that matter it fits the US today ! GREAT job !!!! = 10 Shiiizzzam', '2002-07-15 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
