(89024, 3390, 245, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see some portraiture, especially such an honest image. Very striking, indeed!</td>', 'It''s nice to see some portraiture, especially such an honest image. Very striking, indeed!', '2002-07-17 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89025, 3390, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2002-07-17 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89026, 3390, 2337, '<td valign="top">Would hang this on my wall in a heartbeat!  My wife was a little upset that you used a flag that left out Hawaii, but she''ll get over it :)</td>', 'Would hang this on my wall in a heartbeat!  My wife was a little upset that you used a flag that left out Hawaii, but she''ll get over it :)', '2002-07-17 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89027, 3390, 2543, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry too many stars and stripes for this non-merkians taste!</td>', 'I''m sorry too many stars and stripes for this non-merkians taste!', '2002-07-17 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89028, 3390, 2334, '<td valign="top">wow. stars and stripes. interesting.</td>', 'wow. stars and stripes. interesting.', '2002-07-17 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89029, 3390, 2256, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W</td>', 'I like the B&W', '2002-07-17 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89030, 3390, 2668, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, contrast is a bit harsh, otherwise great job.</td>', 'Nice picture, contrast is a bit harsh, otherwise great job.', '2002-07-17 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89031, 3390, 1748, '<td valign="top">i wish she was looking at the camera, but I like this image very much</td>', 'i wish she was looking at the camera, but I like this image very much', '2002-07-17 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89032, 3390, 1707, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  I love how the stripes on her shirt coorespond to the stripes on the flag in the background and how the stars on her shirt are in the opposite corner of the stars on the flag.  her expression is also great.  Excellent job!</td>', 'Fantastic!  I love how the stripes on her shirt coorespond to the stripes on the flag in the background and how the stars on her shirt are in the opposite corner of the stars on the flag.  her expression is also great.  Excellent job!', '2002-07-18 03:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89033, 3390, 2481, '<td valign="top">nice flag image contrasts; sullen girl works well here too; good range of tonal values</td>', 'nice flag image contrasts; sullen girl works well here too; good range of tonal values', '2002-07-18 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89034, 3390, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a phenomenal black and white.  it''s almost too busybut i really love the concept.  I would have made an attempt to cut the ''red'' flag line out of the top of the image and let the white line be at the top edge.... great shot = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is a phenomenal black and white.  it''s almost too busybut i really love the concept.  I would have made an attempt to cut the ''red'' flag line out of the top of the image and let the white line be at the top edge.... great shot = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-18 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89035, 3390, 2472, '<td valign="top">I really missed the color in this image. Otherwise it''s a beutiful portrait.</td>', 'I really missed the color in this image. Otherwise it''s a beutiful portrait.', '2002-07-18 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89036, 3390, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice concept</td>', 'Nice concept', '2002-07-18 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89037, 3390, 811, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, shall I say your model doesn''t look to be too happy.  Other than that, I like how you have this composed with the flag''s stars on her right, and the shirt''s stars on her left.  I know you probably have a reason for having this in BW, it does have a certain mood to it, but how did it look in color?</td>', 'Hmmm, shall I say your model doesn''t look to be too happy.  Other than that, I like how you have this composed with the flag''s stars on her right, and the shirt''s stars on her left.  I know you probably have a reason for having this in BW, it does have a certain mood to it, but how did it look in color?', '2002-07-18 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89038, 3390, 2777, '<td valign="top">Very good  exposure. Nicely composed.</td>', 'Very good  exposure. Nicely composed.', '2002-07-19 05:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89039, 3390, 917, '<td valign="top">Excelent picture. 10</td>', 'Excelent picture. 10', '2002-07-19 08:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89040, 3390, 1175, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I like this picture in black and white.  In some ways I really do and in some ways I don''t.  her face and the texture of the jacket really come out in black and white.  But you use the colors of the flag.  The blue field and the red lines look almost the same color.  Also the lines on her jacket appear to be overexposed.</td>', 'I''m not sure if I like this picture in black and white.  In some ways I really do and in some ways I don''t.  her face and the texture of the jacket really come out in black and white.  But you use the colors of the flag.  The blue field and the red lines look almost the same color.  Also the lines on her jacket appear to be overexposed.', '2002-07-19 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89041, 3390, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pensive, but nice.  Photo is O.K., but I''m not too crazy about how black and white makes the flag look like it''s only two colors.  7 Swash</td>', 'Pensive, but nice.  Photo is O.K., but I''m not too crazy about how black and white makes the flag look like it''s only two colors.  7 Swash', '2002-07-19 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89042, 3390, 2801, '<td valign="top">Creative.</td>', 'Creative.', '2002-07-20 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89043, 3390, 637, '<td valign="top">Nice use of b&amp;w... wonderful look on her face... great worn sweater... 7 sjgleah</td>', 'Nice use of b&w... wonderful look on her face... great worn sweater... 7 sjgleah', '2002-07-20 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89044, 3390, 587, '<td valign="top">sorry, seeing ''the red white and blue'' in b&amp;w doesn''t do much for me - I do give you credit for posting the flag here, most viewers dislike it. the lighting on her right arm is too hot, the flag is bowed in the center at top - and why the sullen face? She''s got the best colors on she should be happy (bills and taxes...what''s not to love?!?) and show them off in red white and blue! good job. 5 cthenk</td>', 'sorry, seeing ''the red white and blue'' in b&w doesn''t do much for me - I do give you credit for posting the flag here, most viewers dislike it. the lighting on her right arm is too hot, the flag is bowed in the center at top - and why the sullen face? She''s got the best colors on she should be happy (bills and taxes...what''s not to love?!?) and show them off in red white and blue! good job. 5 cthenk', '2002-07-20 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89045, 3390, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent textures. love the contrast</td>', 'excellent textures. love the contrast', '2002-07-20 03:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89046, 3390, 2172, '<td valign="top">GREAT photo.  The b/w really appeals with this image.  It says something  - reaches out.  Her expression is perfect for this.  As I look at this, I try to be objective and look at it as if I weren''t American (or at least try) and it is still emotional.  There is a lot of sadness here.  Personally, I''m a little tired of the trivial patriotism - but to me this is not that at all.    Just curious - was this staged?  If so - great imagination/creativity - If not, great eye for catching this.<br/>Excellent photographic talent.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'GREAT photo.  The b/w really appeals with this image.  It says something  - reaches out.  Her expression is perfect for this.  As I look at this, I try to be objective and look at it as if I weren''t American (or at least try) and it is still emotional.  There is a lot of sadness here.  Personally, I''m a little tired of the trivial patriotism - but to me this is not that at all.    Just curious - was this staged?  If so - great imagination/creativity - If not, great eye for catching this.Excellent photographic talent.Ruthann', '2002-07-20 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89047, 3390, 1031, '<td valign="top">This is stronger but harder to evaluate because of its topicality. I know what I''d be trying to convey if I were presenting this, but I don''t have time right now to try and figure out your take on matters -- i.e. I guess I feel there''s some ambiguity to it (not necessarily bad!).</td>', 'This is stronger but harder to evaluate because of its topicality. I know what I''d be trying to convey if I were presenting this, but I don''t have time right now to try and figure out your take on matters -- i.e. I guess I feel there''s some ambiguity to it (not necessarily bad!).', '2002-07-20 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89048, 3390, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and technically very good. I think what is needed to push this over is for the model''s eyes to engage the viewer. We see that she is in some depth of emotion, but we need to see her eyes. The eyes are the gateway to the soul.</td>', 'Very good composition and technically very good. I think what is needed to push this over is for the model''s eyes to engage the viewer. We see that she is in some depth of emotion, but we need to see her eyes. The eyes are the gateway to the soul.', '2002-07-20 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89049, 3390, 2428, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, her expression is so strong, you could have cropped closer on the face to make a more dramatic impact. You don''s need to see the whole flag on the background, just a litle hint of it bieng there in more interesting (like the first row of stars)</td>', 'Nice portrait, her expression is so strong, you could have cropped closer on the face to make a more dramatic impact. You don''s need to see the whole flag on the background, just a litle hint of it bieng there in more interesting (like the first row of stars)', '2002-07-21 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89050, 3390, 1078, '<td valign="top">Interesting B&amp;W -- hope it''s not getting too slammed for the patriotism.  The left side of the model''s face (our right) is a touch too dark, I think, for this picture -- maybe a little bit of a bounce to fill in some of the details?  I also am trying to figure out why you''re using an older flag with only 48 stars.  I confess, I''m not getting the symbolism if you''re trying to convey something.</td>', 'Interesting B&W -- hope it''s not getting too slammed for the patriotism.  The left side of the model''s face (our right) is a touch too dark, I think, for this picture -- maybe a little bit of a bounce to fill in some of the details?  I also am trying to figure out why you''re using an older flag with only 48 stars.  I confess, I''m not getting the symbolism if you''re trying to convey something.', '2002-07-21 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89051, 3390, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I like it very much. 8-ClubJuggle</td>', 'Nicely done.  I like it very much. 8-ClubJuggle', '2002-07-22 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89052, 3390, 772, '<td valign="top">Underrated... good shot!</td>', 'Underrated... good shot!', '2002-07-22 07:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(89053, 3390, 2736, '<td valign="top">When is waving the flag a cheap gimmick?  I admit that when I first saw this I reacted from a gut suspicion that symbols were being exploited. But the picture held me and I wavered back and forth and back and forth in the voting phase. I finally gave it an 8. Very nice shot. And I love the b&amp;w.</td>', 'When is waving the flag a cheap gimmick?  I admit that when I first saw this I reacted from a gut suspicion that symbols were being exploited. But the picture held me and I wavered back and forth and back and forth in the voting phase. I finally gave it an 8. Very nice shot. And I love the b&w.', '2002-07-24 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(89054, 3394, 573, '<td valign="top">It,s not evident what I''m suppose to see.  I hope the direct sun didn''t burn your imager (the CCD chip inside your camera that makes the picture).</td>', 'It,s not evident what I''m suppose to see.  I hope the direct sun didn''t burn your imager (the CCD chip inside your camera that makes the picture).', '2002-07-15 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89055, 3394, 1005, '<td valign="top">Normally, I like foreground stuff, but not in this case, it''s too dark.  Intesting colors in the sun flare.  6 Swash</td>', 'Normally, I like foreground stuff, but not in this case, it''s too dark.  Intesting colors in the sun flare.  6 Swash', '2002-07-15 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89056, 3394, 772, '<td valign="top">The subject in this photo doesn''t really grab me for some reason... = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'The subject in this photo doesn''t really grab me for some reason... = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 07:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89057, 3394, 1403, '<td valign="top">i like. floating</td>', 'i like. floating', '2002-07-16 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89058, 3394, 1897, '<td valign="top">Lacks any point of interest, and lacks sharpenss.  There is not area of detail to hold the eye.</td>', 'Lacks any point of interest, and lacks sharpenss.  There is not area of detail to hold the eye.', '2002-07-17 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89059, 3394, 2334, '<td valign="top">not too interesting. i bet you could''ve done better.</td>', 'not too interesting. i bet you could''ve done better.', '2002-07-17 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89060, 3394, 2256, '<td valign="top">I took a picture like this, too....I didn''t submit it for the same reason I don''t like this one....I like the idea of it and will continue to work on mine, but I just don''t like the look</td>', 'I took a picture like this, too....I didn''t submit it for the same reason I don''t like this one....I like the idea of it and will continue to work on mine, but I just don''t like the look', '2002-07-17 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89061, 3394, 1003, '<td valign="top">too much glare, thats all i see when i look at this photo</td>', 'too much glare, thats all i see when i look at this photo', '2002-07-17 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89062, 3394, 1041, '<td valign="top">that''s a cool angle, but really not enough to hold the interest on the photo very long. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'that''s a cool angle, but really not enough to hold the interest on the photo very long. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-07-18 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89063, 3394, 1280, '<td valign="top">sunspot too bright, leaves under exposed.  It could work if the pattern was really interesting.</td>', 'sunspot too bright, leaves under exposed.  It could work if the pattern was really interesting.', '2002-07-19 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89064, 3394, 1054, '<td valign="top">I''m not especially inspired by your choice of subject, but the shot it well-exposed, with an impressive focal range. I''m also impressed by your ability to include the sun in the shot without blowing everything else out. 7-ClubJuggle.</td>', 'I''m not especially inspired by your choice of subject, but the shot it well-exposed, with an impressive focal range. I''m also impressed by your ability to include the sun in the shot without blowing everything else out. 7-ClubJuggle.', '2002-07-19 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89065, 3394, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d rather either see the leaves more clearly or have them in full silhouette; this is sort of in between.</td>', 'I''d rather either see the leaves more clearly or have them in full silhouette; this is sort of in between.', '2002-07-20 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89066, 3394, 2752, '<td valign="top">nice contrast</td>', 'nice contrast', '2002-07-20 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89067, 3394, 2317, '<td valign="top">Sorry.. I''m a rookie on the photo business so I will say it "tech-LESS"<br/>Needs more front light.. I dont see the subject</td>', 'Sorry.. I''m a rookie on the photo business so I will say it "tech-LESS"Needs more front light.. I dont see the subject', '2002-07-21 02:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89068, 3394, 2428, '<td valign="top">feels like a good background, but theres a subject missing.</td>', 'feels like a good background, but theres a subject missing.', '2002-07-21 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89069, 3394, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think you might have been able to pull this off if we could have seen a lot more green -- as if the leaves were stained glass.  As it is, I just don''t think it works very well.  I''d suggest next time metering on the leaves -- it''ll probably blow out the sun and maybe the sky though -- you might have to find an angle thatd oesn''t include the sun in the shot.</td>', 'I think you might have been able to pull this off if we could have seen a lot more green -- as if the leaves were stained glass.  As it is, I just don''t think it works very well.  I''d suggest next time metering on the leaves -- it''ll probably blow out the sun and maybe the sky though -- you might have to find an angle thatd oesn''t include the sun in the shot.', '2002-07-21 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89070, 3394, 2721, '<td valign="top">That is a beautiful picture of the sun.</td>', 'That is a beautiful picture of the sun.', '2002-07-21 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89071, 3394, 2810, '<td valign="top">I''m kinda picky about the colors.  This might have looked better with more of a golden and brown hue on the leaves and without the red halo.  The sun is actually overdone.</td>', 'I''m kinda picky about the colors.  This might have looked better with more of a golden and brown hue on the leaves and without the red halo.  The sun is actually overdone.', '2002-07-21 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89072, 3395, 1944, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of your study, but I think it would have had more impact if the hotel in the foreground was not in the frame.</td>', 'I like the idea of your study, but I think it would have had more impact if the hotel in the foreground was not in the frame.', '2002-07-15 02:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89073, 3395, 714, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more of the building 5</td>', 'I would have liked to see more of the building 5', '2002-07-15 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89074, 3395, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this and would of ranked it higher but the ''Hyatt'' section could of been left off.....it adds nothing + the text of the bank is just too much. Still over all I do like this shot, creative work. Kee</td>', 'I like this and would of ranked it higher but the ''Hyatt'' section could of been left off.....it adds nothing + the text of the bank is just too much. Still over all I do like this shot, creative work. Kee', '2002-07-15 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89075, 3395, 2058, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and reflection... I would have liked to see it a bit more zoomed in so it was more abstract.</td>', 'Nice shot and reflection... I would have liked to see it a bit more zoomed in so it was more abstract.', '2002-07-15 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89076, 3395, 2146, '<td valign="top">thats cool</td>', 'thats cool', '2002-07-15 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89077, 3395, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the reflection here... this is nice :)  the triangular arch at the bottom right doesn''t seem fitting, but I know that this image couldn''t exist without it... = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I love the reflection here... this is nice :)  the triangular arch at the bottom right doesn''t seem fitting, but I know that this image couldn''t exist without it... = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89078, 3395, 1569, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what the reflection is.A little too close up.</td>', 'Can''t tell what the reflection is.A little too close up.', '2002-07-16 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89079, 3395, 1759, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, nice reflection.</td>', 'Cool shot, nice reflection.', '2002-07-16 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89080, 3395, 1403, '<td valign="top">i like these geometric shapes</td>', 'i like these geometric shapes', '2002-07-16 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89081, 3395, 2261, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2002-07-16 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89082, 3395, 2200, '<td valign="top">closer cropping of image would improve this.</td>', 'closer cropping of image would improve this.', '2002-07-16 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89083, 3395, 2480, '<td valign="top">get rid of the hyatt.... it would be great</td>', 'get rid of the hyatt.... it would be great', '2002-07-16 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89084, 3395, 2481, '<td valign="top">nice reflection, cropping might have enhanced the composition more</td>', 'nice reflection, cropping might have enhanced the composition more', '2002-07-17 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89085, 3395, 2111, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2002-07-17 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89086, 3395, 2777, '<td valign="top">I would crop everything but really interesting reflection. I don''t think sky, shape of the building, banner, and most of all triangle in the front improve the image in any way.</td>', 'I would crop everything but really interesting reflection. I don''t think sky, shape of the building, banner, and most of all triangle in the front improve the image in any way.', '2002-07-18 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89087, 3395, 587, '<td valign="top">I like the theory, but dislike the Hyatt sign and that black thing.  If you could have cropped those out I would have rated much higher. good job.  cthenk</td>', 'I like the theory, but dislike the Hyatt sign and that black thing.  If you could have cropped those out I would have rated much higher. good job.  cthenk', '2002-07-18 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89088, 3395, 1005, '<td valign="top">Haven''t I seen this building before (previous challenge? too lazy to check)  Nice shot, interesting window distortion.  Looks like they hurried the building construction.  7 Swash</td>', 'Haven''t I seen this building before (previous challenge? too lazy to check)  Nice shot, interesting window distortion.  Looks like they hurried the building construction.  7 Swash', '2002-07-18 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89089, 3395, 1793, '<td valign="top">that''s awesome - the reflection is incredible!</td>', 'that''s awesome - the reflection is incredible!', '2002-07-18 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(89090, 3395, 2785, '<td valign="top">In general a well exposed refection capture. Nice resolution and focus. Could use some more pop and would work better without the distracting bottom elements.</td>', 'In general a well exposed refection capture. Nice resolution and focus. Could use some more pop and would work better without the distracting bottom elements.', '2002-07-18 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89091, 3395, 1003, '<td valign="top">find the black bars in the right hand side distracting</td>', 'find the black bars in the right hand side distracting', '2002-07-19 04:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89092, 3395, 640, '<td valign="top">Sorry for being dumb, but I can''t tell what that is in the reflection.</td>', 'Sorry for being dumb, but I can''t tell what that is in the reflection.', '2002-07-19 04:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89093, 3395, 2798, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get why this is history reflected - what is the reflected building?</td>', 'Not sure I get why this is history reflected - what is the reflected building?', '2002-07-19 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89094, 3395, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great image.  The coloring is great too.  Good work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great image.  The coloring is great too.  Good work.Ruthann', '2002-07-20 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89095, 3395, 2783, '<td valign="top">It''s all about money these days, isn''t it?  I like how the windows diced up the other "mystery" building.<br/><br/>It''s good I give it a nine</td>', 'It''s all about money these days, isn''t it?  I like how the windows diced up the other "mystery" building.It''s good I give it a nine', '2002-07-20 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89096, 3395, 1031, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about history -- might be government reflected. Of course some would say it''s more a direct view of government (and its owners).</td>', 'I don''t know about history -- might be government reflected. Of course some would say it''s more a direct view of government (and its owners).', '2002-07-20 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89097, 3395, 173, '<td valign="top">Would have looked better if you could have cropped out the "Hyatt" and the "Fifth Third Bank". The building titles are very distracting. Great concept though.</td>', 'Would have looked better if you could have cropped out the "Hyatt" and the "Fifth Third Bank". The building titles are very distracting. Great concept though.', '2002-07-21 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89098, 3395, 2, '<td valign="top">I''d like this shot better without the building names in them -- just the reflections.</td>', 'I''d like this shot better without the building names in them -- just the reflections.', '2002-07-22 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89099, 3396, 2311, '<td valign="top">this makes me thirsty...</td>', 'this makes me thirsty...', '2002-07-15 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89100, 3396, 2719, '<td valign="top">experimental</td>', 'experimental', '2002-07-15 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89101, 3396, 133, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I have felt like there was just too much sun before.  Very nice job.</td>', 'I like this.  I have felt like there was just too much sun before.  Very nice job.', '2002-07-15 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
