(89252, 3403, 1759, '<td valign="top">This is a good composition with good exposure and contrast. Generally it is considered "recycled art" to photograph the art work of someone else unless the photograph itself has an artistic quality that goes beyond an accurate recording of the original art piece. I lean toward this line of thinking and as such, give high marks for the quality of the image, but lower marks for creative artistry.</td>', 'This is a good composition with good exposure and contrast. Generally it is considered "recycled art" to photograph the art work of someone else unless the photograph itself has an artistic quality that goes beyond an accurate recording of the original art piece. I lean toward this line of thinking and as such, give high marks for the quality of the image, but lower marks for creative artistry.', '2002-07-16 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
