(89298, 3405, 1569, '<td valign="top">All that sky on top is pretty distracting.A tighter crop on top and maybe tweak the contrast and light/dark settings.</td>', 'All that sky on top is pretty distracting.A tighter crop on top and maybe tweak the contrast and light/dark settings.', '2002-07-16 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
