(89308, 3405, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and capture of the details.  I also like the perspective and framing of this shot.  I think it needs just a little more contrast/brightness. That way the shadows would be darker, and the light parts would be contrasted more, giving the image a little more "oomph." karmat</td>', 'Nice focus and capture of the details.  I also like the perspective and framing of this shot.  I think it needs just a little more contrast/brightness. That way the shadows would be darker, and the light parts would be contrasted more, giving the image a little more "oomph." karmat', '2002-07-18 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89309, 3405, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cloudy day?  Really neat angle shot.  I like everything except the empty sky.  I''m sure it couldn''t be helped, but it "looks" missing.  8 Swash</td>', 'Cloudy day?  Really neat angle shot.  I like everything except the empty sky.  I''m sure it couldn''t be helped, but it "looks" missing.  8 Swash', '2002-07-18 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
