(89472, 3409, 573, '<td valign="top">Finally, a flower shot that is different, dosn''t fill the frame with flower reproductive organs, refreshing breathing space.  I like the contrast between the yellow flower and the grey/black suroundings.  The best flower shot I have seen so far.  One of my top ten.</td>', 'Finally, a flower shot that is different, dosn''t fill the frame with flower reproductive organs, refreshing breathing space.  I like the contrast between the yellow flower and the grey/black suroundings.  The best flower shot I have seen so far.  One of my top ten.', '2002-07-15 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
