(89474, 3409, 693, '<td valign="top">I assume the flower is suppose to be the subject here, if so it is out of focus.  Looks like you focused on the rock directly in front of it... it appears to be the sharpest object in the image.</td>', 'I assume the flower is suppose to be the subject here, if so it is out of focus.  Looks like you focused on the rock directly in front of it... it appears to be the sharpest object in the image.', '2002-07-15 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
