(89500, 3409, 2152, '<td valign="top">Great job showing isolation in this shot with the DOF.  The yellow is a good contrast against the darker background.  The framing I think could be a little better, but I''m not sure what I would suggest.  One of my top 5 this week.</td>', 'Great job showing isolation in this shot with the DOF.  The yellow is a good contrast against the darker background.  The framing I think could be a little better, but I''m not sure what I would suggest.  One of my top 5 this week.', '2002-07-17 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
