(89510, 3409, 772, '<td valign="top">In most of these challenges since I have been a member at DPC, one photos float to the top as my overall favorites for the challenge.  Two have done that this week and yours is one of them.  This is a truly amazing image.  The yellow blossoms on these flowers jump out of the flat background and say ''good morning'' to me :)  the depth of field is fantastic... i will stop here and give this photo a 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'In most of these challenges since I have been a member at DPC, one photos float to the top as my overall favorites for the challenge.  Two have done that this week and yours is one of them.  This is a truly amazing image.  The yellow blossoms on these flowers jump out of the flat background and say ''good morning'' to me :)  the depth of field is fantastic... i will stop here and give this photo a 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-18 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
