(89518, 3409, 715, '<td valign="top">Great photo. The contrast of the yellow flower in the gray looking environment is fantastic.<br/>Maybe the composition would be even stronger if the flower would be positioned a little more to the left. It just looks like there''s a little too much empty space on the left now. But that''s just a minor issue and a matter of personal taste.<br/></td>', 'Great photo. The contrast of the yellow flower in the gray looking environment is fantastic.Maybe the composition would be even stronger if the flower would be positioned a little more to the left. It just looks like there''s a little too much empty space on the left now. But that''s just a minor issue and a matter of personal taste.', '2002-07-19 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89519, 3409, 587, '<td valign="top">This is by far one of my favorites. I love the simplicity of it and the way the yellow screams. great job. 10 cthenk</td>', 'This is by far one of my favorites. I love the simplicity of it and the way the yellow screams. great job. 10 cthenk', '2002-07-20 03:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
