(89587, 3410, 472, '<td valign="top">phenomenal graphic design.  i like the use of depth of field to show that this is not a flat portrait.  your separation from the background and detail on the first barb are both outstanding.  mag 99</td>', 'phenomenal graphic design.  i like the use of depth of field to show that this is not a flat portrait.  your separation from the background and detail on the first barb are both outstanding.  mag 99', '2002-07-21 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89588, 3410, 173, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2002-07-21 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89589, 3410, 1078, '<td valign="top">I''m torn on this one.  As far as voting, I''m coming down on the "I like this side" but I''m not sure I like the effect with the barbed wire as it recedes into the distance.  This is also almost too sparse for me -- maybe another loop of barbed wire somewhere in the shot -- or maybe even some other something altogether?  Not sure.</td>', 'I''m torn on this one.  As far as voting, I''m coming down on the "I like this side" but I''m not sure I like the effect with the barbed wire as it recedes into the distance.  This is also almost too sparse for me -- maybe another loop of barbed wire somewhere in the shot -- or maybe even some other something altogether?  Not sure.', '2002-07-21 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89590, 3410, 2810, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped this on the right side of the barb at the top.  It would have been a bigger image of teh wire and may have had a better effect.</td>', 'I would have cropped this on the right side of the barb at the top.  It would have been a bigger image of teh wire and may have had a better effect.', '2002-07-21 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89591, 3410, 885, '<td valign="top">Ah, well, thanks for all the comments.  Believe me, the photo would not have been better with more depth of field.  You really do need the depth of field to show that the wire is bending away from the viewer, rather than just being a loop of wire.  And for those who said it was distracting, I''d ask...distracting from what?  The phenominally interesting background?  You''re supposed to be looking along the line from the in-focus barb down and out of the picture.  If I didn''t want you to focus on the wire I''d have used a naked chick as a background instead of plain white :-)</td>', 'Ah, well, thanks for all the comments.  Believe me, the photo would not have been better with more depth of field.  You really do need the depth of field to show that the wire is bending away from the viewer, rather than just being a loop of wire.  And for those who said it was distracting, I''d ask...distracting from what?  The phenominally interesting background?  You''re supposed to be looking along the line from the in-focus barb down and out of the picture.  If I didn''t want you to focus on the wire I''d have used a naked chick as a background instead of plain white :-)', '2002-07-22 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(89592, 3410, 472, '<td valign="top">you were robbed</td>', 'you were robbed', '2002-07-22 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
