(89664, 3413, 573, '<td valign="top">I see a lot of graineness in this image and since the image is in greyscale I am going to assume you are trying to simulate a the look of highspeed film pushed to the max.  That said, I''ve been looking at this picture and going fron ''I like it.'' to '' It just doesn''t feel right.''  I''m going to give a high score and I don''t know why.</td>', 'I see a lot of graineness in this image and since the image is in greyscale I am going to assume you are trying to simulate a the look of highspeed film pushed to the max.  That said, I''ve been looking at this picture and going fron ''I like it.'' to '' It just doesn''t feel right.''  I''m going to give a high score and I don''t know why.', '2002-07-18 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89665, 3413, 1003, '<td valign="top">super great shot, wish it weren''t so grainy</td>', 'super great shot, wish it weren''t so grainy', '2002-07-19 04:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89666, 3413, 2777, '<td valign="top">I liek graininess here.</td>', 'I liek graininess here.', '2002-07-19 07:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89667, 3413, 2109, '<td valign="top">its a bit grainy... nice idea, but it would look better if there was less noise on the skin tones.</td>', 'its a bit grainy... nice idea, but it would look better if there was less noise on the skin tones.', '2002-07-19 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89668, 3413, 2172, '<td valign="top">I think this is wonderful work.  This is art.  Definately Frame-Worthy.  Whatever you did - it''s great.  I think it''s a 10<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I think this is wonderful work.  This is art.  Definately Frame-Worthy.  Whatever you did - it''s great.  I think it''s a 10Ruthann', '2002-07-19 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89669, 3413, 1041, '<td valign="top">the more i look at this photo, the more i like it.  the position, and graininess is very effective here with the b&amp;w but there are some places that look a tad blown out like the little finger of the upper hand.  you''ve just moved up to my top10, err, top 11 i guess.  :) -- gr8photos (9)</td>', 'the more i look at this photo, the more i like it.  the position, and graininess is very effective here with the b&w but there are some places that look a tad blown out like the little finger of the upper hand.  you''ve just moved up to my top10, err, top 11 i guess.  :) -- gr8photos (9)', '2002-07-19 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89670, 3413, 715, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo with a strong composition. I find the reflection on the cloth on the left a little distracting.</td>', 'Interesting photo with a strong composition. I find the reflection on the cloth on the left a little distracting.', '2002-07-19 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89671, 3413, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think the grainy look makes this better.</td>', 'I think the grainy look makes this better.', '2002-07-20 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89672, 3413, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very nice. My only nitpic would be to get the little finger out of the shadow between the feet or eliminate the shadow. This shot should do very well in this challenge in spite of there being so many excellent photos.</td>', 'Very nice. My only nitpic would be to get the little finger out of the shadow between the feet or eliminate the shadow. This shot should do very well in this challenge in spite of there being so many excellent photos.', '2002-07-20 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89673, 3413, 2428, '<td valign="top">I like this, but i feel that if it was sharp it would have beena lot  better.</td>', 'I like this, but i feel that if it was sharp it would have beena lot  better.', '2002-07-21 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89674, 3413, 1847, '<td valign="top">Grainy effect is pretty neat.  I''d be interested to see the shot without it, though.</td>', 'Grainy effect is pretty neat.  I''d be interested to see the shot without it, though.', '2002-07-21 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89675, 3413, 801, '<td valign="top">great!! Congratulations</td>', 'great!! Congratulations', '2002-07-21 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89676, 3413, 2721, '<td valign="top">It makes the skin look kind of blank.</td>', 'It makes the skin look kind of blank.', '2002-07-21 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89677, 3413, 1078, '<td valign="top">LOL -- "It''s too grainy!"  Yup, it is and I LIKE IT!  Really interesting effect -- looks like the photo was really blown out and then brought back somehow.  What did you use under the feet?</td>', 'LOL -- "It''s too grainy!"  Yup, it is and I LIKE IT!  Really interesting effect -- looks like the photo was really blown out and then brought back somehow.  What did you use under the feet?', '2002-07-22 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89678, 3413, 2838, '<td valign="top">Very creative...love the B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very creative...love the B&W.', '2002-07-22 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89679, 3413, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The graininess adds to this shot. 8-ClubJuggle</td>', 'Nicely done.  The graininess adds to this shot. 8-ClubJuggle', '2002-07-22 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89680, 3413, 1042, '<td valign="top">Yes, this was shot in low light....but when I converted it to b&amp;w and tweaked the sharpness it just came out with this grainy effect that I really liked... I had a feeling I would get a lot of negative comments on it so I was really surprised by how many folks actually liked the effect as much as I did. Thanks for all who voted and I appreciate the comments. :)  BTW, these were my daughter''s feet...shot on our living room sofa with a chenille blanket underneath her. And yes....I''ve been onto her about biting her nails forever now. :)<br/><br/>Karen</td>', 'Yes, this was shot in low light....but when I converted it to b&w and tweaked the sharpness it just came out with this grainy effect that I really liked... I had a feeling I would get a lot of negative comments on it so I was really surprised by how many folks actually liked the effect as much as I did. Thanks for all who voted and I appreciate the comments. :)  BTW, these were my daughter''s feet...shot on our living room sofa with a chenille blanket underneath her. And yes....I''ve been onto her about biting her nails forever now. :)Karen', '2002-07-22 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(89681, 3414, 2146, '<td valign="top">wish that was my front yard</td>', 'wish that was my front yard', '2002-07-15 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89682, 3414, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice... maybe a bit bright...</td>', 'nice... maybe a bit bright...', '2002-07-15 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89683, 3414, 1944, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the sun on the water, but the flare reduced the sharpness of the dock. This kind of photo needs critical sharpness all over.</td>', 'I like the effect of the sun on the water, but the flare reduced the sharpness of the dock. This kind of photo needs critical sharpness all over.', '2002-07-15 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89684, 3414, 2152, '<td valign="top">I really like the sun rays coming out of the clouds.  A pity the focus is off.</td>', 'I really like the sun rays coming out of the clouds.  A pity the focus is off.', '2002-07-15 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89685, 3414, 2373, '<td valign="top">Nice pic of a peacful place, the light at the top throughs it of a bit.</td>', 'Nice pic of a peacful place, the light at the top throughs it of a bit.', '2002-07-15 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89686, 3414, 737, '<td valign="top">unless that''s a storm coming. Nice shot.</td>', 'unless that''s a storm coming. Nice shot.', '2002-07-15 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89687, 3414, 327, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful looking place of _calm_!! Keep this place a secret. Your photo is nice also, but a bit OOF and the sun a bit too over exposed on the water. I think a tripod would of helped you here and UV lens. Over all I like this very much and the composition. Kee</td>', 'What a wonderful looking place of _calm_!! Keep this place a secret. Your photo is nice also, but a bit OOF and the sun a bit too over exposed on the water. I think a tripod would of helped you here and UV lens. Over all I like this very much and the composition. Kee', '2002-07-15 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89688, 3414, 1572, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Another great shot of the sun in this challenge.  I can''t seem to photograph anywhere near it.  The reflection, the rays, the dark trees in the back all add to a great shot!</td>', 'Beautiful!  Another great shot of the sun in this challenge.  I can''t seem to photograph anywhere near it.  The reflection, the rays, the dark trees in the back all add to a great shot!', '2002-07-15 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89689, 3414, 2734, '<td valign="top">I wish I was there right now, very good use of natural light !</td>', 'I wish I was there right now, very good use of natural light !', '2002-07-15 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(89690, 3414, 2058, '<td valign="top">Good shot... it does feel peaceful...   I would try moving the float/bench out of the direct center of the picture though</td>', 'Good shot... it does feel peaceful...   I would try moving the float/bench out of the direct center of the picture though', '2002-07-15 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89691, 3414, 1877, '<td valign="top">Dawson: "Joey, do you think we''ll ever get off this creek?"<br/>Joey: "I''m not sure.. hey you want to watch 90210, Donna and David are celebrating their 50th Anniversary.. " ;) <br/><br/>Sorry it reminded me of a show, and its late (i get odd when its late).. I love the shot. It''s something out of a tv show.. so to me it seems pretty professional looking. It''s soft and the glisten on the water is great. Good job - 8!</td>', 'Dawson: "Joey, do you think we''ll ever get off this creek?"Joey: "I''m not sure.. hey you want to watch 90210, Donna and David are celebrating their 50th Anniversary.. " ;) Sorry it reminded me of a show, and its late (i get odd when its late).. I love the shot. It''s something out of a tv show.. so to me it seems pretty professional looking. It''s soft and the glisten on the water is great. Good job - 8!', '2002-07-16 06:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89692, 3414, 1403, '<td valign="top">nice place for a psytrance party</td>', 'nice place for a psytrance party', '2002-07-16 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89693, 3414, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.. the sun is a bit bright when you are shooting directly into it :)  I think this shot would have much more impact if the dock was not located bullseye center in the image... see ''rule of thirds'' for a possible improvement in this image :) I know that rules are not really rules, but they are here for a reason.  They offer guidelines that are often helpful.  IMHO, the rule of thirds would be very helpful here :) = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Interesting photo.. the sun is a bit bright when you are shooting directly into it :)  I think this shot would have much more impact if the dock was not located bullseye center in the image... see ''rule of thirds'' for a possible improvement in this image :) I know that rules are not really rules, but they are here for a reason.  They offer guidelines that are often helpful.  IMHO, the rule of thirds would be very helpful here :) = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89694, 3414, 2200, '<td valign="top">a warmer color tone would change the mood. Image appears cold</td>', 'a warmer color tone would change the mood. Image appears cold', '2002-07-16 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89695, 3414, 2195, '<td valign="top">nice capture....I like the sun flare but i think it would help if you used the rule of thirds instead of centering it</td>', 'nice capture....I like the sun flare but i think it would help if you used the rule of thirds instead of centering it', '2002-07-16 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89696, 3414, 734, '<td valign="top">The rule of thirds would have really worked for this image to make it a more powerful image. I love the lighting  Ronin - 7</td>', 'The rule of thirds would have really worked for this image to make it a more powerful image. I love the lighting  Ronin - 7', '2002-07-17 03:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89697, 3414, 2370, '<td valign="top">more of the sun would be nice.</td>', 'more of the sun would be nice.', '2002-07-17 05:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89698, 3414, 2256, '<td valign="top">I''d lake to vacation here!</td>', 'I''d lake to vacation here!', '2002-07-17 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
