(89731, 3415, 2172, '<td valign="top">OH boy, I''ll have to take a break from voting today - sooooo many excellent photos!  And This is definately one of them.    I''m showing my lack of geography, but I don''t know where Triangle Park is - so you''ll have to let me know.  This photo is very inviting. - great motion and colors.   Wonderful Work!!!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'OH boy, I''ll have to take a break from voting today - sooooo many excellent photos!  And This is definately one of them.    I''m showing my lack of geography, but I don''t know where Triangle Park is - so you''ll have to let me know.  This photo is very inviting. - great motion and colors.   Wonderful Work!!!Ruthann', '2002-07-17 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
