(89772, 3416, 2255, '<td valign="top">Seeing the statue and the silhouette of the flag in the background make this one an absolutely beautiful patriotic picture.</td>', 'Seeing the statue and the silhouette of the flag in the background make this one an absolutely beautiful patriotic picture.', '2002-07-20 05:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89773, 3416, 2172, '<td valign="top">GREAT SHOT.  Postcard.  Great colors and image quality.  I like the distance as well.  I don''t think it would''ve been better closer.  I like the idea that when I look at this I see an American symbol - but not exagerated, more in perspective, such that there is still so much more to the world.......OK, I''m now looking at another screen and that one shows the island and water - personally, I like my first impression - the bottom of the photo is mostly black and the water and island are not apparent.<br/>GREAT work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'GREAT SHOT.  Postcard.  Great colors and image quality.  I like the distance as well.  I don''t think it would''ve been better closer.  I like the idea that when I look at this I see an American symbol - but not exagerated, more in perspective, such that there is still so much more to the world.......OK, I''m now looking at another screen and that one shows the island and water - personally, I like my first impression - the bottom of the photo is mostly black and the water and island are not apparent.GREAT work.Ruthann', '2002-07-20 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89774, 3416, 213, '<td valign="top">What great colors and I love the silhouette and the fact that it''s not centered.</td>', 'What great colors and I love the silhouette and the fact that it''s not centered.', '2002-07-21 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89775, 3416, 1078, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette with a nice sunset.  Like hte fact that you can see the flag in the shot too.  I wonder how this would look if it was cropped a little closer.  It might lose some of the feeling of freedom which it now has, but it feels almost like there''s a bit too much sky.  Just an idea.</td>', 'Great silhouette with a nice sunset.  Like hte fact that you can see the flag in the shot too.  I wonder how this would look if it was cropped a little closer.  It might lose some of the feeling of freedom which it now has, but it feels almost like there''s a bit too much sky.  Just an idea.', '2002-07-21 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89776, 3416, 472, '<td valign="top">gorgeous light, great composition.</td>', 'gorgeous light, great composition.', '2002-07-21 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89777, 3416, 2810, '<td valign="top">Good image.  I like the colors and the shot seems to be in focus which is a big plus.  The only thing I might recommend here is the rule of thirds and to try to get a bit more water in the next shot of our Lady.</td>', 'Good image.  I like the colors and the shot seems to be in focus which is a big plus.  The only thing I might recommend here is the rule of thirds and to try to get a bit more water in the next shot of our Lady.', '2002-07-21 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
