(89826, 3419, 2058, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  The image is only 32k, and you''re allowed 150k... it''s worth it to use as much of that as you can.  I think it would have looked better if the car wasnt in the shot, and if you had maybe gotten a bit closer to the windmills.</td>', 'Good shot.  The image is only 32k, and you''re allowed 150k... it''s worth it to use as much of that as you can.  I think it would have looked better if the car wasnt in the shot, and if you had maybe gotten a bit closer to the windmills.', '2002-07-15 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89827, 3419, 889, '<td valign="top">not sure if its your car or not, it doesnt help the picture,</td>', 'not sure if its your car or not, it doesnt help the picture,', '2002-07-15 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
