(89830, 3419, 573, '<td valign="top">Very echo tech and you almost have the ''S'' curve thing going but this picture does not grab me and say WOW!</td>', 'Very echo tech and you almost have the ''S'' curve thing going but this picture does not grab me and say WOW!', '2002-07-15 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89831, 3419, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice... but why the car!?</td>', 'nice... but why the car!?', '2002-07-15 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89832, 3419, 1005, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot.  Three things that I think are less than wonderful....The power line running through the shot could be considered added information (power line/power gathering towers...), but I find it distracting.  Your primary subject, the pole in the front,center timed poorly, one vein is almost fully in line with the tower, hiding it.  Third, tempting as it may be to want a field of wind towers, I think a single tower would have been more effective.  All that said, I still like this shot.  7 Swash</td>', 'A lovely shot.  Three things that I think are less than wonderful....The power line running through the shot could be considered added information (power line/power gathering towers...), but I find it distracting.  Your primary subject, the pole in the front,center timed poorly, one vein is almost fully in line with the tower, hiding it.  Third, tempting as it may be to want a field of wind towers, I think a single tower would have been more effective.  All that said, I still like this shot.  7 Swash', '2002-07-15 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89833, 3419, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice but not very interesting. Your color, focus and DOF is good. Maybe if the gravel street in front had been cropped a little tighter it would of pulled the viewer in more. Kee</td>', 'Nice but not very interesting. Your color, focus and DOF is good. Maybe if the gravel street in front had been cropped a little tighter it would of pulled the viewer in more. Kee', '2002-07-15 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
