(89853, 3419, 1031, '<td valign="top">I was just reading an interesting article about new types of wind turbines.</td>', 'I was just reading an interesting article about new types of wind turbines.', '2002-07-19 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89854, 3419, 2777, '<td valign="top">Car and street and power lines are distracting. Close up on few "propellers" could be far more effective.</td>', 'Car and street and power lines are distracting. Close up on few "propellers" could be far more effective.', '2002-07-19 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89855, 3419, 2798, '<td valign="top">The car in this shot helps a LOT. Really gives the thing a scale.</td>', 'The car in this shot helps a LOT. Really gives the thing a scale.', '2002-07-19 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89856, 3419, 637, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and the idea... There is a windmill farm near me that I''d like to photograph one day...  Don''t think you''ve captured enough of the essence of your subject to make this a memorable shot.  Either do it with more windmills, I''d suggest, or perhaps fill the frame more with the ones you have.<br/><br/>sjgleah 5</td>', 'Love the angle and the idea... There is a windmill farm near me that I''d like to photograph one day...  Don''t think you''ve captured enough of the essence of your subject to make this a memorable shot.  Either do it with more windmills, I''d suggest, or perhaps fill the frame more with the ones you have.sjgleah 5', '2002-07-19 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89857, 3419, 2801, '<td valign="top">Nice color and pattern.</td>', 'Nice color and pattern.', '2002-07-20 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89858, 3419, 1759, '<td valign="top">I really like this except for the car. I think it would be much improved to crop the bottom or compose from a higher vantage point.</td>', 'I really like this except for the car. I think it would be much improved to crop the bottom or compose from a higher vantage point.', '2002-07-20 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89859, 3419, 741, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic shot.  3 things I can think of to improve it. (1) wait for the car to move - it does give a sense of scale but looks untidy because it joins the bottom of the front generator (2) move round slightly so that the blades 1/3 of the way up the front generator don''t overlap like they do (3) use a polariser to make the sky even bluer</td>', 'Nice graphic shot.  3 things I can think of to improve it. (1) wait for the car to move - it does give a sense of scale but looks untidy because it joins the bottom of the front generator (2) move round slightly so that the blades 1/3 of the way up the front generator don''t overlap like they do (3) use a polariser to make the sky even bluer', '2002-07-21 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89860, 3419, 1280, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen these...wonder what they are.  Nice color.Gravel road is distraction.</td>', 'I''ve never seen these...wonder what they are.  Nice color.Gravel road is distraction.', '2002-07-21 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89861, 3420, 2058, '<td valign="top">Very good shot.  I like the shadows in it. and it was taken at an interesting angle.</td>', 'Very good shot.  I like the shadows in it. and it was taken at an interesting angle.', '2002-07-15 04:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89862, 3420, 133, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition.</td>', 'Really nice composition.', '2002-07-15 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89863, 3420, 1175, '<td valign="top">Excellent lines and shapes.  Good color in the blue background.  Very nice.</td>', 'Excellent lines and shapes.  Good color in the blue background.  Very nice.', '2002-07-15 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89864, 3420, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice!!!! Very good work, love this view. Kee</td>', 'Nice!!!! Very good work, love this view. Kee', '2002-07-15 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89865, 3420, 92, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo ! 9</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo ! 9', '2002-07-15 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89866, 3420, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shapes and interesting subject.  7</td>', 'Great shapes and interesting subject.  7', '2002-07-15 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89867, 3420, 748, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen just the tips of the vertical elements on the right side, as my eyes want to wander off the photo.  Otherwise, a great shot.  One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'I would like to have seen just the tips of the vertical elements on the right side, as my eyes want to wander off the photo.  Otherwise, a great shot.  One of my favorites this week.', '2002-07-15 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89868, 3420, 806, '<td valign="top">Love the framing and the clarity of the structure. Great architechtural "free" study!</td>', 'Love the framing and the clarity of the structure. Great architechtural "free" study!', '2002-07-15 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89869, 3420, 2661, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. This is such an awesome shot. Have you ever seen Edward Weston''s (at least I think that''s who it was) Circus Tent? Well anyways, this shot blows that one away. Aweswome.</td>', 'Oh wow. This is such an awesome shot. Have you ever seen Edward Weston''s (at least I think that''s who it was) Circus Tent? Well anyways, this shot blows that one away. Aweswome.', '2002-07-16 03:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89870, 3420, 656, '<td valign="top">like the converging lines, perhaps might be even stronger if you moved the ''circle'' up or down a bit, rather than having it in the middle ?</td>', 'like the converging lines, perhaps might be even stronger if you moved the ''circle'' up or down a bit, rather than having it in the middle ?', '2002-07-16 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89871, 3420, 2456, '<td valign="top">Like the shot. But also might have been a nice one for patterns...</td>', 'Like the shot. But also might have been a nice one for patterns...', '2002-07-16 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89872, 3420, 2752, '<td valign="top">Good use of lines,light.shadows and composition</td>', 'Good use of lines,light.shadows and composition', '2002-07-16 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89873, 3420, 1880, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is ... But I like the photograph ... 8 ... RLS</td>', 'I don''t know what it is ... But I like the photograph ... 8 ... RLS', '2002-07-17 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89874, 3420, 1793, '<td valign="top">oh, i love this. great composition - of centre just enough to balance. 10.</td>', 'oh, i love this. great composition - of centre just enough to balance. 10.', '2002-07-17 04:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89875, 3420, 1003, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2002-07-17 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89876, 3420, 1042, '<td valign="top">This is so abstract and pretty. Wouldn''t it be wonderful if those sections were different colors too? I like this a lot. 9- KDJohnson</td>', 'This is so abstract and pretty. Wouldn''t it be wonderful if those sections were different colors too? I like this a lot. 9- KDJohnson', '2002-07-17 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89877, 3420, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent use of leading lines and the rule of thirds :)  I love nice architecture shots like this... if *I* had been doing this shot, I would have had someone change the white to red for more impact :)) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'excellent use of leading lines and the rule of thirds :)  I love nice architecture shots like this... if *I* had been doing this shot, I would have had someone change the white to red for more impact :)) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-17 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89878, 3420, 671, '<td valign="top">good architecture study</td>', 'good architecture study', '2002-07-17 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89879, 3420, 2334, '<td valign="top">great perspective and the lines and angles are amazing. i really like this.</td>', 'great perspective and the lines and angles are amazing. i really like this.', '2002-07-17 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89880, 3420, 641, '<td valign="top">Great lines and the sky is really beautiful in this</td>', 'Great lines and the sky is really beautiful in this', '2002-07-17 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89881, 3420, 2172, '<td valign="top">Really cool pic!!!! - even the thumbnail caught my eye (and you know that those thumbnails sometimes just do any justice for a photo).  I really like the blue vs the grey - I like it all - GREAT WORK!!!   (reminds of a hot-air balloon)<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Really cool pic!!!! - even the thumbnail caught my eye (and you know that those thumbnails sometimes just do any justice for a photo).  I really like the blue vs the grey - I like it all - GREAT WORK!!!   (reminds of a hot-air balloon)Ruthann', '2002-07-17 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89882, 3420, 889, '<td valign="top">nothing wrong here</td>', 'nothing wrong here', '2002-07-17 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89883, 3420, 573, '<td valign="top">What an interesting structure, some people may tell you that you should have placed the center of the concentric circles at one ot the thirds points, but IMO the concentric circles draw the viewer in all by themselves.  Nice picture.</td>', 'What an interesting structure, some people may tell you that you should have placed the center of the concentric circles at one ot the thirds points, but IMO the concentric circles draw the viewer in all by themselves.  Nice picture.', '2002-07-17 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89884, 3420, 1005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Nice shadows and composition.  I don''t see any glaring flaws.  9 Swash</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Nice shadows and composition.  I don''t see any glaring flaws.  9 Swash', '2002-07-17 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89885, 3420, 2373, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2002-07-18 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89886, 3420, 878, '<td valign="top">Almost a fractal, nice framing, lighting, detail etc... 9!!!</td>', 'Almost a fractal, nice framing, lighting, detail etc... 9!!!', '2002-07-19 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89887, 3420, 2777, '<td valign="top">Good capture of geometry of this place.</td>', 'Good capture of geometry of this place.', '2002-07-19 07:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(89888, 3420, 637, '<td valign="top">Great angle and colors... one of my favorites so far... 7 sjgleah</td>', 'Great angle and colors... one of my favorites so far... 7 sjgleah', '2002-07-19 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
