(90019, 3426, 1041, '<td valign="top">thank you to all those who were able to look past the fact that this is ''just a bug photo'' and gave me some great comments.  to responde to some of them: the background was that color (plants) with sunlight poking through, hence the hotspots.  the cocoons were attached to hanging ropes, hence the butterfly was actually this way up.  i took a lot of photos in the butterfly house that weekend, they can be seen at <a href="//www.langpage.com/2002montreal/botanicalgarden.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.langpage.com/2002montreal/botanicalgarden.html</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2002-12-06 14:39:27.</i></td>', 'thank you to all those who were able to look past the fact that this is ''just a bug photo'' and gave me some great comments.  to responde to some of them: the background was that color (plants) with sunlight poking through, hence the hotspots.  the cocoons were attached to hanging ropes, hence the butterfly was actually this way up.  i took a lot of photos in the butterfly house that weekend, they can be seen at //www.langpage.com/2002montreal/botanicalgarden.html', '2002-07-22 11:14:00.000000', '2002-12-06 14:39:27.000000', 0),
(90020, 3426, 472, '<td valign="top">this is righteous.  killer textures. : )</td>', 'this is righteous.  killer textures. : )', '2002-07-22 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(90021, 3426, 1001, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.', '2002-07-24 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(90022, 3429, 2311, '<td valign="top">animals win every time...</td>', 'animals win every time...', '2002-07-15 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90023, 3429, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice image. It might have a little more impact  if the horses, especially the one facing me were lighter. A half stop would make a real difference and the background, although lighter, would still show well.</td>', 'Nice image. It might have a little more impact  if the horses, especially the one facing me were lighter. A half stop would make a real difference and the background, although lighter, would still show well.', '2002-07-15 02:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90024, 3429, 889, '<td valign="top">some vinyetting, make sure you dont pull back the zoom to much when using a telephoto lens. otherwise nice depth of field<br/>The Vinyetting in the corners hurts you though</td>', 'some vinyetting, make sure you dont pull back the zoom to much when using a telephoto lens. otherwise nice depth of fieldThe Vinyetting in the corners hurts you though', '2002-07-15 03:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90025, 3429, 327, '<td valign="top">Real good capture, composition. Very nice, maybe could of been a bit lighter but wonderful shot. Kee</td>', 'Real good capture, composition. Very nice, maybe could of been a bit lighter but wonderful shot. Kee', '2002-07-15 05:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90026, 3429, 1330, '<td valign="top">Feels slightly out of focus but this is a good photo.</td>', 'Feels slightly out of focus but this is a good photo.', '2002-07-15 06:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90027, 3429, 2350, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2002-07-15 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90028, 3429, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice... would''ve love to see the feet though...</td>', 'nice... would''ve love to see the feet though...', '2002-07-15 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90029, 3429, 2373, '<td valign="top">really nice!!</td>', 'really nice!!', '2002-07-15 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90030, 3429, 308, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I was down on the Outer Banks about a month and a half ago and I took a ride through Corolla and the beach area and saw all of the horses.  So beautiful.  To get them posed like this is even better!  One of my favorites this week, but it would be even better if the feet weren''t cut off at the bottom.  I love the photo, though!</td>', 'Great shot!  I was down on the Outer Banks about a month and a half ago and I took a ride through Corolla and the beach area and saw all of the horses.  So beautiful.  To get them posed like this is even better!  One of my favorites this week, but it would be even better if the feet weren''t cut off at the bottom.  I love the photo, though!', '2002-07-15 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90031, 3429, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo showing the love and protection of a mother. My only issue is the bottom crop that cut off the legs.</td>', 'Beautiful photo showing the love and protection of a mother. My only issue is the bottom crop that cut off the legs.', '2002-07-15 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90032, 3429, 2058, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... the blowing hair really adds a lot of atmosphere.  I think a vertical shot might have worked here, then we could have also seen the feet of the smaller pony.</td>', 'Nice shot... the blowing hair really adds a lot of atmosphere.  I think a vertical shot might have worked here, then we could have also seen the feet of the smaller pony.', '2002-07-15 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90033, 3429, 693, '<td valign="top">this image is definitely the best  "horse" image of the bunch, but you should have included the pony''s feet in the shot.</td>', 'this image is definitely the best  "horse" image of the bunch, but you should have included the pony''s feet in the shot.', '2002-07-15 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90034, 3429, 2146, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, very clear</td>', 'very nice shot, very clear', '2002-07-15 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90035, 3429, 2649, '<td valign="top">Excellent Photo!</td>', 'Excellent Photo!', '2002-07-15 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90036, 3429, 1572, '<td valign="top">Where is this??!!  I want to go there!  GREAT picture!  (''cept for their feet - were they shy about their pedicures?)  Last week I cut off the tip of a fish''s nose in an aquarium just because it was the only chance I had at the shot.  I''m going to give you the benefit of the doubt on this one.  ;)  10 karen_v</td>', 'Where is this??!!  I want to go there!  GREAT picture!  (''cept for their feet - were they shy about their pedicures?)  Last week I cut off the tip of a fish''s nose in an aquarium just because it was the only chance I had at the shot.  I''m going to give you the benefit of the doubt on this one.  ;)  10 karen_v', '2002-07-15 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90037, 3429, 2635, '<td valign="top">i''m from kentucky and i love horses .. good pic</td>', 'i''m from kentucky and i love horses .. good pic', '2002-07-16 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90038, 3429, 2661, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! It''s just so emotional. Not only are the subjects wonderful, but the setting is beautiful, as well as beautifully done.</td>', 'I love this shot! It''s just so emotional. Not only are the subjects wonderful, but the setting is beautiful, as well as beautifully done.', '2002-07-16 03:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90039, 3429, 1042, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of when I lived in Chincoteague and out near Assateague Island, VA.This photo combines my love for horses and the beaches. I did not realize there were wild ponies off the NC coast. I''ll have to get out there. Beautiful shot.   9- KDJohnson</td>', 'This reminds me of when I lived in Chincoteague and out near Assateague Island, VA.This photo combines my love for horses and the beaches. I did not realize there were wild ponies off the NC coast. I''ll have to get out there. Beautiful shot.   9- KDJohnson', '2002-07-16 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90040, 3429, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.... small nit pick the feet have been cut off the pony...I still like this alot, nice job</td>', 'Nice shot.... small nit pick the feet have been cut off the pony...I still like this alot, nice job', '2002-07-16 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90041, 3429, 1569, '<td valign="top">A little bit of fillflash would have helped. The horses faces are a little too dark,otherwise great picture!!!</td>', 'A little bit of fillflash would have helped. The horses faces are a little too dark,otherwise great picture!!!', '2002-07-16 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90042, 3429, 2261, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Good shot.</td>', 'Great composition. Good shot.', '2002-07-16 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90043, 3429, 2011, '<td valign="top">OK, I did a horse pic too, but this is so much better.  Looks like a painting.  If i had anything to add it would be only that I wish you could have gotton all at the bottom of the shot.</td>', 'OK, I did a horse pic too, but this is so much better.  Looks like a painting.  If i had anything to add it would be only that I wish you could have gotton all at the bottom of the shot.', '2002-07-16 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90044, 3429, 1856, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I love the wind in her mane.  I wish the colt''s hooves had made it in the picture.  Were you using an attachment telephoto?  I can see shadows from a tube in the corners.  8 Lisa</td>', 'Great photo.  I love the wind in her mane.  I wish the colt''s hooves had made it in the picture.  Were you using an attachment telephoto?  I can see shadows from a tube in the corners.  8 Lisa', '2002-07-16 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90045, 3429, 1792, '<td valign="top">The windblown look is effective.  Good composition.</td>', 'The windblown look is effective.  Good composition.', '2002-07-16 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90046, 3429, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo... the only think that is keeping me from giving it a 10 is the clip of the feet at the bottom of the frame... great shot! = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo... the only think that is keeping me from giving it a 10 is the clip of the feet at the bottom of the frame... great shot! = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-17 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90047, 3429, 671, '<td valign="top">excellent composistion.</td>', 'excellent composistion.', '2002-07-17 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90048, 3429, 641, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I simply love this</td>', 'Beautiful! I simply love this', '2002-07-17 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90049, 3429, 668, '<td valign="top">pretty in the wild</td>', 'pretty in the wild', '2002-07-17 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90050, 3429, 2717, '<td valign="top">Great Picture!</td>', 'Great Picture!', '2002-07-17 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90051, 3429, 2604, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome picture, I LOVE it!</td>', 'This is an awesome picture, I LOVE it!', '2002-07-17 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90052, 3429, 2195, '<td valign="top">you couldn''t have a better subject than horses..this is great. Off-centering it would help but this is still great--9</td>', 'you couldn''t have a better subject than horses..this is great. Off-centering it would help but this is still great--9', '2002-07-18 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90053, 3429, 1793, '<td valign="top">framing this just 3 inches lower would have made this perfect - the feet of the 2nd horse wouldn''t have been cut off. this is awesome nevertheless  - i like the sky, the wind, and their poses. :-)</td>', 'framing this just 3 inches lower would have made this perfect - the feet of the 2nd horse wouldn''t have been cut off. this is awesome nevertheless  - i like the sky, the wind, and their poses. :-)', '2002-07-18 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90054, 3429, 2785, '<td valign="top">A good pose which would have ben better if the subjects were not so centered and static. The sky is bland and would have benefitted from a CP.</td>', 'A good pose which would have ben better if the subjects were not so centered and static. The sky is bland and would have benefitted from a CP.', '2002-07-18 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90055, 3429, 1280, '<td valign="top">Touching and sweet.  Protective.  I''d like to see more detail in the older horse''s face.  Challenging to say the least with the light environment you''d run the danger of over-exposure.  But still....a little room for improvement.  Good anyway....very good. Hmmmmmm also would like to see the hooves not cut off.</td>', 'Touching and sweet.  Protective.  I''d like to see more detail in the older horse''s face.  Challenging to say the least with the light environment you''d run the danger of over-exposure.  But still....a little room for improvement.  Good anyway....very good. Hmmmmmm also would like to see the hooves not cut off.', '2002-07-19 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90056, 3429, 2777, '<td valign="top">Their feet should be included.</td>', 'Their feet should be included.', '2002-07-19 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90057, 3429, 2798, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful natural windswept look!</td>', 'What a wonderful natural windswept look!', '2002-07-19 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90058, 3429, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of this picture as well as the composition. I''d like to see the horses feet inside the frame though.</td>', 'I like the colors of this picture as well as the composition. I''d like to see the horses feet inside the frame though.', '2002-07-19 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90059, 3429, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  It''s a bit dark, but sweet shot.  8 Swash</td>', 'Wonderful.  It''s a bit dark, but sweet shot.  8 Swash', '2002-07-19 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90060, 3429, 1759, '<td valign="top">This is another of my top picks this week. What excellent posing from your subjects! My only nitpick is the cut-off feet of the colt. Regardless, this is undeniably a great shot.</td>', 'This is another of my top picks this week. What excellent posing from your subjects! My only nitpick is the cut-off feet of the colt. Regardless, this is undeniably a great shot.', '2002-07-20 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90061, 3429, 2172, '<td valign="top">GREAT Photography.  This photo really stands out.  Not just another picture to me.  This is full of emotion.  National Geographic quality.  Excellent work!  Do you do this for a living?   Tremendous work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'GREAT Photography.  This photo really stands out.  Not just another picture to me.  This is full of emotion.  National Geographic quality.  Excellent work!  Do you do this for a living?   Tremendous work.Ruthann', '2002-07-20 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90062, 3429, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition6,<br/>Technical Aspects6,<br/>Meets Challenge10,<br/>Originality7,<br/>Average Score7,<br/>Autool.<br/></td>', 'Composition6,Technical Aspects6,Meets Challenge10,Originality7,Average Score7,Autool.', '2002-07-20 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90063, 3429, 554, '<td valign="top">Perfect! You have a winner here.  10</td>', 'Perfect! You have a winner here.  10', '2002-07-21 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90064, 3429, 616, '<td valign="top">I wish the feet were showing.</td>', 'I wish the feet were showing.', '2002-07-21 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90065, 3429, 2317, '<td valign="top">NIce</td>', 'NIce', '2002-07-21 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90066, 3429, 527, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool photo but I would have liked it better if you didn''t cut off the ponys'' feet.<br/><br/>8  -Tim J</td>', 'It''s a cool photo but I would have liked it better if you didn''t cut off the ponys'' feet.8  -Tim J', '2002-07-21 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90067, 3429, 472, '<td valign="top">these guys are soooo gorgeous. excellent DOF and perfect framing, posing.</td>', 'these guys are soooo gorgeous. excellent DOF and perfect framing, posing.', '2002-07-21 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90068, 3429, 1847, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.  The Outer Banks are a rich source for pictures.  It''s rare to get the ponies in such a photogenic mood.  Good job!</td>', 'Nice pic.  The Outer Banks are a rich source for pictures.  It''s rare to get the ponies in such a photogenic mood.  Good job!', '2002-07-21 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90069, 3429, 661, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  Very warm.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  Very warm.', '2002-07-21 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90070, 3429, 737, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. how close were you?</td>', 'Nice shot. how close were you?', '2002-07-21 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90071, 3429, 2, '<td valign="top">These horses are absolutely beautiful, and your photograph of them really brings out their softness.  I reeally wish both horses had their feet in the shot, and I could definitely do without the barrel distortion.  Did you take any other shots in this session?  Post them in the forums if you would.</td>', 'These horses are absolutely beautiful, and your photograph of them really brings out their softness.  I reeally wish both horses had their feet in the shot, and I could definitely do without the barrel distortion.  Did you take any other shots in this session?  Post them in the forums if you would.', '2002-07-22 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90072, 3429, 921, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for all the wonderful comments, I''m very proud of this photo and consider myself lucky that I was in the right place at the right time to get the opportunity to photograph these wonderful animals. That being said, I have learned a very important lesson, DON''T CUT OFF THE FEET... &amp;lt;grin&amp;gt;. <br/>I will try and post someting to the forums with links to all the pictures I took that day.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for all the wonderful comments, I''m very proud of this photo and consider myself lucky that I was in the right place at the right time to get the opportunity to photograph these wonderful animals. That being said, I have learned a very important lesson, DON''T CUT OFF THE FEET... &lt;grin&gt;. I will try and post someting to the forums with links to all the pictures I took that day.', '2002-07-22 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(90073, 3430, 1944, '<td valign="top">An interesting angle on this flower, but it would have had more impact if it had been in focus.</td>', 'An interesting angle on this flower, but it would have had more impact if it had been in focus.', '2002-07-15 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90074, 3430, 889, '<td valign="top">what is the focus of the picture? the foreground and the background are a bit off focus.</td>', 'what is the focus of the picture? the foreground and the background are a bit off focus.', '2002-07-15 03:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90075, 3430, 2058, '<td valign="top">Good macro.  A bit more sharpness is needed though, and I think if you had moved the green part more to one of the corners, the composition would have been a little bit better.  Overall nice job.</td>', 'Good macro.  A bit more sharpness is needed though, and I think if you had moved the green part more to one of the corners, the composition would have been a little bit better.  Overall nice job.', '2002-07-15 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90076, 3430, 573, '<td valign="top">Nice, another flower shot  :-P<br/>I don''t see the point that is in sharp focus, not that one is always needed, that I like macro shots to have.</td>', 'Nice, another flower shot  :-PI don''t see the point that is in sharp focus, not that one is always needed, that I like macro shots to have.', '2002-07-15 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90077, 3430, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice... I wanted to see stronger colors though... saturate anyone?</td>', 'nice... I wanted to see stronger colors though... saturate anyone?', '2002-07-15 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90078, 3430, 737, '<td valign="top">Looks a little out of focus to me. The area in focus must be dead center.</td>', 'Looks a little out of focus to me. The area in focus must be dead center.', '2002-07-15 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90079, 3430, 327, '<td valign="top">This shot would of worked for _patterns_ too. Lovely yellow but a bit OOF. Kee</td>', 'This shot would of worked for _patterns_ too. Lovely yellow but a bit OOF. Kee', '2002-07-15 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90080, 3430, 1005, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit too close for this camera.  Some petals appear crisp, while others don''t.  Best petals are in upper right corner.  6 Swash</td>', 'Maybe a bit too close for this camera.  Some petals appear crisp, while others don''t.  Best petals are in upper right corner.  6 Swash', '2002-07-15 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90081, 3430, 693, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2002-07-15 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90082, 3430, 714, '<td valign="top">Seems alittle out of focus.  5</td>', 'Seems alittle out of focus.  5', '2002-07-15 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90083, 3430, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the framing and composition on this photo... if there was a bit more focus here, this photo would be really nice! = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I love the framing and composition on this photo... if there was a bit more focus here, this photo would be really nice! = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-15 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90084, 3430, 2158, '<td valign="top">Not really in focus.</td>', 'Not really in focus.', '2002-07-15 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90085, 3430, 1877, '<td valign="top">I like the colors.. and the fact the flower isn''t in the center.. nice job, 6</td>', 'I like the colors.. and the fact the flower isn''t in the center.. nice job, 6', '2002-07-16 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90086, 3430, 806, '<td valign="top">How beautiful this would be if it were in focus!</td>', 'How beautiful this would be if it were in focus!', '2002-07-16 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90087, 3430, 656, '<td valign="top">focus isn''t quite sharp enough for this sort of shot.  Might be better ''rotated'' slightly so the petals fan to a corner, rather than across the image ?</td>', 'focus isn''t quite sharp enough for this sort of shot.  Might be better ''rotated'' slightly so the petals fan to a corner, rather than across the image ?', '2002-07-16 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90088, 3430, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and color, but the focus is just not there.</td>', 'Very nice composition and color, but the focus is just not there.', '2002-07-16 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
