(90230, 3434, 2004, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant, but I find the reflexion (?) on the bottom of the pot disturbing.</td>', 'Simple and elegant, but I find the reflexion (?) on the bottom of the pot disturbing.', '2002-07-16 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
