(90245, 3434, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  Simple, refreshing.  I like the black background contrasting the white bowl.  Of course the strawberry color is divine.  The one thing I''d do to improve this would be to wet the berries.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  Simple, refreshing.  I like the black background contrasting the white bowl.  Of course the strawberry color is divine.  The one thing I''d do to improve this would be to wet the berries.', '2002-07-19 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
