(90252, 3435, 2058, '<td valign="top">Parts of the insect seem a bit fuzzy, but I like how you fill the frame.  Too bad the bug had a torn wing.  Bugs are hard to catch but maybe a bit different angle too, though I dont really have suggestions on what would look good or not.</td>', 'Parts of the insect seem a bit fuzzy, but I like how you fill the frame.  Too bad the bug had a torn wing.  Bugs are hard to catch but maybe a bit different angle too, though I dont really have suggestions on what would look good or not.', '2002-07-15 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
