(90259, 3435, 573, '<td valign="top">I''m sure glad he''s your Thing and not mine  ;-)<br/>Color, focus , depth of field, composition all good.   a slight change of camers angle could hace fixed the distracting red behind the Things''s left wing, IMO.</td>', 'I''m sure glad he''s your Thing and not mine  ;-)Color, focus , depth of field, composition all good.   a slight change of camers angle could hace fixed the distracting red behind the Things''s left wing, IMO.', '2002-07-15 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90260, 3435, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nice shot--interesting damaged wing!!</td>', 'Nice shot--interesting damaged wing!!', '2002-07-16 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90261, 3435, 714, '<td valign="top">Cool, they sure are hard to photograph.  8</td>', 'Cool, they sure are hard to photograph.  8', '2002-07-16 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90262, 3435, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent Macro!  I''m jealous.</td>', 'Excellent Macro!  I''m jealous.', '2002-07-16 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90263, 3435, 1041, '<td valign="top">bug acrobatics - pretty impressive.  i know you have to grab these shots as the opportunity presents itself, but the background is a little distracting in the top right, especially since much of the rest is evenly white (except for the blurry leaf at the bottom).  the bug is great, could be a tad more sharp i think. -- gr8photos (6)</td>', 'bug acrobatics - pretty impressive.  i know you have to grab these shots as the opportunity presents itself, but the background is a little distracting in the top right, especially since much of the rest is evenly white (except for the blurry leaf at the bottom).  the bug is great, could be a tad more sharp i think. -- gr8photos (6)', '2002-07-17 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90264, 3435, 2650, '<td valign="top">even caught the broken wing.</td>', 'even caught the broken wing.', '2002-07-17 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90265, 3435, 2334, '<td valign="top">great detail. i can see the hairs and whatnot, but it would''ve been a lot better if you had gotten the head of this lil guy in focus.</td>', 'great detail. i can see the hairs and whatnot, but it would''ve been a lot better if you had gotten the head of this lil guy in focus.', '2002-07-17 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90266, 3435, 2256, '<td valign="top">Man are they ugly up close! Now I know why God made them so small!  This is a great shot!</td>', 'Man are they ugly up close! Now I know why God made them so small!  This is a great shot!', '2002-07-17 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
