(90274, 3435, 1005, '<td valign="top">Bizarre dragon fly!  I know this was a "shot of opportunity", but you needed a wider depth of field for this close.  (The wings are too cool to let fad out of focus)<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Bizarre dragon fly!  I know this was a "shot of opportunity", but you needed a wider depth of field for this close.  (The wings are too cool to let fad out of focus)7 Swash', '2002-07-18 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
