(90277, 3435, 2109, '<td valign="top">do you think it appreciates being called a "thing"?  Thats alright... I don''t know what it is either ;)  nice shot</td>', 'do you think it appreciates being called a "thing"?  Thats alright... I don''t know what it is either ;)  nice shot', '2002-07-19 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
