(90413, 3440, 2188, '<td valign="top">I spent two hours doing this when I first played with the manual mode on my Canon a40. Laughed my ass off.</td>', 'I spent two hours doing this when I first played with the manual mode on my Canon a40. Laughed my ass off.', '2002-07-22 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90414, 3440, 668, '<td valign="top">cant believe this rated so low...</td>', 'cant believe this rated so low...', '2002-07-22 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(90415, 3442, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice Lily with nice colors. Kee</td>', 'Nice Lily with nice colors. Kee', '2002-07-15 05:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90416, 3442, 1944, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of your photo very much. The aspect you used however, would require a very high depth of field, and I think you shot yourself in the foot by allowing the focus point to go too deep. The petal in the front is blurred, which to me is distracting, and the part that should be out of focus, the flower to the rear at the bottom left is too sharp.</td>', 'I like the colors of your photo very much. The aspect you used however, would require a very high depth of field, and I think you shot yourself in the foot by allowing the focus point to go too deep. The petal in the front is blurred, which to me is distracting, and the part that should be out of focus, the flower to the rear at the bottom left is too sharp.', '2002-07-15 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90417, 3442, 92, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful flower. A little more DOF to blur the b/g area would help. The crop should not cut off the stems on top.</td>', 'Such a beautiful flower. A little more DOF to blur the b/g area would help. The crop should not cut off the stems on top.', '2002-07-15 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90418, 3442, 2058, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot... unique looking flower, and I like the color and detail.</td>', 'Very nice shot... unique looking flower, and I like the color and detail.', '2002-07-15 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90419, 3442, 2146, '<td valign="top">very pretty colors....</td>', 'very pretty colors....', '2002-07-15 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90420, 3442, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m not much of a "flower shot" person, but I like this.  The color is great.</td>', 'I''m not much of a "flower shot" person, but I like this.  The color is great.', '2002-07-15 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90421, 3442, 2661, '<td valign="top">nice colors and composition. this is a really pretty flower and a really pretty photograph.</td>', 'nice colors and composition. this is a really pretty flower and a really pretty photograph.', '2002-07-16 03:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90422, 3442, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the color in this image... I think I would like this one better if the flower was positioned in the lower portion of the frame with a little more depth of field possibly... good shot :) = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I love the color in this image... I think I would like this one better if the flower was positioned in the lower portion of the frame with a little more depth of field possibly... good shot :) = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 07:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90423, 3442, 573, '<td valign="top">Wow another flower photo.  I am about a third of the way through voting at this point and I must have looked at a dozen flower photos so far.  And for the most part they are all well executed photographs as is yours.</td>', 'Wow another flower photo.  I am about a third of the way through voting at this point and I must have looked at a dozen flower photos so far.  And for the most part they are all well executed photographs as is yours.', '2002-07-16 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90424, 3442, 2373, '<td valign="top">beutiful, I noticed thered part of the flower that is on top is out of focus, otherwise really nice shot.</td>', 'beutiful, I noticed thered part of the flower that is on top is out of focus, otherwise really nice shot.', '2002-07-16 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90425, 3442, 1403, '<td valign="top">interesting angle. nice colors. even though im not a pretty flower person, this one seems different</td>', 'interesting angle. nice colors. even though im not a pretty flower person, this one seems different', '2002-07-16 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90426, 3442, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and color, but personally want more DOF so more (not necessarily all) of the flower''s in focus. And unless there''s something undesirable at the top, I''s move the crop upwards so the sides and bottom are cropped, not the top.</td>', 'I like the composition and color, but personally want more DOF so more (not necessarily all) of the flower''s in focus. And unless there''s something undesirable at the top, I''s move the crop upwards so the sides and bottom are cropped, not the top.', '2002-07-17 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90427, 3442, 2437, '<td valign="top">nice shot...</td>', 'nice shot...', '2002-07-17 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90428, 3442, 1041, '<td valign="top">this would work for texture, too, wouldn''t it.  i love lilies.  it''s a shame you cropped off the top of the stamen (sp?), i think having them all the way in the shot would''ve really added to the shot.  i do like the DOF you used, having the petal in the foreground slightly blurry works well. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'this would work for texture, too, wouldn''t it.  i love lilies.  it''s a shame you cropped off the top of the stamen (sp?), i think having them all the way in the shot would''ve really added to the shot.  i do like the DOF you used, having the petal in the foreground slightly blurry works well. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-07-17 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90429, 3442, 2334, '<td valign="top">wow. great angle. i like how the petals pull you from the outside into the center.</td>', 'wow. great angle. i like how the petals pull you from the outside into the center.', '2002-07-17 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90430, 3442, 671, '<td valign="top">good cropping.</td>', 'good cropping.', '2002-07-17 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90431, 3442, 1003, '<td valign="top">IMHO-would be better with all the flower in the photo-and maybe some more focus</td>', 'IMHO-would be better with all the flower in the photo-and maybe some more focus', '2002-07-17 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90432, 3442, 2275, '<td valign="top">great shot bright colors</td>', 'great shot bright colors', '2002-07-17 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90433, 3442, 2481, '<td valign="top">nice colors, good closeup</td>', 'nice colors, good closeup', '2002-07-18 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90434, 3442, 2777, '<td valign="top">It is strangely cut on the top</td>', 'It is strangely cut on the top', '2002-07-19 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90435, 3442, 1175, '<td valign="top">Great DOF.</td>', 'Great DOF.', '2002-07-19 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90436, 3442, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty darn nice, but I''m not crazy about the depth of field issues.  The flower is not flat, so is a difficult macro.  Not too crazy about the cropping either.  5 Swash</td>', 'Pretty darn nice, but I''m not crazy about the depth of field issues.  The flower is not flat, so is a difficult macro.  Not too crazy about the cropping either.  5 Swash', '2002-07-19 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90437, 3442, 2801, '<td valign="top">DOF too shallow. nice crop</td>', 'DOF too shallow. nice crop', '2002-07-20 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90438, 3442, 1019, '<td valign="top">Lovely crisp image</td>', 'Lovely crisp image', '2002-07-20 04:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90439, 3442, 2752, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2002-07-20 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90440, 3442, 2641, '<td valign="top">nice shot!</td>', 'nice shot!', '2002-07-21 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90441, 3442, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good color and saturation. However, I don''t think the composition fully works. No problem cutting off some petals, in fact that can help bring attention to the stamen and anchors the flower to the frame, but cutting off the stamen makes the flower seem incomplete because there is no single part that we can see in it''s entirety. Because the petal in the foreground is out of focus, the viewer tends to take this as a visual clue that the petals are not the main subject. I think it would be better composed lower in the frame with the stamen coming up to the top.</td>', 'Good color and saturation. However, I don''t think the composition fully works. No problem cutting off some petals, in fact that can help bring attention to the stamen and anchors the flower to the frame, but cutting off the stamen makes the flower seem incomplete because there is no single part that we can see in it''s entirety. Because the petal in the foreground is out of focus, the viewer tends to take this as a visual clue that the petals are not the main subject. I think it would be better composed lower in the frame with the stamen coming up to the top.', '2002-07-21 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90442, 3442, 2810, '<td valign="top">I have the same problem trying to capture 3D and staying in focus on everything.</td>', 'I have the same problem trying to capture 3D and staying in focus on everything.', '2002-07-21 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90443, 3442, 2, '<td valign="top">I swear to you I took almost this same shot :)  What an amazlingly interesting flower.  Check this out: //www.pbase.com/image/3265476  :)</td>', 'I swear to you I took almost this same shot :)  What an amazlingly interesting flower.  Check this out: //www.pbase.com/image/3265476  :)', '2002-07-22 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90444, 3443, 2058, '<td valign="top">Nice insect on flower shot... I think if you had cropped or zoomed in a bit more, it would look a little better.  The small fly on the upper right is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Nice insect on flower shot... I think if you had cropped or zoomed in a bit more, it would look a little better.  The small fly on the upper right is somewhat distracting.', '2002-07-15 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90445, 3443, 2373, '<td valign="top">I like this macro but i would like to see a less flawed flower.</td>', 'I like this macro but i would like to see a less flawed flower.', '2002-07-15 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90446, 3443, 737, '<td valign="top">Actually, two bugs. But good job.</td>', 'Actually, two bugs. But good job.', '2002-07-15 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90447, 3443, 327, '<td valign="top">Title should say with BUGS! Nice color. Like this lily. Kee</td>', 'Title should say with BUGS! Nice color. Like this lily. Kee', '2002-07-15 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90448, 3443, 2146, '<td valign="top">very nice shot...well focused..well framed</td>', 'very nice shot...well focused..well framed', '2002-07-15 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90449, 3443, 1569, '<td valign="top">The dead part of the flower and the other bugs should be cropped out.This would give more attention the the goggle eyed bug-which I think is the most interesting part of the photo.</td>', 'The dead part of the flower and the other bugs should be cropped out.This would give more attention the the goggle eyed bug-which I think is the most interesting part of the photo.', '2002-07-16 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90450, 3443, 313, '<td valign="top">hello.  i see TWO bugs.  please try to be more accurate with your titles; a work of art is only as good as its title.</td>', 'hello.  i see TWO bugs.  please try to be more accurate with your titles; a work of art is only as good as its title.', '2002-07-16 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90451, 3443, 1403, '<td valign="top">ive seen way too many insect and flower closeups today</td>', 'ive seen way too many insect and flower closeups today', '2002-07-16 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90452, 3443, 772, '<td valign="top">nice shot!  I would like this image much better if it was cropped a little tighter to bring the bug in as a larger part of the image... it would also help remove some of the background ''noise'' in the image... good shot! = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice shot!  I would like this image much better if it was cropped a little tighter to bring the bug in as a larger part of the image... it would also help remove some of the background ''noise'' in the image... good shot! = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90453, 3443, 2334, '<td valign="top">eww.. bugs.</td>', 'eww.. bugs.', '2002-07-17 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90454, 3443, 1707, '<td valign="top">with bug(s)</td>', 'with bug(s)', '2002-07-18 05:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90455, 3443, 2481, '<td valign="top">nice colors, insect purple against flower yellow</td>', 'nice colors, insect purple against flower yellow', '2002-07-18 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90456, 3443, 587, '<td valign="top">Your photo is really busy perhaps a tad too busy for me. ; brown dead parts, moth/butterfly, little flies, flower itself is wilting, I wish you hadn''t cropped out most of the flower, feels a bit crowded. The color though is wonderful. good job. 4 cthenk</td>', 'Your photo is really busy perhaps a tad too busy for me. ; brown dead parts, moth/butterfly, little flies, flower itself is wilting, I wish you hadn''t cropped out most of the flower, feels a bit crowded. The color though is wonderful. good job. 4 cthenk', '2002-07-18 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90457, 3443, 1005, '<td valign="top">Technically, that''s bugs (a little one on the outer edge)  THE bug is a type of moth or butterfly, very common, but don''t know the name, either.  The daylily is getting towards the end of it''s day.  The butterfly is on the darker side.  6 Swash</td>', 'Technically, that''s bugs (a little one on the outer edge)  THE bug is a type of moth or butterfly, very common, but don''t know the name, either.  The daylily is getting towards the end of it''s day.  The butterfly is on the darker side.  6 Swash', '2002-07-18 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90458, 3443, 2172, '<td valign="top">Good coloring, image quality, dof.  Great image.  Good work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Good coloring, image quality, dof.  Great image.  Good work.Ruthann', '2002-07-20 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90459, 3443, 2783, '<td valign="top">Very colorful<br/>-8</td>', 'Very colorful-8', '2002-07-20 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90460, 3443, 1759, '<td valign="top">You mean with bugs (plural) right? I find this a good composition that could use some additional sharpening.</td>', 'You mean with bugs (plural) right? I find this a good composition that could use some additional sharpening.', '2002-07-20 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90461, 3443, 2752, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2002-07-21 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90462, 3443, 2317, '<td valign="top">Try to use more quality subjects</td>', 'Try to use more quality subjects', '2002-07-21 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90463, 3443, 308, '<td valign="top">Great DOF.  Very sharp.</td>', 'Great DOF.  Very sharp.', '2002-07-21 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90464, 3444, 2058, '<td valign="top">I think that wastebasket in the foreground adds something to the image.  It would have been nice if the glare from the streetlamps wasn''t there though.</td>', 'I think that wastebasket in the foreground adds something to the image.  It would have been nice if the glare from the streetlamps wasn''t there though.', '2002-07-15 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90465, 3444, 737, '<td valign="top">Good use of light. I would have liked to have seen a major subject beanth them. Still OK.</td>', 'Good use of light. I would have liked to have seen a major subject beanth them. Still OK.', '2002-07-15 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90466, 3444, 327, '<td valign="top">Telling title.</td>', 'Telling title.', '2002-07-15 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90467, 3444, 772, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a little more ''distinct'' subject.. this photo leaves me wondering what the intention is... = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I would like to see a little more ''distinct'' subject.. this photo leaves me wondering what the intention is... = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-16 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90468, 3444, 714, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more detail other then the ground and trash can.  5</td>', 'I would like to see more detail other then the ground and trash can.  5', '2002-07-16 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90469, 3444, 2158, '<td valign="top">You should have changed your position slightly.  That rubbish bin in the foreground isn''t very attractive.</td>', 'You should have changed your position slightly.  That rubbish bin in the foreground isn''t very attractive.', '2002-07-16 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90470, 3444, 2200, '<td valign="top">nice night shot. good exposure</td>', 'nice night shot. good exposure', '2002-07-16 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90471, 3444, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Depth and lighting are nicely done.</td>', 'Good composition.  Depth and lighting are nicely done.', '2002-07-16 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90472, 3444, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good focus, good lighting.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good focus, good lighting.', '2002-07-17 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90473, 3444, 671, '<td valign="top">great lighting,  good composition.  Needs more of a focal point, though.</td>', 'great lighting,  good composition.  Needs more of a focal point, though.', '2002-07-17 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90474, 3444, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  Isn''t that the McDonald''s statue from last week?  (Just kidding!)  Kinda tossed about the starring of the nearest street lights.  It overwhelms the foreground a bit, but a star filter would have been too busy.  7 Swash</td>', 'Interesting concept.  Isn''t that the McDonald''s statue from last week?  (Just kidding!)  Kinda tossed about the starring of the nearest street lights.  It overwhelms the foreground a bit, but a star filter would have been too busy.  7 Swash', '2002-07-17 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90475, 3444, 587, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting those big lights create but I hate to have to look at them. When I make it so that they are just out of the photo (just to the top of the sign on post) it helps me focus on the things in the photo, not just the lights. good job. cthenk</td>', 'I like the lighting those big lights create but I hate to have to look at them. When I make it so that they are just out of the photo (just to the top of the sign on post) it helps me focus on the things in the photo, not just the lights. good job. cthenk', '2002-07-18 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90476, 3444, 637, '<td valign="top">I like it... and I''d like it better if there wasn''t so much empty pavement in the foreground... 5 sjgleah</td>', 'I like it... and I''d like it better if there wasn''t so much empty pavement in the foreground... 5 sjgleah', '2002-07-19 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90477, 3444, 640, '<td valign="top">focus</td>', 'focus', '2002-07-19 04:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90478, 3444, 2777, '<td valign="top">Detail of the basket and its shadow looks most interesting - maybe with different composition, giving more emphasys to that detail would improve image.</td>', 'Detail of the basket and its shadow looks most interesting - maybe with different composition, giving more emphasys to that detail would improve image.', '2002-07-19 07:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90479, 3444, 2783, '<td valign="top">Dismal but good<br/>-9</td>', 'Dismal but good-9', '2002-07-20 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90480, 3444, 2752, '<td valign="top">great night shot</td>', 'great night shot', '2002-07-21 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90481, 3444, 1280, '<td valign="top">no real focal point other than the trash can.</td>', 'no real focal point other than the trash can.', '2002-07-21 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90482, 3444, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I love the title as well.  I''m not sure why you chose to tilt the shot though. 6-ClubJuggle</td>', 'Nicely done, I love the title as well.  I''m not sure why you chose to tilt the shot though. 6-ClubJuggle', '2002-07-21 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90483, 3444, 811, '<td valign="top">this is a very well done, crisp night shot.  I think, though, I would have tried to frame it a little differently in relation to the street lamp.  It seems to be leaning a little to the right to me, and having part of a light cropped out makes it look like an accident.  Excellent commentary.   Hope others know what a street chemist is. :-)</td>', 'this is a very well done, crisp night shot.  I think, though, I would have tried to frame it a little differently in relation to the street lamp.  It seems to be leaning a little to the right to me, and having part of a light cropped out makes it look like an accident.  Excellent commentary.   Hope others know what a street chemist is. :-)', '2002-07-21 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90484, 3444, 1078, '<td valign="top">First, I don''t really understand the title -- part of me wonders if this is where a bomb has gone off.  If so, this picture may means something to the people in the area but it doesn''t seem like there''s anything in the shot to identify it to outsiders.  I''d like to see something play a more dominant role in the photogrpah regardless.  The lamps are cool -- and I think you might be able to do something cool with the trashcan.</td>', 'First, I don''t really understand the title -- part of me wonders if this is where a bomb has gone off.  If so, this picture may means something to the people in the area but it doesn''t seem like there''s anything in the shot to identify it to outsiders.  I''d like to see something play a more dominant role in the photogrpah regardless.  The lamps are cool -- and I think you might be able to do something cool with the trashcan.', '2002-07-21 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90485, 3444, 210, '<td valign="top">Agreeing with Karmat, I don''t know how many people know what I meant by the Urban Chemist, but in short, it''s a drug dealer.  And in the village surrounding Washington Square Park, it''s nothing short of a Chemist Shop.</td>', 'Agreeing with Karmat, I don''t know how many people know what I meant by the Urban Chemist, but in short, it''s a drug dealer.  And in the village surrounding Washington Square Park, it''s nothing short of a Chemist Shop.', '2002-07-22 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(90486, 3445, 2058, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good composition.  I like the contrast between the rough ocean and the calm pool.  The bright green is a bit distracting but you still have a nice picture here.</td>', 'Nice shot, good composition.  I like the contrast between the rough ocean and the calm pool.  The bright green is a bit distracting but you still have a nice picture here.', '2002-07-15 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90487, 3445, 2719, '<td valign="top">Great, but looks too digital (pixilated).</td>', 'Great, but looks too digital (pixilated).', '2002-07-15 07:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90488, 3445, 133, '<td valign="top">A nice reflection.</td>', 'A nice reflection.', '2002-07-15 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90489, 3445, 1175, '<td valign="top">Its technically alright but not the most exciting in the world.  Would have enjoyed seeing more color in the sky.</td>', 'Its technically alright but not the most exciting in the world.  Would have enjoyed seeing more color in the sky.', '2002-07-15 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1);
