(90519, 3445, 2172, '<td valign="top">Excellllent!  Really great photography  - artistic.  I like how the pool area is calm, yet you can see the waves beyond the land.  I love when you can just barely tell which side is up.   The only thing (could just be my screen) is that I am detecting some noise in the clouds and the reflections of the clouds - but may be purposeful.  Either way - Really wonderful work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Excellllent!  Really great photography  - artistic.  I like how the pool area is calm, yet you can see the waves beyond the land.  I love when you can just barely tell which side is up.   The only thing (could just be my screen) is that I am detecting some noise in the clouds and the reflections of the clouds - but may be purposeful.  Either way - Really wonderful work.Ruthann', '2002-07-19 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
