(90635, 3448, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this, and the black silhouette of the plants really frames it well, I think.  The only thing that is wrong with it to me is the black thing (a stump or something maybe) in the water.  If you had moved a partial step to the left, you may have been able to miss it.  Very minor detail.  I really like this.</td>', 'I love the colors in this, and the black silhouette of the plants really frames it well, I think.  The only thing that is wrong with it to me is the black thing (a stump or something maybe) in the water.  If you had moved a partial step to the left, you may have been able to miss it.  Very minor detail.  I really like this.', '2002-07-20 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90636, 3448, 2783, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo. I don''t think I would have changed a thing, although that bush seems like it''s in the way<br/>-10</td>', 'Very cool photo. I don''t think I would have changed a thing, although that bush seems like it''s in the way-10', '2002-07-20 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
