(90640, 3448, 1759, '<td valign="top">I usually find sunset photos somewhat mundane, but this is very nice. I love how you framed the sunset between the foliage. It makes the photo unique, original, and artistic.</td>', 'I usually find sunset photos somewhat mundane, but this is very nice. I love how you framed the sunset between the foliage. It makes the photo unique, original, and artistic.', '2002-07-21 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90641, 3448, 472, '<td valign="top">great colors</td>', 'great colors', '2002-07-21 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(90642, 3448, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice framing of the sun.  I think you might have been able to crop this it 427 instead of 480 and lost some of the information along the bottom of the pic.  The water and sihlouette are good, don''t get me wrong, I just think maybe you don''t need quite so much of them.  In fact, I wonder what the sky looks like above what''s in the current picture.  Maybe you could have composed this so the horizon was 1/3 of the way up from the bottom instead?</td>', 'Nice framing of the sun.  I think you might have been able to crop this it 427 instead of 480 and lost some of the information along the bottom of the pic.  The water and sihlouette are good, don''t get me wrong, I just think maybe you don''t need quite so much of them.  In fact, I wonder what the sky looks like above what''s in the current picture.  Maybe you could have composed this so the horizon was 1/3 of the way up from the bottom instead?', '2002-07-21 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
