(172101, 3390, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love partriotism and the American Flag.  I also love it in color.  I would love to see this in color.  As for the 48 star flag, I''d love to get my hands on one of them.  My last one wore out.  Don''t let anyone put you down on this photo.  It is fantastic and has a wonderful subject. PTL